WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.630
'All of a sudden,
all three of them were dead.'

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.770
'Hey, how can you say it
effortlessly?'

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.590
'Do you know how big
an issue this is?'

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.070
'This is not just a problem
within our hospital.'

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.630
'This is a national-level problem.
Okay?'

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.300
'If a mother shows hatred
on her child...'

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.320
'Do you know how that child
feels like?'

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.180
'I must know the reason
behind all this, sir.'

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.200
'This girl is pregnant.'

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.840
'Let her give birth to the child,
sir.'

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.030
'At this age?'

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.070
'Let our children go
to school or college.'

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.140
'Let them finish everything, sir.'

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.000
'Then, we can get them married.'

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:34.610
'They didn't discuss supporting us.'

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:37.840
'They spoke only for their sake
to get out of this problem.'

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.420
'I'll leave from here tonight.'

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.290
'Tomorrow morning,
we will leave from there.'

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:46.440
'Radhi, your mother has already
left us alone.'

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.670
'You also have the thought
of leaving me alone?'

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.770
'We will leave this town,
people and everything behind.'

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:51.710
'Come, dear.'

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:52.970
'Is Dr. Radhi here?'

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.450
'She is leaving.'

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:56.030
'Radhi!'

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:10.610
Can you remember me?

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:16.790
You look exactly the same
as you did in school.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.320
As seen at school..

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:21.200
Just like that.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:24.070
What are you doing here?

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:27.000
Actually, I know you work here.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.410
Your reputation precedes
up to Mumbai.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.740
I am not following you.

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:34.340
Universe did that part.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.580
Medical Council sent me
here to investigate.

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.790
I'm just following orders.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.140
Oh!

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:42.010
Right.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.080
It's good for you
if you follow only the orders.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:47.990
I must tell you.

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:49.660
You look very pretty.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.560
Is this also in your orders?

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:54.970
Look here, Vijay.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.740
Just do what you came here for.

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:59.590
Do your business and leave.

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:01.680
Yeah.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:04.150
That's good for you and me.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:06.160
Just giving you a compliment.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.190
Sir, are you Vijay sir?

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.050
Hi, sir.
I'm Pavi.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:21.100
Arjun sir is waiting for you
in the cabin.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.030
Sure, I'm coming.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:22.520
Okay, sir.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:30.090
Arjun.

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:31.070
Come in.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:34.490
Hi, Arjun.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.440
I'm Vijay.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:37.770
I know, Doctor.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.800
Arjun, the CEO of the hospital.
Please.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.600
You were supposed to come
two days ago?

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.350
Yeah, it got delayed.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.740
I had to shift my flight.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.860
Can we get to the case?

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:49.960
Yeah, sure.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:54.030
A few days back, three athletes
were admitted to the hospital.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.090
We checked and found drug overdose.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.250
We stabilised them.

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:58.640
But.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:00.810
Their coach didn't want
to make this an issue.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.300
And did not
want to file a complaint.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:03.610
So we did not file any complaint.

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:04.980
I know..

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:07.200
This is a big mistake
and I understand it now.

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:10.410
But we do not want their career
to get spoiled.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:11.970
As their coach asked..

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:13.780
we had to hide that fact.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.250
I understand.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.040
You do not have to jump
to any conclusions.

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.070
That's why I came here.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:18.840
Sure.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:20.410
Make yourself comfortable, Doctor.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.160
In this file, you have
the patient's information, right?

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:24.690
Yeah.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.990
I need the list of doctors
who attended these patients.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:30.310
Not only the list, their background
and all employee records, yeah?

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.860
Sure, Doctor.
Just a minute.

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:38.070
Aruna, give the doctor's list
who handled the athlete's case.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.360
And the employee files.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.690
Give all this to the investigative
officer Vijay.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:43.590
'Okay, Arjun. Right now?'

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:44.510
Yeah.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.500
'Okay.'

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.640
Yeah, thank you.

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:49.290
Those files will be given to you,
Doctor.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:52.710
Got it. I'll take some rest today
and start working on this case.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.560
Sure.
- Sure. Thank you.

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:55.720
Okay, Doctor.
Thank you.

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:03.740
What's up, Divi?

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.380
Homework?

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:06.730
No, Mom.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:07.960
I'm getting bored.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.770
That's why
I am doing some maths sums.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:10.800
Bored?

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:12.420
Where's Sid?

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.360
Sid?

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:14.400
Mom.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.780
Dad did not tell you anything?

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.000
What happened?

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:20.260
Nothing.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.320
All of a sudden,
Sid started crying.

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:23.820
He wanted to see dad.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:25.810
That's why I called dad.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.630
He took Sid with him.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:30.310
He said he wanted
to sleep with Sid tonight.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.430
How could he take Sid?
- Mom!

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:34.700
Just for a day, Mom.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.380
Let him stay with dad.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.940
I thought dad would have told you.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.180
He did not tell me anything.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.200
Okay, I'll talk to him later.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.120
If you did not have homework.
You can go to sleep.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:50.280
As Sid was not here..

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:52.690
That's why I was scared
to sleep alone.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.410
Mom, can I sleep
with you tonight?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.320
Okay, come.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.490
Mom.
- Yes.

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:13.060
When will this problem be solved?

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:18.020
I don't know, Divi.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.890
But, it's not going
to be solved now.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:49.730
Good morning, Nilofer.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:50.680
Good morning.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.620
Hey, what is it?

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:16.360
Everyone is so tense here.

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:18.280
There is a big issue going
on in the hospital.

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.220
What if they close
the hospital and seal it?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.490
I don't know what to do.
I am so worried.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:24.070
You are sitting here and looking
at your phone.

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:26.370
Why are you getting tense now?

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.380
Chill.
What happened to you?

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.440
Oh, that.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.460
I am fed up of coming
to the hospital in the morning.

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:33.490
After coming across all those
traffic problems..

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.960
When I see you sitting here and
having fun by looking at your phone

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.230
I am very upset.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.140
Okay,
what are you looking at in that?

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.210
Oh, that.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.430
To investigate the issue going
on in our hospital.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:46.080
A Doctor was sent
by the medical council.

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.260
Yes, Dr. Vijay.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:48.880
Yes, he is the one.

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:51.020
He is very handsome, right?

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:53.660
Hey, when did you see him?

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.180
I didn't see him.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.770
It's all research.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:59.480
What is your age and his age?

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:01.540
Hey, come here.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.170
Look here.
How many awards?

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:09.080
He has his own website for himself
and a separate list for the awards.

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.180
So, what?

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:12.160
Look here.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:13.500
This is his social media.

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:17.020
He is at the party, along
with the girls. Isn't it very cool?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.410
He is still having fun at this age.

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:21.150
What fun?

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.560
If I have that much money,
I will also be having fun.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:24.650
Yes, yes.

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:26.950
If there is a solution for this
hospital's problem.

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.670
That's enough for me.
- Same here.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:33.740
By the way, how did you
find out his profile so soon?

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:35.730
That was very easy for me.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:36.700
Hey, guys.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:38.560
Come.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:39.860
Hey.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:43.280
Rocky, I am getting late for the
morning routine at the patient ward.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.380
I will leave now.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.790
She was sitting idle all this time.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:49.750
She is saying that
she has work now?

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:55.070
Rocky, can you do me a favour?
- Tell me.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.360
Actually, I have a small problem
with Nilofer.

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:01.230
Tell me.
What is your problem?

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.640
It's nothing..

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:04.310
She said something..

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.410
I misunderstood it
and I have spoken to her harshly.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.910
It has become a mess between
me and her, Rocky.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.150
If you talk so clearly.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.860
Your plan will never workout
in this life.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:17.480
I know.
- You know?

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:18.960
That's why I have come to you.

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:20.300
Please, Rocky.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.160
You are helping everyone, right?

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.380
Help me too.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.860
Why are you doing this to me?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.850
Everyone has a girlfriend
in this hospital.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:32.140
But my girlfriend is alone
in Bangalore.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.250
Does he have a girlfriend?

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:33.920
Hey!

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:35.700
Ma'am, look at this.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.460
No, not this, Teju.

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.120
Excuse me, ma'am.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.570
Ma'am, you had asked
for the athletes' files?

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.020
The council has taken over
the original files, ma'am.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.190
These are duplicate copies, ma'am.
It was digital.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:52.770
Oh!
Okay.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.850
Thanks, Reena.
This will do.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.130
And..
- Yes, ma'am.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.440
Reena,
I wanted to tell you something.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.610
Teju, from now on,
you handle the athlete's case.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:06.360
Reena, from now on, you do not
have to handle that case.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.870
You are relieved from that case
from now on.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.010
But, ma'am, I am handling
this case from the beginning.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:13.900
Why, Reena?

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:16.850
You already have a lot of cases
to handle.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.940
And why do you want to stress
yourself?

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.220
Ma'am..
- Teju, read these files thoroughly.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:23.930
You are going to handle
this case during the investigation.

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:26.040
So, study everything.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:31.160
You guys can leave now.
- Come.

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.700
I don't understand.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.630
What don't you understand?

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:47.480
Why did Radhi ma'am suddenly
dismissed me from this case?

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:51.880
No, no. I am not wondering
why she gave it to you.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:55.100
I am wondering why she
dismissed me from this case.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.210
I feel that she is doing something
good for you.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.880
In this case or any other
complications from this case..

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.380
She might have thought
that you should not get caught.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:04.540
Are you mocking me?

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.570
When did she have any concern
for me?

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:11.230
It does not seem like she is saying
it out of concern for me.

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:14.220
There must be some other reason.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:15.570
Okay, leave that.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.440
Did you enquire about the
Doctor from the medical council?

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.180
Entire hospital is talking
about him.

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:22.040
Yes, yes.
I heard about him.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.780
It seems that he is very handsome.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:25.460
And he parties a lot.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:26.750
A lot of girls, too.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.110
But I do not know why, Teju.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:32.390
I don't have any hype to work
with him.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.810
Something is off.

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.240
I think this is why Radhi ma'am
dismissed you from this case.

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:40.700
No, it's not like that.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.720
You keep on talking unnecessarily.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:45.040
I have a lot of work.
I am leaving. You!

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:48.640
Hello.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:50.390
Enter your name, sir.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:51.870
They will call you when
the token number comes.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:55.320
I will enter my name but,
I am not a patient. I am a doctor.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.980
My name is Vijay.
You were talking about me, right?

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.460
Hey, you don't know
anything about me.

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:03.870
But you misunderstood me, right?

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.800
I think I can get a chance
as a doctor.

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.260
Sorry, sir.
I am extremely sorry, sir.

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:11.200
I was in a different
state of mind, sir.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.100
I was handling that case
from the first.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.840
Now suddenly they have
dismissed me from this case.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.910
I have spoken out of distress, sir.
I am extremely sorry, sir.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.280
I am Reena.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:22.760
Senior resident.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:23.720
Vijay.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.650
Hey, you stay here.
I will go and talk to her.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.220
Okay.
- Wait.

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.550
Hey, what are you doing?

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.240
Can't you see?
It is a coffee.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.070
We are all going around
with a lot of work pressure.

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:54.340
How do you get so much free time?

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.330
In the morning, you are happily

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.620
using your mobile
and stalking Vijay.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.950
Now, you are happily drinking
coffee.

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:06.320
Don't stare.
I was just kidding.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.060
I came here for something else.

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:09.760
What is it?

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:13.200
It is.. Our boy wants to
ask for your apology.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.690
Who is he?
- He is someone we know.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:23.000
He is the one.
Please forgive him.

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:24.800
Sorry.

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:26.810
Why are you scratching your heart?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.650
Who are you?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.160
Me?

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.340
Nilofer, if there is a
problem in this hospital,

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.960
they will call me first.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.690
Hello.
I asked who you are in this matter.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.650
I was wondering why this question
hasn't come yet.

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.370
Nilofer, if there is a
problem in this hospital,

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:53.830
they will call me first.

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:54.950
They will call me first!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.810
Then they will ask me
who am I in the end.

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:00.100
Hey, talk to her.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:02.260
Nilofer.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:03.950
Sorry, Nilofer.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.110
It was my mistake.

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:08.900
I shouldn't have spoken to you
like that.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.460
As the mistake is mine..

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.970
I am apologising to you even
after you have beaten me up.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.670
If someone is asking sorry even
after you have beaten him up..

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:20.170
He has something on you..

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.310
Rocky, you leave.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.660
We will talk on our own.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.790
Hey!
- Go, Rocky.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:28.790
Go. You might have some
work inside. Go.

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:31.420
I came to help you, right?

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.040
You two won't get together
until the end.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.330
Nilofer, I am saying
this seriously.

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.170
I am extremely sorry.

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:44.390
I didn't even think that
you have such a past.

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:47.500
Will you always smile and be fun?

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:51.320
I can't even guess.

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:54.960
By the way,

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:59.710
your boyfriend,
will he be like me?

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:03.620
Yes.

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:08.030
But he is more beautiful,
intelligent and taller than you.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:12.000
Not only that, he will apologise
to me as soon as I beat him up.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:15.140
He won't apologise
after two days like you.

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:21.810
Pavi,
nurse Aruna asked for the files

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:23.680
of the patient in bed number 13.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:24.760
I will get it for you.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.620
Here you go.

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.590
Hey!
- What?

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:39.830
What are you doing?

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.500
What do you mean?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.810
Look, you are not a nurse.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.100
You don't know this work.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.480
Why are you getting involved in
a work that you don't know?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:47.550
And why are you taking
unnecessary risk?

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.100
They will have doubts if
I don't get involved in anything.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.320
Hey!
- Aruna.

00:15:58.550 --> 00:15:59.430
Thank you.

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:00.800
Amaya.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.580
I wanted to tell you something.

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:05.560
Okay. You wait.

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:11.010
This is too much, Abhi.

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.390
Please play it safely.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.740
I don't understand
why Amaya is asking you for help.

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:18.230
Look here.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.510
Everyone is doing their job here.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.670
You are the only one who is scared.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.310
If you behave weirdly,
both of us will get caught.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.490
I am scared
that you will get caught.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:30.970
If you get caught,
she will also get caught.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:32.190
That won't happen.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.200
Okay, take care.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.620
Amaya.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.180
I remember now.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:41.030
They have called you
to the conference room.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.410
Go quickly.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:44.460
Oh no!

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:46.210
They are calling me
to the conference room.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.570
What will I say if I go there?

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:48.680
What will you say?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.070
You were overconfident just now.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.300
Why are you getting scared now?
Go and speak.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:00.160
Sorry, guys.
I am a little late.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.290
Please Doctor.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.940
So, you all would have
already known him.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:12.790
But I would like
to introduce him again. Formally.

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:14.870
This is Dr. Vijay.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.200
India's top neurologist.

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:18.580
He has completed his
medical law in diploma.

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:20.410
He is also doing
medical investigations.

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:22.520
He was sent by the medical council.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.460
He is going to deal
with the athlete's case.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.420
Hi. Hi.

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:29.710
Hi, Radhi.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:33.210
And Dr. Vijay.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.500
This is Dr. Preetham.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.740
Our chief Doctor.

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:37.890
This is Dr. Radhi.

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:39.190
One of our senior doctors.

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:41.120
Reena, Teju and Amaya.
- Hi, sir.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:42.200
Hi.
- Hi.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:44.110
They are the ones who have
dealt with the athlete's case.

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:45.030
Right.

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:46.090
So.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.520
The reason for this meeting is..

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.210
Arjun, I will just take over
from here. Yeah?

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:50.410
Sure sir.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.380
I have read this case completely.

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.430
But I still need some details
and perspective.

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.660
I believe that all of you are
involved in this case.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.880
Arjun, I think it would be good
if there is a doctor in this team.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.580
Yeah.
Sure, sir.

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:04.450
Right.

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:06.660
Teju and Reena are working with me.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.540
But Reena has been relieved
from this case.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.350
She has a handful of other cases.

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:12.040
So, we can take Teju.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.230
Arjun, I..

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:16.270
I think..

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:19.670
You said that I can take
a team member of my choice.

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:23.660
Ma'am.
No. It's okay.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:29.320
Doctor, if you feel that Reena is
the right one, you can assign her.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:30.770
Right, Reena?

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:31.820
Sure sir.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.450
No. You don't understand.

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:35.160
I am not looking
for a resident Doctor.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:37.080
Nothing personal here.
I am looking for experience.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.610
I am looking
for an experienced hand.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:41.170
So, I want Radhi on the team.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.770
Arjun, I am a senior Doctor
in this hospital.

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:45.790
I have a lot of work.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:47.690
So, why should I join this team?

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.190
If he wants, he can take Teju.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.350
Doctor Radhi, I am..

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.470
Sorry to say this but..
This is my jurisdiction.

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:58.930
This is my case. I prefer to make
the decisions with respect to this.

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:00.460
I am telling this to all of you.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:03.670
According to this case, all of you
have to cooperate with me.

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.510
Not only that, you have to do it.

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:06.940
That is the Medical Council rule.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:09.070
Which is a very,
very serious affair.

00:20:24.345 --> 00:20:27.635
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:20:29.365 --> 00:20:31.905
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:20:34.455 --> 00:20:37.405
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:20:39.055 --> 00:20:41.475
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:20:41.605 --> 00:20:44.075
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:20:44.165 --> 00:20:46.685
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:20:46.965 --> 00:20:49.465
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:20:51.845 --> 00:20:54.555
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:20:57.005 --> 00:20:59.545
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:21:01.645 --> 00:21:06.345
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:21:30.635 --> 00:21:32.735
'Ask for help from someone.'

00:21:33.135 --> 00:21:35.975
'If not,
I will come to the hospital'

00:21:36.215 --> 00:21:38.925
'and make somebody do it for you.'

00:21:53.225 --> 00:21:54.675
May I..
- Hey, Arjun.

00:21:55.405 --> 00:21:56.305
Come in.

00:21:57.075 --> 00:21:58.235
What's with the sudden visit?

00:21:58.735 --> 00:22:00.715
Tell me, is everything okay?

00:22:04.355 --> 00:22:06.465
Arjun, what happened?

00:22:07.915 --> 00:22:08.805
Manasa.

00:22:09.795 --> 00:22:12.925
You said that you'd help me
back in the restaurant.

00:22:15.215 --> 00:22:18.955
Be it as a friend or a therapist.

00:22:19.455 --> 00:22:20.465
You told me so, right?

00:22:21.185 --> 00:22:23.285
Yes, Arjun.
What happened?

00:22:23.485 --> 00:22:26.635
Do you want help from
a therapist now, or from a friend?

00:22:33.405 --> 00:22:34.425
Therapist.

00:22:36.275 --> 00:22:37.215
I am all ears.

00:22:37.285 --> 00:22:38.675
Tell me, what is the problem?

00:22:41.795 --> 00:22:43.625
I am scared, Manasa.

00:22:44.365 --> 00:22:45.255
I am very scared.

00:22:45.655 --> 00:22:48.855
What are you scared of?
Is there any reason?

00:22:50.165 --> 00:22:51.385
I have a drinking problem.

00:22:52.835 --> 00:22:53.715
Arjun.

00:22:54.425 --> 00:22:56.195
Try to be more clear this time.

00:22:56.595 --> 00:22:58.785
What happened?
- I have a drinking problem, Manasa.

00:22:58.965 --> 00:23:00.065
I am still drinking.

00:23:00.175 --> 00:23:03.475
But Arjun, you don't look
like you are drunk.

00:23:03.555 --> 00:23:05.005
That is what I'm scared of, Manasa.

00:23:05.685 --> 00:23:08.315
I used to drink before.
But I knew my limits.

00:23:08.805 --> 00:23:10.295
Others would notice
that I am drunk.

00:23:10.505 --> 00:23:12.145
So that'd keep me in my limits.

00:23:15.335 --> 00:23:17.415
But..
- But what?

00:23:19.915 --> 00:23:20.925
But now..

00:23:22.245 --> 00:23:23.935
I feel like drinking
as soon as I wake up.

00:23:24.075 --> 00:23:25.875
I feel like drinking
when there is a problem.

00:23:25.955 --> 00:23:28.845
I feel like drinking even when
nothing happens or when I'm alone.

00:23:30.425 --> 00:23:33.045
And to be honest,
I drink whenever I feel like it.

00:23:33.775 --> 00:23:35.795
And no one knows that I am drunk.

00:23:38.505 --> 00:23:39.675
That is my fear.

00:23:40.215 --> 00:23:43.215
And I am getting too
comfortable with this.

00:23:48.975 --> 00:23:51.015
Will you help me?

00:23:54.775 --> 00:23:57.585
Of course.
Not only as a therapist

00:23:58.135 --> 00:24:00.645
I will be there for you
as a friend.

00:24:07.795 --> 00:24:11.095
I have to clean it twice a week.
- Hi, Reena.

00:24:11.845 --> 00:24:12.755
Hi, sir.

00:24:14.225 --> 00:24:15.175
Sir?

00:24:15.685 --> 00:24:17.715
Are you calling me 'sir'
even after all this?

00:24:18.125 --> 00:24:19.135
Hi, Grandpa.

00:24:19.305 --> 00:24:20.345
That's better.

00:24:21.945 --> 00:24:23.775
Are you cleaning the vehicle?

00:24:23.885 --> 00:24:25.105
Did you come to ask this?

00:24:26.385 --> 00:24:27.675
Give me the cloth,
I will help you.

00:24:28.705 --> 00:24:30.715
No, Grandpa, it's okay.
I will do it.

00:24:35.325 --> 00:24:36.175
Dear.

00:24:36.955 --> 00:24:37.885
Reena.

00:24:38.675 --> 00:24:41.335
I told you
such a big story yesterday.

00:24:42.565 --> 00:24:45.005
After hearing it, how do you feel?

00:24:45.695 --> 00:24:47.085
I don't feel anything.

00:24:48.335 --> 00:24:49.335
Nothing?

00:24:50.775 --> 00:24:52.045
He left my mom.

00:24:52.625 --> 00:24:54.465
I want to see him at least once.

00:24:57.325 --> 00:24:58.185
This is it.

00:24:59.125 --> 00:25:03.825
It's a very simple
and natural thing for humans.

00:25:04.255 --> 00:25:07.005
We don't realise the value
of something when we have it.

00:25:07.135 --> 00:25:08.465
When we don't have it

00:25:08.635 --> 00:25:10.925
we'd always think about it.

00:25:13.855 --> 00:25:16.205
How many people
are there around you?

00:25:16.855 --> 00:25:18.335
There are many people, Grandpa.

00:25:18.895 --> 00:25:20.965
But who is there for me?

00:25:21.875 --> 00:25:24.505
I can't win by talking to you.

00:25:28.155 --> 00:25:31.835
But I am worried about my daughter.

00:25:32.875 --> 00:25:34.935
She is talking about divorce.

00:25:35.585 --> 00:25:37.515
Poor kids.

00:25:38.295 --> 00:25:39.295
What will they do?

00:25:39.625 --> 00:25:40.935
Why are you saying that, Grandpa?

00:25:41.255 --> 00:25:42.835
I know Mr. Dev very well.

00:25:43.465 --> 00:25:46.795
He is the only one who
understands Dr. Radhi very well.

00:25:46.925 --> 00:25:49.975
Mr. Dev will definitely
come back to Dr. Radhi.

00:25:50.305 --> 00:25:51.595
Good things will happen.

00:25:52.725 --> 00:25:53.885
She is your daughter.

00:25:54.395 --> 00:25:55.465
But I am telling you.

00:25:55.855 --> 00:25:57.585
If Dr. Radhi is in a situation

00:25:57.775 --> 00:26:00.085
she would have known
all the possible outcomes.

00:26:00.735 --> 00:26:02.665
Even now, there is an
important case in the hospital.

00:26:02.875 --> 00:26:06.005
Dr. Vijay was the one who
recommended Dr. Radhi for the case.

00:26:06.445 --> 00:26:07.545
So much trust.

00:26:09.335 --> 00:26:10.295
Vijay?

00:26:10.525 --> 00:26:12.425
Yes.
Why, what happened?

00:26:13.065 --> 00:26:13.885
Nothing.

00:26:14.655 --> 00:26:16.085
I just asked.

00:26:16.555 --> 00:26:17.425
Okay, Grandpa.

00:26:17.455 --> 00:26:19.045
I am getting late for the hospital.

00:26:19.505 --> 00:26:21.045
I have to leave.
- Okay.

00:26:21.285 --> 00:26:23.545
I will also leave.
Okay, have a good day.

00:26:30.215 --> 00:26:31.055
Doctor.

00:26:31.185 --> 00:26:33.535
I am sorry to ask you
to come here in this situation.

00:26:33.645 --> 00:26:35.895
Please sit down..

00:26:38.065 --> 00:26:39.025
I am Dr. Vijay.

00:26:39.705 --> 00:26:42.145
The government has sent me
to conduct this investigation.

00:26:42.315 --> 00:26:44.465
Please give my daughter
back to me, sir.

00:26:46.485 --> 00:26:48.255
We don't want anything else.

00:26:50.745 --> 00:26:51.695
I just saw it.

00:26:52.365 --> 00:26:54.625
You said that you won't give
permission for the post-mortem.

00:26:54.995 --> 00:26:55.855
Is that true?

00:26:56.745 --> 00:26:59.715
Sir, I beg you.

00:27:00.335 --> 00:27:03.925
Please just give our daughters back
so that we can cremate them.

00:27:04.995 --> 00:27:06.505
Please try to understand, sir.

00:27:06.885 --> 00:27:10.045
We can't take the bodies out of the
hospital without a post-mortem.

00:27:10.445 --> 00:27:11.375
That's the protocol.

00:27:11.475 --> 00:27:14.385
Sir, we don't trust this hospital.

00:27:14.495 --> 00:27:16.345
They are the ones who
killed our daughters.

00:27:16.765 --> 00:27:18.505
Yes, sir.
- Sir.

00:27:18.605 --> 00:27:20.495
After killing my daughter

00:27:20.855 --> 00:27:24.065
you're saying you'll hand over
her body, only cutting it open.

00:27:24.695 --> 00:27:27.835
Sir, we won't give our consent.
Please try to understand.

00:27:27.925 --> 00:27:29.675
This is our final decision, sir.

00:27:29.965 --> 00:27:32.335
Sir, I am not a doctor
in this hospital.

00:27:32.805 --> 00:27:34.675
I have nothing to do
with this hospital.

00:27:35.125 --> 00:27:38.635
But I don't agree with blaming
the hospital for the three deaths.

00:27:38.875 --> 00:27:40.755
We will know that only
after the investigation is over.

00:27:40.955 --> 00:27:42.985
If you take the body
without giving your consent

00:27:43.965 --> 00:27:47.475
how will you live without knowing
what happened to your children?

00:27:48.645 --> 00:27:51.825
How will you live
without any closure?

00:27:53.015 --> 00:27:56.515
I know the pain
of losing your child.

00:27:58.555 --> 00:28:00.005
I understand your pain.

00:28:00.535 --> 00:28:02.635
Please trust me.

00:28:03.025 --> 00:28:04.815
I will be responsible
for this case.

00:28:04.895 --> 00:28:06.895
I will be supervising everything.

00:28:07.215 --> 00:28:10.835
Till I reveal the truth about
what happened to your children..

00:28:13.325 --> 00:28:15.605
My work won't be over, sir.
That's my responsibility.

00:28:16.245 --> 00:28:18.405
Please give your consent
for the post-mortem.

00:28:18.675 --> 00:28:20.735
Please.
Please give consent.

00:28:25.545 --> 00:28:27.925
Increase the patient's fluids.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:28:31.335 --> 00:28:35.295
Ask the evening doctor to check his
creatinine levels. - Okay, Doctor.

00:28:35.485 --> 00:28:37.915
That's it, I think
he will be alright.

00:28:37.975 --> 00:28:39.725
Doctor, your father is here.

00:28:39.775 --> 00:28:41.415
He said
he will be waiting in the canteen.

00:28:43.805 --> 00:28:45.925
Okay, I will come.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:28:47.175 --> 00:28:49.045
What was I saying?
- You asked me to check his fluids.

00:28:49.175 --> 00:28:51.175
Yeah, take care of that,
he will be alright.

00:28:51.205 --> 00:28:52.215
Okay, Doctor.
- Yeah.

00:28:54.375 --> 00:28:55.795
Thank you.
- Thank you, sir.

00:28:56.005 --> 00:28:57.175
Sir, one photo.

00:29:08.815 --> 00:29:09.795
Sit down.

00:29:14.335 --> 00:29:15.635
What are you doing here?
- Hey!

00:29:16.095 --> 00:29:18.425
I told you not to come here.

00:29:18.725 --> 00:29:20.235
I called you many times.

00:29:20.355 --> 00:29:22.175
You didn't answer my calls.
What do you want me to do?

00:29:24.395 --> 00:29:27.295
Shall I also get admitted
here like your mother did?

00:29:28.175 --> 00:29:29.295
What are you saying?

00:29:32.735 --> 00:29:36.765
Did you come here
to apologise for what you did?

00:29:36.825 --> 00:29:39.245
What did I do?
Why should I apologise to you?

00:29:39.495 --> 00:29:40.965
What did you do wrong?

00:29:42.375 --> 00:29:43.765
What you did to me and my mother..

00:29:44.085 --> 00:29:45.715
That's not
a big deal to you, right?

00:29:48.925 --> 00:29:50.175
You don't understand.

00:29:50.305 --> 00:29:54.755
We didn’t part ways
because of a fight.

00:29:55.255 --> 00:29:56.505
I swear.

00:29:56.915 --> 00:29:59.505
Guna, I loved Jennifer so much.

00:29:59.935 --> 00:30:00.945
And I still love her.

00:30:01.305 --> 00:30:02.425
Your mother knew that.

00:30:02.595 --> 00:30:06.795
At that time, our profession
was very important for both of us.

00:30:07.465 --> 00:30:11.465
And I still respect
our profession so much.

00:30:11.925 --> 00:30:15.935
That's why she didn't say
anything when I asked to meet her.

00:30:16.175 --> 00:30:17.555
But there's one thing
she always says.

00:30:17.845 --> 00:30:19.755
"Get lost.
You don't understand anything."

00:30:20.935 --> 00:30:22.505
Okay, why did you come here?

00:30:23.135 --> 00:30:24.095
Oh!

00:30:24.455 --> 00:30:26.875
To lecture on your love story?

00:30:27.015 --> 00:30:27.845
One minute.

00:30:28.555 --> 00:30:32.255
Here are the documents, properties
and papers that Jennifer gave you.

00:30:35.965 --> 00:30:37.175
Can't I earn?

00:30:38.885 --> 00:30:40.045
I don't want this.

00:30:40.635 --> 00:30:43.255
I didn't say that you can't earn.

00:30:43.755 --> 00:30:44.965
Why are you
considering it that way?

00:30:45.585 --> 00:30:47.255
Keep this as a gift
from your mother.

00:30:47.795 --> 00:30:49.305
It will be a keepsake.

00:30:49.435 --> 00:30:53.105
If her property is with you,
your mother will always be with you.

00:30:54.825 --> 00:30:55.675
Who knows?

00:30:55.755 --> 00:30:57.515
You might even
build a big hospital.

00:30:57.735 --> 00:30:59.145
And I might get admitted there.

00:31:00.355 --> 00:31:01.225
Yes.

00:31:02.765 --> 00:31:03.855
Okay.

00:31:04.745 --> 00:31:06.105
Give me your hand.
I'm late for a shoot.

00:31:06.205 --> 00:31:07.115
Bye.

00:31:07.395 --> 00:31:10.515
And don't return the documents
that your mother gave you.

00:31:10.605 --> 00:31:13.435
Don't think that I will give you
something when I die.

00:31:17.725 --> 00:31:19.265
You look good when you smile.

00:31:19.685 --> 00:31:20.895
Thank you so much, Guna.

00:31:21.545 --> 00:31:23.725
You look handsome when you smile.

00:31:24.765 --> 00:31:25.685
See you.

00:31:32.195 --> 00:31:33.265
Excuse..

00:31:35.975 --> 00:31:36.975
Hi, Radhi.

00:31:41.165 --> 00:31:44.015
These are the word log
files that you asked for.

00:31:45.015 --> 00:31:47.525
I have seen them all. I don't think
you will find anything from this.

00:31:48.325 --> 00:31:49.935
Firstly, hi, Radhi.

00:31:56.765 --> 00:31:59.875
Firstly, what have I been
doing all these days?

00:31:59.975 --> 00:32:01.145
Where have I been?

00:32:02.225 --> 00:32:04.515
Don't you want to know any of this?

00:32:04.855 --> 00:32:06.485
Why are you ignoring me?

00:32:06.795 --> 00:32:07.725
Dr. Vijay.

00:32:08.435 --> 00:32:09.515
Please understand this.

00:32:10.245 --> 00:32:13.225
According to me, you have
come here to investigate a case.

00:32:13.885 --> 00:32:15.895
Just mind your own business.

00:32:17.575 --> 00:32:20.685
Moreover, I have a lot of work.

00:32:20.725 --> 00:32:22.515
So, if there is anything
related to this case

00:32:22.665 --> 00:32:23.965
you can call me through intercom.

00:32:23.995 --> 00:32:25.265
I will leave.
- Excuse me, sir.

00:32:27.355 --> 00:32:28.355
Yes, Reena.

00:32:33.355 --> 00:32:34.975
Reena, are you working
on this case?

00:32:35.475 --> 00:32:38.265
No, Radhi, I asked her to come.
I needed some details.

00:32:40.595 --> 00:32:41.495
Reena.

00:32:41.895 --> 00:32:43.895
Can I tell her what you
told me about Radhi?

00:32:45.885 --> 00:32:46.725
Sir.

00:32:47.865 --> 00:32:49.515
Ma'am, no..

00:32:49.625 --> 00:32:50.555
What did she say?

00:32:51.435 --> 00:32:54.145
Why did you ask Reena
not to work on my project?

00:32:54.565 --> 00:32:56.445
I-I already told you.

00:32:56.715 --> 00:32:59.825
Reena already has a lot of cases.
So, that's why. - Oh.

00:33:00.505 --> 00:33:04.175
Even if she agrees to work on it,
I don't think you will let her.

00:33:08.435 --> 00:33:09.895
Is there a problem
between you two?

00:33:10.265 --> 00:33:11.475
Is there some connection?

00:33:14.065 --> 00:33:16.055
That's the problem.
- I'm sorry?

00:33:16.615 --> 00:33:17.555
Nothing, sir.

00:33:18.075 --> 00:33:19.055
Nothing.

00:33:19.615 --> 00:33:21.725
Let's get back to business.
Give me the reports.

00:33:23.995 --> 00:33:25.975
Sir, the post-mortem reports
that you asked for.

00:33:26.025 --> 00:33:27.265
You read the reports, right?

00:33:27.725 --> 00:33:28.685
You explain it.

00:33:28.775 --> 00:33:29.605
Yes, Doctor.

00:33:29.735 --> 00:33:32.305
All three people died
because of different causes.

00:33:32.455 --> 00:33:34.865
Anu had an embolism
in the right ventricle.

00:33:34.945 --> 00:33:36.855
So, she suffered
a sudden cardiac arrest.

00:33:36.995 --> 00:33:40.355
Viji had air bubbles traced
to her cerebral circulation.

00:33:40.975 --> 00:33:44.755
She had a brain stroke,
classic and arterial blockage.

00:33:44.925 --> 00:33:47.555
The third patient, Brinda,
had pulmonary embolism.

00:33:47.695 --> 00:33:49.975
Her lungs were jammed.
She was severely affected.

00:33:50.625 --> 00:33:53.015
The three patients
had different causes of death.

00:33:53.875 --> 00:33:54.805
That's right.

00:33:54.915 --> 00:33:56.895
All three had
different causes but..

00:33:58.425 --> 00:33:59.355
That's not it.

00:34:00.325 --> 00:34:02.685
All three cases had
the same reason.

00:34:05.165 --> 00:34:06.225
Air embolism.

00:34:06.955 --> 00:34:07.855
Ma'am.

00:34:08.975 --> 00:34:11.635
Ma'am, they said you were here.
There is an emergency in the ER.

00:34:11.695 --> 00:34:13.605
We need your help.
- What happened?

00:34:13.815 --> 00:34:16.145
Ma'am, a college student
met with a car accident.

00:34:16.225 --> 00:34:17.805
But the patient is conscious.

00:34:18.265 --> 00:34:21.055
We checked the vitals.
They are borderline.

00:34:21.745 --> 00:34:23.645
It looks stable and normal.

00:34:24.715 --> 00:34:26.935
Ma'am, they said the patient
has some abdominal pain.

00:34:27.205 --> 00:34:29.155
Physical observations?
- Nothing serious, ma'am.

00:34:29.455 --> 00:34:30.765
There are some scratches
here and there.

00:34:31.675 --> 00:34:34.145
There's a seat belt mark here.
Didn't you see it?

00:34:35.115 --> 00:34:36.055
Seat belt?

00:34:37.005 --> 00:34:38.475
Oh, sorry, ma'am.

00:34:38.775 --> 00:34:41.415
It didn't look so vivid when
I examined it. - There is no time.

00:34:41.535 --> 00:34:42.405
BP?

00:34:42.605 --> 00:34:44.055
90-60, pulse 110, ma'am.

00:34:44.795 --> 00:34:45.975
Abdominal rigidity?

00:34:46.215 --> 00:34:48.015
It's not rigid, ma'am.
Mild tenderness.

00:34:48.125 --> 00:34:49.855
There's no external bleeding.

00:34:49.975 --> 00:34:51.975
So maybe it's dehydration, ma'am.

00:34:52.235 --> 00:34:54.725
There's a seat belt injury.
BP is down, pulse is up.

00:34:55.175 --> 00:34:56.805
This isn't dehydration.

00:34:56.865 --> 00:34:57.895
Teju, please note this.

00:34:58.115 --> 00:35:00.895
Until internal bleeding is
completely ruled out before surgery

00:35:01.015 --> 00:35:02.475
it is internal bleeding, alright?

00:35:02.715 --> 00:35:03.805
Sonography.

00:35:03.885 --> 00:35:04.975
Arrange CT abdomen.

00:35:05.315 --> 00:35:06.645
But, sir..
- No buts.

00:35:06.755 --> 00:35:07.975
Please arrange it soon.

00:35:08.065 --> 00:35:09.545
Once we know there's
no internal bleeding

00:35:09.655 --> 00:35:10.765
we can proceed further.

00:35:10.825 --> 00:35:11.975
First, look at the CT report.

00:35:12.225 --> 00:35:13.555
See if there's
a spleen injury in it.

00:35:13.715 --> 00:35:15.355
If not, we can manage
the conservative.

00:35:15.385 --> 00:35:17.895
But if there's any form
of rupture or internal bleeding

00:35:18.625 --> 00:35:19.795
don't give it a second thought.

00:35:20.075 --> 00:35:21.055
Arrange an OT.

00:35:21.475 --> 00:35:22.355
Nurse!

00:35:24.975 --> 00:35:25.895
Not bad.

00:35:26.045 --> 00:35:27.105
You did well there.

00:35:27.395 --> 00:35:29.395
Oh, you can even praise me.

00:35:30.215 --> 00:35:31.895
Maybe this is why
the Medical Council

00:35:31.915 --> 00:35:33.605
sent me to this
hospital for this case.

00:35:35.055 --> 00:35:36.835
Shall we play a game?
- What?

00:35:37.315 --> 00:35:38.435
Let's try playing a game.

00:35:39.185 --> 00:35:40.305
What is this?

00:35:40.475 --> 00:35:41.435
Try it.

00:35:42.905 --> 00:35:44.805
No, I don't have time.

00:35:44.915 --> 00:35:45.975
It's a medical game.

00:35:46.185 --> 00:35:48.455
I'll keep giving you symptoms.
You have to diagnose them.

00:35:50.195 --> 00:35:51.055
I have work to do.

00:35:51.385 --> 00:35:53.915
This is a challenging game.
I've played it in college.

00:35:53.975 --> 00:35:54.855
There's a twist to it.

00:35:54.935 --> 00:35:55.935
It's not just one case.

00:35:56.075 --> 00:35:58.855
I'll keep giving you symptoms.
You have to diagnose them.

00:35:58.895 --> 00:36:01.555
The number of cases we solve
in that one minute is the game.

00:36:01.905 --> 00:36:03.055
No, I can't do it.

00:36:05.225 --> 00:36:07.055
Okay.
It's a challenging game.

00:36:07.195 --> 00:36:09.895
You are afraid
that you might lose to me.

00:36:11.105 --> 00:36:12.225
What's the question? Ask me.

00:36:15.155 --> 00:36:17.725
Okay, fever, wounds in the throat,
sore throat.

00:36:18.395 --> 00:36:21.195
Lymph nodes are swollen.
CBC and WBC are 40,000.

00:36:21.235 --> 00:36:22.515
But everything else is normal.

00:36:22.765 --> 00:36:24.535
Patient is not in sepsis.
Vitals are normal.

00:36:24.665 --> 00:36:25.555
What could it be?

00:36:26.555 --> 00:36:28.355
There are a lot
of differential diagnoses.

00:36:28.455 --> 00:36:31.185
But I'm going a little far-fetched.

00:36:31.655 --> 00:36:32.895
It could be..

00:36:33.265 --> 00:36:35.015
Infectious mononucleosis.

00:36:35.455 --> 00:36:37.225
We have to run a lot
of tests to conclude.

00:36:37.625 --> 00:36:38.515
Not bad.

00:36:39.475 --> 00:36:42.225
Fever, weight loss
and night sweats.

00:36:42.355 --> 00:36:44.105
Persistent cough
for over two weeks.

00:36:44.335 --> 00:36:45.855
Most probably TB.

00:36:45.955 --> 00:36:47.605
Less probably lymphoma.

00:36:48.175 --> 00:36:49.145
Need the patient's history.

00:36:49.225 --> 00:36:50.935
You need the patient's history.
Absolutely right.

00:36:51.495 --> 00:36:53.495
Serious chest pain
radiating down the left arm

00:36:53.545 --> 00:36:55.395
palpitations, sweating.

00:36:55.615 --> 00:36:56.435
Classic MI.

00:36:56.915 --> 00:36:59.305
ECG. Troponin. Oxygen.

00:36:59.365 --> 00:37:01.665
All these are basic, Dr. Vijay.
- Of course.

00:37:01.715 --> 00:37:03.765
That's right,
there's abdominal pain.

00:37:03.815 --> 00:37:06.415
Vomiting, pain and tenderness
in the epigastric region.

00:37:06.545 --> 00:37:08.685
And persistent fever.

00:37:10.105 --> 00:37:11.305
Is the patient an alcoholic?

00:37:11.915 --> 00:37:12.895
Yeah.

00:37:13.335 --> 00:37:14.435
Then..

00:37:15.145 --> 00:37:16.395
Pancreatitis.

00:37:17.575 --> 00:37:18.805
I have to do a serum analysis.

00:37:18.895 --> 00:37:19.895
Yep.
- Do a Lipase test.

00:37:20.555 --> 00:37:21.895
Throw in USG as well.

00:37:22.535 --> 00:37:23.535
Then diagnosis.

00:37:23.575 --> 00:37:24.855
Absolutely.
Try this.

00:37:25.675 --> 00:37:28.265
Headache, visual
disturbance, elevated BP and..

00:37:28.315 --> 00:37:31.395
The patient is
in their third trimester.

00:37:34.135 --> 00:37:35.185
Preeclampsia.

00:37:35.325 --> 00:37:38.515
And we have to check
for proteinuria..

00:37:39.305 --> 00:37:42.645
Give antihypertensive drugs
and stabilise the patient.

00:37:42.855 --> 00:37:44.145
Then we can go for delivery.

00:37:44.415 --> 00:37:46.185
Alright, one final.

00:37:46.555 --> 00:37:48.225
Confusions, tremors, tachycardia

00:37:48.275 --> 00:37:50.525
and a persistent
history of thyroid issues.

00:37:50.685 --> 00:37:51.765
Thyroid storm.

00:37:52.365 --> 00:37:53.905
Good, Radhi.

00:37:54.185 --> 00:37:56.435
Absolutely good.
And you're in the clear.

00:37:56.615 --> 00:37:57.935
Thank you, and..

00:37:58.035 --> 00:38:00.575
Let's stop the game, Vijay.
I have work to do.

00:38:00.665 --> 00:38:02.515
Yeah, you are not the reason.

00:38:03.435 --> 00:38:05.935
For what?
- These are complicated diagnoses.

00:38:06.605 --> 00:38:09.245
You solved them all in a minute.

00:38:09.445 --> 00:38:12.935
With precision and accuracy,
while under pressure.

00:38:14.605 --> 00:38:16.515
In the case of the three athletes

00:38:16.895 --> 00:38:18.765
if you had made the diagnosis
and given the medication

00:38:18.835 --> 00:38:20.185
it wouldn't have gone wrong.

00:38:20.285 --> 00:38:21.435
So, you're clear.

00:38:23.305 --> 00:38:24.265
Okay.

00:38:26.065 --> 00:38:26.925
Okay.

00:38:30.715 --> 00:38:31.685
How is that?

00:38:31.945 --> 00:38:34.555
When I want to talk to someone,
you're always there.

00:38:35.295 --> 00:38:36.975
I am everywhere.

00:38:37.605 --> 00:38:39.055
Okay, tell me, what's the matter?

00:38:40.035 --> 00:38:43.255
I saw Dr. Vijay diagnose a case.

00:38:43.305 --> 00:38:45.475
Wow! What a speed, what a style!

00:38:45.555 --> 00:38:47.555
He can diagnose
a person in a jiffy.

00:38:47.645 --> 00:38:48.475
Not only that

00:38:48.615 --> 00:38:52.055
he and Dr. Radhi played
a game together. - A game?

00:38:52.255 --> 00:38:53.225
What game?

00:38:53.305 --> 00:38:55.265
They played a medical game.

00:38:55.395 --> 00:38:57.145
Do you know how it was?

00:38:57.845 --> 00:38:58.765
Now what?

00:38:58.935 --> 00:39:00.355
Do you want to work in his team?

00:39:00.695 --> 00:39:01.605
No.

00:39:01.625 --> 00:39:04.025
He's intelligent,
I'm not denying that.

00:39:04.695 --> 00:39:08.435
But I'm not interested
in working with him.

00:39:09.095 --> 00:39:10.645
I don't get the vibe.

00:39:12.075 --> 00:39:13.225
Keep blabbering.

00:39:13.815 --> 00:39:15.225
I thought about it, Rocky.

00:39:15.455 --> 00:39:17.145
Do you know how rude
he was when he said

00:39:17.205 --> 00:39:18.935
he wanted Dr. Radhi
to work with him?

00:39:19.355 --> 00:39:22.555
Why should I work with him
and end up in trouble?

00:39:24.355 --> 00:39:27.765
Moreover, the way
he talks to Dr. Radhi is weird.

00:39:28.205 --> 00:39:29.225
I don't like it.

00:39:30.525 --> 00:39:33.185
Reena, it holds
a thousand meanings.

00:39:34.265 --> 00:39:36.725
Dr. Radhi is still beautiful.

00:39:36.895 --> 00:39:38.725
So, he could've
asked for Dr. Radhi.

00:39:39.215 --> 00:39:40.105
Hey!

00:39:40.355 --> 00:39:42.105
No, Reena, think about it.

00:39:42.205 --> 00:39:44.935
Dr. Radhi and Dr. Vijay
are of the same age.

00:39:45.355 --> 00:39:47.975
Moreover, Dr. Vijay is single.

00:39:48.165 --> 00:39:50.645
I heard your mom is
getting divorced. - Rocky!

00:39:51.715 --> 00:39:52.645
No, Reena.

00:39:53.085 --> 00:39:54.725
I was just kidding.

00:39:55.765 --> 00:39:59.185
Dr. Vijay doesn't
seem like a bad guy.

00:39:59.425 --> 00:40:01.145
I think you're misunderstanding.

00:40:01.385 --> 00:40:03.515
Maybe your perspective
will change soon.

00:40:04.665 --> 00:40:06.015
I don't think so.

00:40:19.005 --> 00:40:20.885
Oh.
Hi.

00:40:22.135 --> 00:40:22.975
Hi, bro.

00:40:24.235 --> 00:40:25.105
How are you?

00:40:26.645 --> 00:40:27.555
I'm fine.

00:40:28.045 --> 00:40:29.025
Coffee?

00:40:29.155 --> 00:40:30.225
No, thanks.

00:40:33.405 --> 00:40:34.255
Bro?

00:40:35.405 --> 00:40:38.055
Can I..
Ask you something?

00:40:42.435 --> 00:40:44.725
When was the last time
you spoke to Anitha?

00:40:45.495 --> 00:40:48.395
It's been a while since
I spent time with her.

00:40:49.095 --> 00:40:50.325
Hmm.
- Why?

00:40:53.015 --> 00:40:54.805
Can you talk to her?

00:40:55.195 --> 00:40:56.135
What happened?

00:40:56.555 --> 00:40:57.555
Is there a problem?

00:40:58.325 --> 00:40:59.265
I don't know, bro.

00:41:00.935 --> 00:41:02.305
She's not saying anything.

00:41:03.475 --> 00:41:04.515
She's a bit off.

00:41:05.125 --> 00:41:07.225
Can you talk to her for me?

00:41:07.455 --> 00:41:08.395
Please.

00:41:23.155 --> 00:41:24.015
Anitha.

00:41:27.645 --> 00:41:28.555
Anitha.

00:41:30.555 --> 00:41:31.555
What are you doing here?

00:41:32.265 --> 00:41:33.265
What happened, Ani?

00:41:34.265 --> 00:41:35.435
Why are you alone?

00:41:35.625 --> 00:41:37.305
You don't even talk to me.

00:41:37.435 --> 00:41:38.515
I'm fine.

00:41:39.565 --> 00:41:40.395
It's nothing.

00:41:40.525 --> 00:41:41.435
Ani.

00:41:42.095 --> 00:41:45.515
I can see
that you're a bit grumpy.

00:41:45.945 --> 00:41:47.305
You know that, Arjun.

00:41:47.425 --> 00:41:48.765
Why are you asking then?

00:41:50.725 --> 00:41:52.105
You can tell me anything, Ani.

00:41:53.655 --> 00:41:55.105
What do you want me to say?

00:41:55.335 --> 00:41:56.805
You're busy with your work.

00:41:57.665 --> 00:41:59.145
I'm not blaming you.

00:42:00.015 --> 00:42:02.935
But I don't have any friends
to share things with, Arjun.

00:42:03.415 --> 00:42:05.475
When was the last time
you spoke to me?

00:42:06.235 --> 00:42:07.185
Not just you.

00:42:07.475 --> 00:42:08.395
All of us.

00:42:09.695 --> 00:42:11.935
Everyone is busy with their work.

00:42:12.105 --> 00:42:13.355
What am I supposed to do here?

00:42:13.665 --> 00:42:16.305
If I talk to you,
you'd call me self-centred.

00:42:16.535 --> 00:42:17.725
I don't need that.

00:42:20.225 --> 00:42:22.105
Okay, come.
Let's go out.

00:42:22.385 --> 00:42:23.935
I'm not coming, I have work.

00:42:25.375 --> 00:42:26.395
You're coming out now.

00:42:27.285 --> 00:42:28.985
It's been a while since
we went out, right?

00:42:29.315 --> 00:42:30.355
Let's hang out.

00:42:32.015 --> 00:42:34.125
I really have
a few meetings, Arjun.

00:42:34.285 --> 00:42:35.475
I can't come.

00:42:36.745 --> 00:42:37.635
Okay.

00:42:37.975 --> 00:42:39.395
Will you tell me
after the meetings?

00:42:39.725 --> 00:42:40.605
Shall we go?

00:42:50.115 --> 00:42:51.645
Amaya, right?
- Yes, Doctor.

00:42:53.755 --> 00:42:56.395
You were closely following
the athletes' case, right?

00:42:57.805 --> 00:42:59.855
I saw the logs.
There were some discrepancies.

00:43:00.125 --> 00:43:01.555
I came to clarify them with you.

00:43:02.485 --> 00:43:04.055
You should have got the medication.

00:43:04.305 --> 00:43:05.895
Why did you make Manasa get them?
- No, sir.

00:43:06.455 --> 00:43:07.645
I checked them myself.

00:43:08.015 --> 00:43:10.805
But Manasa cross-checked it again

00:43:10.895 --> 00:43:14.685
and asked me to show it
Dr. Radhi to check the combinations

00:43:14.725 --> 00:43:17.065
and to proceed further after making
sure that there are no objections.

00:43:17.165 --> 00:43:18.055
That's why.

00:43:18.225 --> 00:43:20.555
The nurse was a bit nervous.

00:43:20.825 --> 00:43:22.225
So, I just checked it, Doctor.

00:43:22.525 --> 00:43:25.475
Did you tell her that the combination
was wrong? - Yes, Doctor.

00:43:25.895 --> 00:43:27.435
There were differences
in the dosage.

00:43:27.595 --> 00:43:28.555
Even the brand was different.

00:43:28.645 --> 00:43:31.225
That's why I asked her
to confirm it with Dr. Radhi.

00:43:31.435 --> 00:43:34.605
So, you should have had it attested
by Radhi before changing it.

00:43:35.405 --> 00:43:37.395
But you had asked
Anitha to administer it.

00:43:37.745 --> 00:43:39.605
And Anitha had
changed the medication.

00:43:40.205 --> 00:43:41.185
Why did she change it?

00:43:42.035 --> 00:43:45.845
You should ask
Dr. Anitha about that.

00:43:45.975 --> 00:43:47.475
That's when I came
to the ward, sir.

00:43:47.835 --> 00:43:50.475
When I came,
Amaya looked very nervous.

00:43:50.645 --> 00:43:51.975
She was actually shivering.

00:43:52.445 --> 00:43:54.185
That's why I gave the medication.

00:43:54.805 --> 00:43:57.305
Did you change the medication?

00:43:58.045 --> 00:44:00.355
I changed it very mildly, sir.

00:44:00.495 --> 00:44:03.645
I did it only after
checking the patient's readings.

00:44:04.055 --> 00:44:05.935
It won't make a difference at all.

00:44:06.465 --> 00:44:09.345
But you can check her chart, sir.

00:44:09.645 --> 00:44:11.265
I hadn't eaten properly
since that morning, Doctor.

00:44:11.575 --> 00:44:12.975
My limbs were shivering.

00:44:13.505 --> 00:44:16.355
Dr. Anitha came
at the right time and did it.

00:44:16.975 --> 00:44:19.725
Why weren't you there when
Dr. Anitha was administering it?

00:44:20.915 --> 00:44:23.975
Dr. Anitha had asked me
to check the patient nearby.

00:44:24.255 --> 00:44:25.355
So I went there, sir.

00:44:25.565 --> 00:44:28.145
There was another urgent
case in the patients' ward.

00:44:28.285 --> 00:44:29.645
That's why I sent her there.

00:44:35.275 --> 00:44:37.305
Why did you threaten
those athletes?

00:44:42.215 --> 00:44:44.555
Sir, I didn't threaten them.

00:44:45.155 --> 00:44:46.265
I just spoke out of anger.

00:44:46.695 --> 00:44:48.325
There are so many
people in our village, sir.

00:44:48.635 --> 00:44:50.355
They want to become sportswomen.

00:44:50.815 --> 00:44:52.225
They are chasing their dreams.

00:44:52.845 --> 00:44:55.765
They used drugs without knowing
the value of the chance they got.

00:44:56.955 --> 00:44:58.685
Did you expect me
to pamper them instead?

00:44:59.265 --> 00:45:00.595
For that..
- Nothing, sir.

00:45:01.145 --> 00:45:02.855
If the truth comes out

00:45:03.655 --> 00:45:04.895
for the next 50 years

00:45:05.755 --> 00:45:08.475
every parent will be scared
to send their kids to sports.

00:45:09.175 --> 00:45:10.645
I trained them
with great difficulty, sir.

00:45:11.805 --> 00:45:12.975
I struggled a lot.

00:45:13.765 --> 00:45:15.305
If they had listened to me

00:45:15.475 --> 00:45:17.805
they would've definitely
won a medal.

00:45:20.935 --> 00:45:21.975
They are dead, sir.

00:45:23.495 --> 00:45:24.855
They are dead. What can we do?

00:45:29.105 --> 00:45:31.265
After removing
the athletes' bodies from here

00:45:31.395 --> 00:45:33.095
was there any other patient
admitted here?

00:45:33.365 --> 00:45:36.435
No, sir. We have completely
sealed off this portion of the ER.

00:45:36.685 --> 00:45:40.495
No new patients, nurses
or doctors are coming here.

00:45:40.585 --> 00:45:41.515
Oh!

00:45:42.015 --> 00:45:43.105
Did you change the bed?

00:45:44.105 --> 00:45:47.155
No, sir, since the police have
sealed off this portion completely

00:45:47.345 --> 00:45:48.655
we didn't make any changes, sir.

00:45:48.895 --> 00:45:50.225
We didn't even
change the bed sheet.

00:45:50.885 --> 00:45:51.935
This pillow..

00:45:53.685 --> 00:45:54.555
What stain is this?

00:45:55.375 --> 00:45:56.475
It looks unusual, right?

00:45:57.815 --> 00:46:00.725
Sir, this is a hospital.
Even if we wash thoroughly

00:46:00.945 --> 00:46:02.475
some stains don't go away, sir.

00:46:02.805 --> 00:46:04.735
We didn't make
any changes to it, sir.

00:46:05.385 --> 00:46:07.895
Some patients
even vomit in the bed.

00:46:08.095 --> 00:46:09.405
It could be that, too.

00:46:11.585 --> 00:46:14.055
But if they vomit unconsciously

00:46:14.785 --> 00:46:16.765
there is no chance
of vomiting on the side.

00:46:16.895 --> 00:46:19.235
But if they vomit consciously,
they might get up and do it.

00:46:19.295 --> 00:46:20.515
What are you saying, Vijay?

00:46:21.695 --> 00:46:24.305
Someone might have used
the pillow to suffocate them, right?

00:46:42.105 --> 00:46:43.975
So, are you saying
that this is a murder?

00:46:44.715 --> 00:46:46.515
Yeah, that seems like
the reasonable answer.

00:46:47.355 --> 00:46:50.645
But none of the people
involved in this have any motive.

00:46:51.315 --> 00:46:53.395
Even the coach looks devastated.

00:46:53.715 --> 00:46:56.475
Aruna, take these samples.

00:46:56.535 --> 00:46:58.355
I have asked the forensic
team to pick them up.

00:46:58.825 --> 00:47:01.015
Inform me
as soon as you get the results.

00:47:01.565 --> 00:47:02.555
Okay, sir.

00:49:14.829 --> 00:49:17.149
Hey, are you drinking coffee?
Where is mine?

00:49:18.729 --> 00:49:21.219
Hey, I forgot it today.
Please make it for you.

00:49:21.369 --> 00:49:22.629
You always make it for me.

00:49:24.109 --> 00:49:25.629
I told you I forgot.

00:49:25.989 --> 00:49:27.269
I am not in a good mood today.

00:49:27.639 --> 00:49:28.929
You make it today.

00:49:29.819 --> 00:49:33.119
Why are you getting tense?
I will make it.

00:50:05.279 --> 00:50:07.369
Don't you
know how to make a cup of coffee?

00:50:08.889 --> 00:50:11.129
Please move.

00:50:21.629 --> 00:50:22.629
Sorry.

00:50:24.189 --> 00:50:26.129
You don't keep anything
back in its place.

00:50:30.709 --> 00:50:32.439
You are always getting me tense.

00:50:32.519 --> 00:50:33.859
What did I do?

00:50:34.389 --> 00:50:36.509
Do you want everything
in this house as per your wish?

00:50:36.689 --> 00:50:39.119
What will happen
if the coffee cup is here?

00:50:40.279 --> 00:50:43.019
This is our house.
Not a coffee shop.

00:50:44.419 --> 00:50:46.509
You don't know how to make
a coffee without spilling.

00:50:46.629 --> 00:50:47.739
Look at the way you talk.

00:50:56.189 --> 00:50:57.349
Hey!

00:51:00.409 --> 00:51:04.219
I dropped it by mistake.
I kept it here. But it slipped.

00:51:04.799 --> 00:51:06.839
I was wondering
why nothing happened.

00:51:07.199 --> 00:51:10.009
It fell by mistake.
I kept it here.

00:51:10.199 --> 00:51:11.589
I have to clean it now.

00:51:13.859 --> 00:51:15.819
Can you please move?

00:51:27.229 --> 00:51:29.349
You don't even ask for a courtesy.

00:51:30.409 --> 00:51:31.609
What is the meaning of this?

00:51:31.799 --> 00:51:33.039
What do you mean?

00:51:33.329 --> 00:51:34.149
What?

00:51:34.609 --> 00:51:36.199
I am always like this.

00:51:36.299 --> 00:51:39.509
You asked me to live in with you
after knowing I'm like this.

00:51:39.849 --> 00:51:42.499
I asked you by mistake.

00:51:43.049 --> 00:51:44.009
I am getting used to it.

00:51:44.239 --> 00:51:45.549
It's my fault.

00:52:04.839 --> 00:52:06.929
We have been here
for more than 10 minutes.

00:52:07.779 --> 00:52:10.919
After ordering,
you didn't even talk to me.

00:52:11.389 --> 00:52:12.579
What do you want me to talk?

00:52:12.689 --> 00:52:13.949
Talk loudly.

00:52:14.269 --> 00:52:15.479
What do you want me to talk?

00:52:15.559 --> 00:52:17.129
Hey, you are always angry.

00:52:18.559 --> 00:52:20.319
You don't even talk to anyone
properly.

00:52:20.839 --> 00:52:22.919
It's been a long time
since I saw you smile.

00:52:25.869 --> 00:52:27.269
Whom should I talk to?

00:52:28.289 --> 00:52:29.489
I am here, right?

00:52:29.979 --> 00:52:31.209
Why do you want to talk to me?

00:52:31.319 --> 00:52:32.979
You have a lot of work.

00:52:33.329 --> 00:52:35.669
I can't talk to you like before.

00:52:36.589 --> 00:52:40.629
Yes, that's true.
Will you be upset like this?

00:52:43.109 --> 00:52:44.899
Ani, you can talk to me
whenever you want.

00:52:46.109 --> 00:52:48.319
It feels weird
even to discuss this.

00:52:49.619 --> 00:52:51.679
Will you talk to me
only if I give you approval?

00:52:51.789 --> 00:52:52.869
You are crazy.

00:53:02.239 --> 00:53:03.579
Are you and Guna dating?

00:53:06.429 --> 00:53:07.269
Oh!

00:53:07.979 --> 00:53:12.299
The CEO of this hospital
have time for the rumours?

00:53:12.799 --> 00:53:13.699
I know everything.

00:53:14.759 --> 00:53:15.839
What do you mean?

00:53:18.219 --> 00:53:20.589
I know that you and Guna
are living together.

00:53:22.509 --> 00:53:24.969
I noticed it when I came
to the party that day.

00:53:29.349 --> 00:53:31.049
Hey, Ani.

00:53:31.409 --> 00:53:32.469
Why are you crying?

00:53:34.599 --> 00:53:37.969
I don't know what to do, Arjun.

00:53:38.899 --> 00:53:39.919
Who am I?

00:53:40.599 --> 00:53:42.549
What kind of a person am I?

00:53:43.399 --> 00:53:45.669
I don't know anything, Arjun.

00:53:48.159 --> 00:53:50.989
I don't know, Arjun.

00:53:51.109 --> 00:53:54.509
Maybe I am not brave enough
for the relationship.

00:53:56.159 --> 00:53:56.969
Tell me.

00:53:57.109 --> 00:53:59.019
Do I have to change for everyone?

00:53:59.169 --> 00:53:59.979
Ani.

00:54:00.999 --> 00:54:02.509
Don't say that.

00:54:03.359 --> 00:54:04.969
You are nothing but brave.

00:54:05.709 --> 00:54:07.299
You are asking me questions.

00:54:07.969 --> 00:54:10.259
You are fighting with Ms. Radhi
for what you want.

00:54:11.699 --> 00:54:13.879
Ani.
Look at me.

00:54:14.799 --> 00:54:15.979
Look at me.

00:54:18.839 --> 00:54:21.269
Know one thing.
This is your life.

00:54:22.299 --> 00:54:24.769
You have to fight
for what you want.

00:54:24.949 --> 00:54:26.839
Don't bother
about what anyone thinks.

00:54:28.159 --> 00:54:32.379
If you think about it,
what you want will never happen.

00:54:33.959 --> 00:54:36.779
You have to live like before.
You have to be yourself.

00:54:37.309 --> 00:54:39.089
Don't change for anyone.

00:54:43.389 --> 00:54:44.469
Now, smile.

00:54:46.639 --> 00:54:47.559
Are you hungry?

00:54:47.709 --> 00:54:48.969
Do you want to eat a samosa?

00:54:50.569 --> 00:54:51.449
Two.

00:54:52.799 --> 00:54:53.799
Bro.

00:54:54.049 --> 00:54:55.139
Two samosas.

00:55:00.219 --> 00:55:01.059
Come, Radhi.

00:55:02.599 --> 00:55:04.059
There is a report
from the forensic.

00:55:04.949 --> 00:55:06.259
The one about the pillow.

00:55:07.549 --> 00:55:09.089
It is nothing.
It is a dead end.

00:55:09.899 --> 00:55:11.919
Only Anu's saliva was there.

00:55:12.189 --> 00:55:13.379
It is not a murder weapon.

00:55:14.139 --> 00:55:15.099
Of course, not.

00:55:15.619 --> 00:55:16.799
I told you that day.

00:55:17.099 --> 00:55:18.579
I know, but I am..

00:55:18.989 --> 00:55:21.549
I am missing something.
Something huge.

00:55:22.999 --> 00:55:24.489
Cause of death is air embolism.

00:55:24.849 --> 00:55:26.729
How will the pockets of air
be inside the body?

00:55:26.819 --> 00:55:28.379
How will it go inside?

00:55:31.229 --> 00:55:32.809
I need to visit the scene again.

00:55:43.729 --> 00:55:45.379
You shouldn't give it like this.

00:55:45.589 --> 00:55:47.219
Can't you even give an injection?

00:55:48.029 --> 00:55:49.109
Give it to me.

00:55:49.239 --> 00:55:52.089
You don't understand anything
in first explanation.

00:55:52.169 --> 00:55:56.219
Push the air, snap the injection
and then put it. Okay?

00:55:56.419 --> 00:55:58.859
If you talk while injecting,
I will inject it wrongly.

00:55:58.959 --> 00:56:01.249
Yes, you talk well.

00:56:01.309 --> 00:56:03.629
Do you have a measurement?
Injection..

00:56:03.929 --> 00:56:04.729
Vijay.

00:56:05.159 --> 00:56:06.599
Don't keep on talking.

00:56:06.679 --> 00:56:07.499
Vijay.

00:56:07.579 --> 00:56:08.849
Wait, I will inject it.

00:56:09.109 --> 00:56:12.129
All okay?
- Just a second.

00:56:12.199 --> 00:56:14.219
I know that.
- Okay, do it.

00:56:14.739 --> 00:56:15.599
What are you doing?

00:56:15.949 --> 00:56:19.039
Sir, this injection.
- Don't you know how to inject?

00:56:19.169 --> 00:56:20.709
She knows.
- I know.

00:56:20.929 --> 00:56:22.299
You will inject, right?
- Yes.

00:56:22.409 --> 00:56:23.259
Take it in your hand.

00:56:24.629 --> 00:56:25.809
Give it.

00:56:26.879 --> 00:56:27.969
What is this injection?

00:56:28.079 --> 00:56:29.339
Sir, T.T.

00:56:34.299 --> 00:56:36.429
It's been six months
since I got T.T. injection.

00:56:36.559 --> 00:56:37.839
Inject it for me.

00:56:39.999 --> 00:56:41.339
Vijay, what are you doing?

00:56:41.699 --> 00:56:42.499
Wait, Radhi.

00:56:43.679 --> 00:56:44.639
Give it, Amaya.

00:56:44.859 --> 00:56:45.839
Inject it.

00:56:48.049 --> 00:56:49.009
Your hands are shaking.

00:56:49.249 --> 00:56:50.089
Careful.

00:56:57.609 --> 00:56:58.719
Amaya, careful.

00:57:04.739 --> 00:57:07.329
Sir, my hand is shivering.

00:57:07.549 --> 00:57:09.879
You will say you didn't eat
properly, right?

00:57:10.409 --> 00:57:11.469
No.
- Doctor.

00:57:12.609 --> 00:57:14.679
Mortuary in charge
wants to talk to you.

00:57:15.459 --> 00:57:16.679
What is this?

00:57:17.249 --> 00:57:19.289
Amaya, please meet me in the cabin.

00:57:19.409 --> 00:57:21.039
Radhi, until further instructions,

00:57:21.109 --> 00:57:22.829
she shouldn't attend
any of the patients.

00:57:23.879 --> 00:57:24.899
Just ensure.

00:57:25.489 --> 00:57:26.639
'Hello.'
- Tell me.

00:57:26.789 --> 00:57:30.549
'Vijay, the athletes'
post-mortem is over.'

00:57:31.659 --> 00:57:32.559
What?

00:57:33.069 --> 00:57:35.559
'Vijay, you were right.
The wounds were very minute.'

00:57:38.009 --> 00:57:40.229
Okay, can you mail me
the reports immediately?

00:57:40.369 --> 00:57:42.029
Take photos.
- 'Okay.'

00:57:42.409 --> 00:57:43.509
Right, urgently.

00:57:43.509 --> 00:57:45.009
'Sure, Vijay.'
- Okay.

00:57:45.249 --> 00:57:48.419
'And by the way,
do you have any idea who did this?'

00:57:50.569 --> 00:57:51.879
I think I have a fair idea.

00:57:52.269 --> 00:57:54.259
Thank you, Doctor.
Let's go.

00:57:55.189 --> 00:57:56.229
Sir..

00:58:04.509 --> 00:58:06.509
Amaya.
- Sir.

00:58:07.399 --> 00:58:08.589
Tell me about yourself.

00:58:10.959 --> 00:58:13.749
Vijay, may I know what this is?

00:58:13.899 --> 00:58:16.549
Radhi,
there were three deaths here.

00:58:16.839 --> 00:58:18.259
There are only two possibilities.

00:58:18.469 --> 00:58:21.879
Either there's medical negligence
or planned murder.

00:58:22.669 --> 00:58:24.749
But Amaya is
a very experienced nurse.

00:58:24.829 --> 00:58:26.989
I've seen her work closely.

00:58:27.129 --> 00:58:28.309
She's one of her best.

00:58:28.519 --> 00:58:29.349
Is it?

00:58:30.299 --> 00:58:31.509
Is it Amaya?

00:58:33.839 --> 00:58:35.089
I'll ask you directly.

00:58:35.649 --> 00:58:37.969
What is the connection between you
and these three deaths?

00:58:39.179 --> 00:58:40.189
Sir.

00:58:41.819 --> 00:58:42.929
Vijay.

00:58:43.849 --> 00:58:45.509
Hello.
- 'Can you come to the cabin, Doctor?'

00:58:45.569 --> 00:58:46.909
Hi, Arjun.
We're on our way.

00:58:47.359 --> 00:58:48.799
Dr. Radhi and I.

00:58:51.309 --> 00:58:52.969
I don't know if you've seen
the news.

00:58:53.459 --> 00:58:55.899
But each channel is saying
a different story.

00:58:56.249 --> 00:58:59.049
They are saying the hospital
has murdered those three.

00:59:00.729 --> 00:59:02.209
Please find out soon, Doctor.

00:59:02.839 --> 00:59:04.679
We're close to solving the case.

00:59:05.159 --> 00:59:06.869
Have you found out who it is?

00:59:06.979 --> 00:59:08.429
I have a guess.

00:59:10.629 --> 00:59:11.629
I think it's Amaya.

00:59:14.599 --> 00:59:15.969
Let's start with Amaya.

00:59:16.479 --> 00:59:19.359
As per you
Amaya is a very talented nurse.

00:59:19.439 --> 00:59:20.289
Right?
- Yeah.

00:59:20.609 --> 00:59:21.429
But..

00:59:22.309 --> 00:59:23.549
I am anxious.

00:59:23.759 --> 00:59:27.259
When I met Amaya, she didn't
even know how to inject me.

00:59:28.509 --> 00:59:30.129
Wait.
What if..

00:59:30.509 --> 00:59:31.849
I'm just thinking here.

00:59:34.579 --> 00:59:38.299
Did I meet the real Amaya?

00:59:43.709 --> 00:59:44.609
Tell me, Amaya.

00:59:45.139 --> 00:59:47.509
Why can't you even do
a basic nurse duty?

00:59:48.279 --> 00:59:49.629
Tell him what you told me.

00:59:49.849 --> 00:59:50.699
Amaya.

00:59:51.569 --> 00:59:52.679
What is he saying?

00:59:53.029 --> 00:59:54.049
Is this true?

00:59:55.189 --> 00:59:57.509
Do you have anything to do
with those three incidents?

00:59:57.699 --> 00:59:58.889
Nothing of that sort, sir.

00:59:59.719 --> 01:00:00.769
I didn't do anything.

01:00:01.189 --> 01:00:02.929
Okay.
Sure.

01:00:03.669 --> 01:00:05.429
Then, let's play a game.

01:00:06.519 --> 01:00:07.879
What are the normal BP values?

01:00:13.779 --> 01:00:16.109
'Normal BP values are 80 to 120.'

01:00:16.259 --> 01:00:18.129
'The problem is
when it's not in this range.'

01:00:20.139 --> 01:00:22.489
120, 80, Doctor.

01:00:24.069 --> 01:00:25.929
What is the dosage
of Paediatric Paracetamol?

01:00:26.549 --> 01:00:28.549
'Abhi, you have to give
the dosage correctly.'

01:00:28.649 --> 01:00:29.759
'That too, for small kids.'

01:00:29.979 --> 01:00:32.239
'Paediatric is 125 mg.'

01:00:33.089 --> 01:00:34.749
125 mg, Doctor.

01:00:35.889 --> 01:00:37.449
What is the first step of CPR?

01:00:44.299 --> 01:00:46.259
What will you do
if the saline bag leaks?

01:00:48.009 --> 01:00:50.009
What is the common side effect
of IM injection?

01:00:50.709 --> 01:00:53.699
What will be the first aid
for seizure patients?

01:00:59.339 --> 01:01:01.279
What is the difference
between isotonic IV fluids

01:01:01.369 --> 01:01:02.839
and hypotonic IV fluids?

01:01:05.089 --> 01:01:07.719
What is the disinfectant used
to fix the IV line?

01:01:14.489 --> 01:01:16.299
Didn't Kamal teach you all this?

01:01:22.279 --> 01:01:24.629
She doesn't know the answer
to even a basic question.

01:01:25.479 --> 01:01:28.009
There is no connection
between Amaya and this girl.

01:01:30.439 --> 01:01:31.349
Amaya.

01:01:31.799 --> 01:01:33.629
Why aren't you saying anything?

01:01:34.339 --> 01:01:35.469
Answer me.

01:01:38.279 --> 01:01:39.439
This is enough, Amaya.

01:01:40.079 --> 01:01:41.499
I can easily prove

01:01:41.569 --> 01:01:44.049
that negligence is responsible
for the deaths of three people.

01:01:44.819 --> 01:01:46.089
You'll be finished.

01:01:50.079 --> 01:01:50.889
Tell me.

01:01:51.909 --> 01:01:54.969
If you are hiding something,
just tell me.

01:02:02.339 --> 01:02:03.239
I..

01:02:03.499 --> 01:02:05.049
I am not Amaya.

01:02:05.889 --> 01:02:06.719
What?

01:02:10.009 --> 01:02:12.219
Yes, I am not Amaya.

01:02:13.329 --> 01:02:14.509
I am Amaya's sister.

01:02:18.929 --> 01:02:20.219
I am Amaya's twin.

01:02:20.939 --> 01:02:21.969
Abhinaya.

01:02:36.049 --> 01:02:38.499
I asked you to take care of her.

01:02:38.749 --> 01:02:40.379
What else should I do?

01:02:41.049 --> 01:02:42.509
I tried to help her.

01:02:43.019 --> 01:02:44.379
But this is what happened.

01:02:44.549 --> 01:02:46.659
We got caught in two days
after telling you.

01:02:46.909 --> 01:02:48.799
Now, our lives are in question.

01:02:49.139 --> 01:02:51.299
But, we didn't expect
this to happen.

01:02:52.449 --> 01:02:54.409
Abhi struggled
even with the injection.

01:02:55.089 --> 01:02:57.429
That's why Vijay sir doubted us.

01:02:57.709 --> 01:02:58.859
We got caught.

01:02:58.959 --> 01:02:59.939
Hey, Amaya.

01:03:00.079 --> 01:03:01.219
What did Kamal do wrong?

01:03:01.429 --> 01:03:03.629
We made a mistake
for our selfishness.

01:03:03.729 --> 01:03:06.129
He tried to help me.

01:03:10.839 --> 01:03:11.719
Amaya.

01:03:12.549 --> 01:03:14.179
They called you
to the conference room.

01:03:22.879 --> 01:03:24.589
Now, you stand there.

01:03:29.229 --> 01:03:30.199
Very good.

01:03:30.749 --> 01:03:33.299
I don't know if this is a hospital
or a crime syndicate.

01:03:33.579 --> 01:03:35.549
So much of crime.
Disorder as well.

01:03:36.039 --> 01:03:36.969
Hey, Ms. Radhi.

01:03:37.359 --> 01:03:38.299
What do you say now?

01:03:38.679 --> 01:03:40.589
Shall we forgive them, too?

01:03:40.819 --> 01:03:43.429
They'll put you behind bars
for abetment to fraud.

01:03:43.549 --> 01:03:45.179
Sir.
Come on.

01:03:47.419 --> 01:03:49.229
Come on, Arjun.

01:03:49.599 --> 01:03:50.579
That's what I thought.

01:03:50.729 --> 01:03:53.339
How come Arjun didn't say anything
when I'm talking about Radhi!

01:03:53.439 --> 01:03:55.839
The hospital is in trouble
because you're the CEO.

01:03:56.149 --> 01:03:57.309
This is your hospital.

01:03:58.029 --> 01:04:00.119
But, I think now you'll understand

01:04:00.309 --> 01:04:02.169
how
difficult it is to be an executive.

01:04:02.299 --> 01:04:06.129
Sir. Will you use
everything to your advantage?

01:04:07.179 --> 01:04:10.949
Even if our hospital has
the background data of our staff,

01:04:11.589 --> 01:04:14.629
how can we cross-check
such a situation?

01:04:15.579 --> 01:04:18.049
And, damn it.
They look identical.

01:04:19.379 --> 01:04:20.419
Amaya.

01:04:21.619 --> 01:04:22.859
I trusted you.

01:04:23.879 --> 01:04:24.839
I swear.

01:04:24.979 --> 01:04:26.749
Even when Vijay told me,

01:04:27.329 --> 01:04:29.589
I didn't suspect you at all.

01:04:29.899 --> 01:04:33.369
Ma'am. It'll take two more
months for my leg to recover.

01:04:33.569 --> 01:04:34.579
But my family,

01:04:34.709 --> 01:04:37.799
they have never survived
even a day without my salary.

01:04:37.899 --> 01:04:39.139
Are you bloody serious?

01:04:39.569 --> 01:04:41.409
Do you realise
how big a mistake this is?

01:04:41.499 --> 01:04:44.129
If you had told me this earlier,
I would've given you a solution.

01:04:44.599 --> 01:04:47.299
Do you realise how many lives
you've put at risk?

01:04:47.429 --> 01:04:49.179
We shouldn't let this go.

01:04:49.899 --> 01:04:51.679
We should make an example
of these two.

01:04:51.959 --> 01:04:53.969
Their punishment should be severe.

01:04:54.239 --> 01:04:55.679
First, call a press conference.

01:04:55.789 --> 01:04:57.339
We'll release it in the media.
- Sir.

01:04:58.059 --> 01:04:58.969
Please, sir.

01:04:59.259 --> 01:05:00.639
This job is very important to me.

01:05:00.899 --> 01:05:03.389
You should've thought about it
before committing fraud.

01:05:07.539 --> 01:05:10.259
I'm sorry.
Please.

01:05:10.359 --> 01:05:11.649
Please continue.

01:05:15.379 --> 01:05:17.379
You don't know the ABCD in nursing.

01:05:17.589 --> 01:05:20.719
Then, how did you administer
the medication for so long?

01:05:20.789 --> 01:05:23.629
Ma'am.
I've never given an injection.

01:05:23.829 --> 01:05:25.469
Everyone else did it.

01:05:25.849 --> 01:05:28.099
I somehow got some help, ma'am.

01:05:30.439 --> 01:05:31.579
According to this log,

01:05:31.669 --> 01:05:34.409
those three girls were given
four injections.

01:05:34.669 --> 01:05:36.009
Didn't you give any of them?

01:05:37.509 --> 01:05:38.399
No, ma'am.

01:05:38.649 --> 01:05:39.589
I didn't.

01:05:41.809 --> 01:05:43.969
First injection
was given by the Pavi nurse.

01:05:44.369 --> 01:05:47.049
Last injection was given
by Dr. Anitha.

01:05:47.289 --> 01:05:49.679
I don't even know
how to administer it, ma'am.

01:05:54.569 --> 01:05:56.049
Pavi.
Varsha.

01:05:56.349 --> 01:05:57.839
My hands are shivering.

01:05:57.939 --> 01:05:59.429
I haven't had breakfast.

01:05:59.549 --> 01:06:01.429
Can you administer it?
- Okay, give it to me.

01:06:01.509 --> 01:06:02.449
Give it to me.
- Okay.

01:06:14.059 --> 01:06:15.829
This murder was committed
by Amaya.. No.

01:06:16.159 --> 01:06:17.779
This murder
was not committed by Abhi.

01:07:40.089 --> 01:07:43.319
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:07:45.009 --> 01:07:47.469
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:07:50.139 --> 01:07:53.139
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:07:54.849 --> 01:07:57.159
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:07:57.309 --> 01:07:59.809
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:07:59.879 --> 01:08:02.529
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:08:02.659 --> 01:08:05.449
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:08:07.489 --> 01:08:10.289
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:08:12.409 --> 01:08:15.149
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:08:17.369 --> 01:08:21.589
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:08:41.859 --> 01:08:44.009
Hi, Arjun.
- Hi.

01:08:44.939 --> 01:08:47.739
Why did you want
to meet up in the car?

01:08:48.319 --> 01:08:50.479
We could have met in the hospital.

01:08:50.639 --> 01:08:51.779
Yes, Manasa, but..

01:08:52.819 --> 01:08:55.029
I don't want people
to know about this.

01:08:56.829 --> 01:08:59.289
Okay, where should we start?

01:08:59.919 --> 01:09:01.129
Aren't you a psychologist?

01:09:01.999 --> 01:09:03.859
You should know.
- Never mind.

01:09:03.999 --> 01:09:06.609
I thought you would
give me some input.

01:09:06.859 --> 01:09:08.939
Okay, I'll start.
No issues.

01:09:09.459 --> 01:09:12.399
First, we need to find out
the root cause of your problem.

01:09:12.889 --> 01:09:14.469
When did you start drinking?

01:09:17.099 --> 01:09:20.519
First, I started
drinking in college.

01:09:22.039 --> 01:09:23.819
I started drinking with my friends.

01:09:24.609 --> 01:09:25.779
After that, it became serious.

01:09:31.649 --> 01:09:33.069
After my mom passed away

01:09:34.739 --> 01:09:36.289
I couldn't bear her loss.

01:09:36.839 --> 01:09:38.279
I started drinking once a month.

01:09:39.109 --> 01:09:40.489
Then, I started
drinking once a week.

01:09:41.449 --> 01:09:42.579
Then daily.

01:09:44.859 --> 01:09:46.029
I started drinking daily.

01:09:47.989 --> 01:09:49.819
I did try to stop.

01:09:51.079 --> 01:09:52.149
But nothing worked.

01:09:52.779 --> 01:09:54.609
I was always scared.

01:09:56.029 --> 01:09:58.109
Whenever I drink

01:09:58.449 --> 01:09:59.859
I'd feel better.

01:10:00.349 --> 01:10:01.409
What are you afraid of?

01:10:05.569 --> 01:10:06.569
Reena.

01:10:07.359 --> 01:10:08.359
Reena?

01:10:09.529 --> 01:10:11.069
What is your fear about Reena?

01:10:15.079 --> 01:10:21.779
Arjun, I can assist you
only as far as you open up to me

01:10:21.949 --> 01:10:24.439
and then come up with solutions.

01:10:24.719 --> 01:10:26.149
Tell me, what is your
fear about Reena?

01:10:26.879 --> 01:10:28.029
I'm not scared of Reena.

01:10:29.299 --> 01:10:30.849
I'm scared that I might lose Reena.

01:10:32.639 --> 01:10:33.779
Do you love her?

01:10:40.149 --> 01:10:41.149
Yes, Manasa.

01:10:42.449 --> 01:10:43.569
I love her a lot.

01:10:45.899 --> 01:10:48.389
And I don't want to lose her.

01:10:49.229 --> 01:10:50.129
Okay.

01:10:50.859 --> 01:10:53.569
Did you tell Reena about your fear?

01:10:55.119 --> 01:10:55.949
No.

01:10:56.289 --> 01:10:57.899
Why?
- I don't want to tell her.

01:10:58.949 --> 01:10:59.799
If I tell her

01:10:59.909 --> 01:11:02.989
she will leave me for that reason.

01:11:03.929 --> 01:11:04.739
If not

01:11:05.509 --> 01:11:07.609
she'd say that she loves me
just for the sake of it.

01:11:08.919 --> 01:11:10.029
In either case

01:11:10.359 --> 01:11:12.569
it will be difficult
for me and for her.

01:11:13.319 --> 01:11:14.199
Fair enough.

01:11:14.449 --> 01:11:15.529
We will get back to this later.

01:11:16.979 --> 01:11:19.779
Did you try an alternative?

01:11:20.189 --> 01:11:22.529
Like..
Did you try going to the gym?

01:11:23.679 --> 01:11:28.069
In order to change
your drinking habit, did you try

01:11:28.199 --> 01:11:29.649
to shift your focus
on something else?

01:11:30.359 --> 01:11:31.609
I tried everything, Manasa.

01:11:33.299 --> 01:11:34.279
But nothing worked.

01:11:35.289 --> 01:11:36.449
Manasa, I want a change.

01:11:37.009 --> 01:11:38.029
For Reena's sake

01:11:38.339 --> 01:11:40.939
I try to become a better person.

01:11:42.799 --> 01:11:44.029
But I can't do it.

01:11:45.779 --> 01:11:47.069
That's why I came to you.

01:11:48.549 --> 01:11:50.149
Arjun, try to understand.

01:11:51.069 --> 01:11:53.609
You should always try
to change only for yourself.

01:11:54.629 --> 01:11:56.989
If we try to change for others

01:11:57.359 --> 01:11:59.029
we may never achieve what we want.

01:11:59.749 --> 01:12:01.279
Okay, I'll give you something.

01:12:01.889 --> 01:12:03.619
I don't know how far
this will work.

01:12:03.699 --> 01:12:04.899
We will get to know gradually.

01:12:05.699 --> 01:12:07.779
You try some activity.

01:12:08.569 --> 01:12:09.609
Be it anything.

01:12:10.039 --> 01:12:11.439
Like meditation.

01:12:11.789 --> 01:12:13.779
Like gym, yoga, dance.

01:12:13.989 --> 01:12:15.399
You should get a dopamine hit.

01:12:15.599 --> 01:12:17.649
And whenever you feel like drinking

01:12:18.029 --> 01:12:19.789
use that to replace
your drinking habit.

01:12:22.319 --> 01:12:24.439
From today onwards,
I'll give you some tasks.

01:12:24.929 --> 01:12:27.529
Whenever you feel like drinking,
do this task.

01:12:29.029 --> 01:12:31.399
Then update me in the next session.

01:12:32.379 --> 01:12:33.519
Everything will be fine.

01:12:37.239 --> 01:12:38.359
Okay, Manasa.

01:12:51.189 --> 01:12:53.499
Guna, I'm sorry.

01:12:54.729 --> 01:12:56.899
I behaved like a fool.

01:12:58.289 --> 01:12:59.819
It's all my fault.

01:13:01.609 --> 01:13:03.529
I should have given you space.

01:13:04.029 --> 01:13:05.069
But I didn't.

01:13:05.659 --> 01:13:08.239
I was too focused on my
own problems and issues.

01:13:10.689 --> 01:13:11.919
I'm really sorry.

01:13:15.439 --> 01:13:16.439
What happened?

01:13:17.449 --> 01:13:19.079
Why are you still angry?

01:13:19.869 --> 01:13:20.869
I'm not angry.

01:13:21.359 --> 01:13:22.249
I'm fine.

01:13:22.529 --> 01:13:24.499
You're not angry?

01:13:25.289 --> 01:13:26.909
I'm saying that I'm not angry.

01:13:30.539 --> 01:13:34.029
You're angry because I didn't
reveal our relationship, right?

01:13:36.169 --> 01:13:37.239
It's not like that.

01:13:38.739 --> 01:13:39.869
It's not like that?

01:13:40.669 --> 01:13:43.029
You took a two-second gap
to say no, right?

01:13:43.589 --> 01:13:44.699
I knew it then.

01:13:44.879 --> 01:13:46.619
That's a big reason, too.

01:13:46.939 --> 01:13:48.159
I said it's not like that.

01:13:49.529 --> 01:13:50.449
Watch me.

01:13:51.769 --> 01:13:54.949
Hello everyone, look here..
- Get down.

01:13:55.029 --> 01:13:57.369
He is Dr. Guna.

01:13:57.489 --> 01:13:59.119
He and I are in love.

01:13:59.509 --> 01:14:01.239
We are in a relationship.

01:14:01.689 --> 01:14:04.169
Let's not gossip anymore.

01:14:04.309 --> 01:14:05.619
Let's get straight to the point.

01:14:05.759 --> 01:14:08.409
We will be the headlines
in this hospital.

01:14:09.279 --> 01:14:10.489
Senior, sit down.
- Hey..

01:14:10.609 --> 01:14:11.869
Wait a minute.

01:14:12.319 --> 01:14:14.119
I forgot to tell you.

01:14:14.529 --> 01:14:16.869
There is a two-year age
difference between us.

01:14:17.039 --> 01:14:18.119
He is younger than me.

01:14:18.259 --> 01:14:19.869
And we don't have
any problems at all.

01:14:21.059 --> 01:14:22.779
We are in a live-in relationship.

01:14:23.599 --> 01:14:25.159
Okay? You continue.

01:14:28.279 --> 01:14:29.119
Is it okay now?

01:14:29.419 --> 01:14:31.619
Let's not hide it anymore.

01:14:35.029 --> 01:14:36.659
Smile now.

01:14:38.509 --> 01:14:39.869
Why are you doing this?

01:14:44.459 --> 01:14:46.619
It's been a long time
since I saw you smile.

01:14:47.399 --> 01:14:49.619
You look beautiful when you smile.

01:14:51.479 --> 01:14:52.329
Enough.

01:14:59.189 --> 01:15:00.869
Mr. Dev.

01:15:01.329 --> 01:15:02.279
Vijay.

01:15:03.149 --> 01:15:04.779
What a surprise!
- What are you doing here?

01:15:04.909 --> 01:15:06.029
Is there a problem?

01:15:06.129 --> 01:15:07.449
No, Vijay.

01:15:07.589 --> 01:15:10.579
What are you doing here?
- I am investigating a case here.

01:15:10.649 --> 01:15:13.099
Is it about the athletes?
- Dad.

01:15:14.539 --> 01:15:15.409
Is she your daughter?

01:15:15.909 --> 01:15:17.369
Yes.
- Isn't she well?

01:15:18.779 --> 01:15:21.579
Dev, this is Dr. Radhi,
she is helping me with the case.

01:15:21.689 --> 01:15:24.659
Uncle, why are you introducing
my mom to my dad?

01:15:29.069 --> 01:15:29.949
Oh.

01:15:31.119 --> 01:15:33.119
Is Radhi your wife?

01:15:33.369 --> 01:15:35.449
The one you mentioned the other day.
- Yes.

01:15:36.979 --> 01:15:38.679
Sorry, Vijay, I have to leave soon.

01:15:38.869 --> 01:15:41.479
We will catch up sometime.
- Sure, let's meet sometime.

01:15:41.989 --> 01:15:42.989
Bye, uncle.
- Bye.

01:15:50.239 --> 01:15:51.579
Is Dev your husband?

01:15:52.879 --> 01:15:54.159
How do you know him?

01:15:54.909 --> 01:15:56.279
I met him once at a club.

01:15:56.519 --> 01:15:58.199
He was talking about his wife.

01:15:58.299 --> 01:15:59.859
I mean,
he was complaining about her.

01:16:00.229 --> 01:16:01.949
But I didn't know
that you are his wife.

01:16:02.619 --> 01:16:03.699
Now you know.

01:16:04.709 --> 01:16:06.779
I am married and I have two kids.

01:16:07.999 --> 01:16:10.529
From what he said, I think there
is some problem between you two.

01:16:11.139 --> 01:16:13.179
Things seem to be a bit odd between
the two of you.. - So?

01:16:14.239 --> 01:16:15.119
Nothing.

01:16:15.949 --> 01:16:17.079
I am just saying.

01:16:17.239 --> 01:16:18.489
Shall we talk about the case?

01:16:18.569 --> 01:16:20.119
Yes, of course, let's go.

01:16:28.549 --> 01:16:29.909
What is your daughter's name?

01:16:32.579 --> 01:16:33.909
I just asked you her name.

01:16:37.659 --> 01:16:38.579
Divi.

01:16:39.399 --> 01:16:40.359
Divi.

01:16:41.289 --> 01:16:42.449
She looks like you.

01:16:43.429 --> 01:16:44.329
Second.

01:16:44.439 --> 01:16:45.279
Let me guess.

01:16:45.549 --> 01:16:46.529
It is a boy, right?

01:16:48.409 --> 01:16:51.579
Why should I answer you?
- I am just asking.

01:16:55.369 --> 01:16:56.449
Yes, it is a boy.

01:16:56.619 --> 01:16:57.579
His name is Sid.

01:16:58.929 --> 01:17:01.279
How long have you been married?
- Twelve years.

01:17:02.349 --> 01:17:04.989
Vijay, shall we talk
about the case, please?

01:17:06.039 --> 01:17:07.209
Yeah..

01:17:09.869 --> 01:17:12.059
Back in the conference hall

01:17:12.429 --> 01:17:16.269
you said that Abhi has nothing
to do with this murder.

01:17:16.329 --> 01:17:17.949
That's right.
She has nothing to do with this.

01:17:18.079 --> 01:17:19.409
What she did is a crime, but..

01:17:19.699 --> 01:17:21.989
But it is not medical
negligence or murder.

01:17:23.159 --> 01:17:23.989
How?

01:17:24.229 --> 01:17:25.239
I have got a lead.

01:17:27.099 --> 01:17:28.449
Air embolism is the lead.

01:17:29.179 --> 01:17:31.619
We are ignoring the proof right in
front of us and searching elsewhere.

01:17:36.699 --> 01:17:39.529
I begged you
not to go to the media.

01:17:41.989 --> 01:17:43.239
Why did you do this?

01:17:44.749 --> 01:17:48.159
You have lost your child.
I understand that it is a big loss.

01:17:48.449 --> 01:17:51.869
But to reveal the truth
about how they died

01:17:52.119 --> 01:17:54.279
this is not going
to help you in any way. - Sir.

01:17:54.429 --> 01:17:59.129
My daughter was studying in a public
high school back in our village.

01:17:59.239 --> 01:18:02.869
My child was safe at home,
without any ambition in life.

01:18:02.949 --> 01:18:06.709
It was the coach who took her
to Chennai and shaped her.

01:18:06.799 --> 01:18:09.259
The coach said
that the hospital staff

01:18:09.339 --> 01:18:13.319
would tear up our children's bodies
in the name of post-mortem.

01:18:13.529 --> 01:18:15.199
You have done the same.

01:18:16.509 --> 01:18:17.739
What else did your coach say?

01:18:17.989 --> 01:18:19.829
He asked us to go to the media.

01:18:20.039 --> 01:18:22.739
He said that we will be compensated
only if we do this.

01:18:44.879 --> 01:18:48.699
Nurse, I need the list of visitors
to the ER from that day.

01:18:48.749 --> 01:18:51.199
Especially the athletes' visitors.
- Okay, sir.

01:19:07.489 --> 01:19:08.849
'I have never administered
an injection.'

01:19:08.909 --> 01:19:11.539
'The nurse seemed a bit nervous.
- She was actually shivering.'

01:19:11.679 --> 01:19:13.639
'How can I not get angry
when they used drugs?'

01:19:13.699 --> 01:19:16.179
'The coach told us..
- He asked us to go to the media.'

01:19:28.629 --> 01:19:29.739
Tell me, Vijay.

01:19:31.299 --> 01:19:32.579
I have two answers for you.

01:19:33.779 --> 01:19:36.489
First, your hospital
is in the clear.

01:19:36.829 --> 01:19:38.199
This was not medical negligence.

01:19:39.379 --> 01:19:40.329
Then is this a murder?

01:19:41.159 --> 01:19:42.119
Yeah.

01:19:43.659 --> 01:19:44.659
The second answer.

01:19:45.069 --> 01:19:48.319
The coach is the one
who committed the murders.

01:19:48.699 --> 01:19:49.579
What?

01:19:50.709 --> 01:19:51.529
Yeah.

01:19:52.789 --> 01:19:53.699
How is that possible?

01:19:54.509 --> 01:19:55.619
It's a combination of things.

01:19:56.739 --> 01:19:57.989
First, the coach's history.

01:19:58.509 --> 01:20:00.609
Before joining this training centre

01:20:00.779 --> 01:20:03.199
he was working at another
training centre in Kanchipuram.

01:20:03.279 --> 01:20:04.779
He was fired from his job there.

01:20:05.369 --> 01:20:06.319
Any guesses why?

01:20:11.199 --> 01:20:12.409
Sexual harassment?

01:20:13.079 --> 01:20:13.989
Yeah.

01:20:14.679 --> 01:20:18.329
H-How can you say this
with this clip alone?

01:20:21.619 --> 01:20:25.469
These are the photos
sent by the mortuary doctor.

01:20:25.649 --> 01:20:28.319
The photos show
bruises all over the bodies

01:20:28.529 --> 01:20:29.699
indicating harassment.

01:20:30.949 --> 01:20:33.239
The coach had been sexually
harassing those athletes.

01:20:35.399 --> 01:20:36.409
Apart from that

01:20:36.889 --> 01:20:38.489
this is the medical report
from our hospital.

01:20:39.369 --> 01:20:40.699
Look at this important detail.

01:20:40.849 --> 01:20:43.279
They had ingested the drugs.

01:20:43.689 --> 01:20:45.869
This is usually inhaled
through the nose.

01:20:46.929 --> 01:20:48.079
Nobody consumes through the mouth.

01:20:48.179 --> 01:20:49.659
So, they hadn't consumed this drug.

01:20:49.709 --> 01:20:51.779
It shows that they had consumed
it without their knowledge.

01:20:51.819 --> 01:20:54.449
Which means, it must have
been mixed in their juice or food.

01:20:54.709 --> 01:20:58.279
But there is no proof
that the coach did it.

01:21:01.079 --> 01:21:02.029
True.

01:21:10.669 --> 01:21:13.069
You are the one who gave the drugs
to those three athletes, right?

01:21:13.709 --> 01:21:15.249
Sir, how many times
do I have to tell you?

01:21:15.329 --> 01:21:16.449
I didn't do it.

01:21:17.839 --> 01:21:21.079
You only have theories.
Please don't blame me with that.

01:21:21.229 --> 01:21:22.699
Okay, forget about the drugs.

01:21:22.909 --> 01:21:24.719
That doesn't concern me.
I'm not here for that.

01:21:26.689 --> 01:21:28.239
This is murder, I repeat.

01:21:29.179 --> 01:21:32.379
The coach is the one who committed
the murders and I can prove it.

01:21:33.699 --> 01:21:35.489
We had already found that
in the beginning.

01:21:36.079 --> 01:21:38.069
Hey, we just suspected it.

01:21:38.619 --> 01:21:41.609
There is a difference.
- Oh, okay.

01:21:41.699 --> 01:21:44.919
Firstly, let's come to the cause
of death of these three athletes.

01:21:45.089 --> 01:21:46.279
What was the cause of their death?

01:21:46.699 --> 01:21:47.659
Air embolism.

01:21:48.349 --> 01:21:49.279
That's right.

01:21:49.699 --> 01:21:52.319
Dr. Radhi, air embolism.
What causes air embolism?

01:21:52.779 --> 01:21:58.029
If packs of air get stuck
in our body where it shouldn't be

01:21:58.759 --> 01:22:00.619
the respective organ will die.

01:22:00.839 --> 01:22:02.269
That is called an air embolism.

01:22:02.379 --> 01:22:05.119
Right. Is it a naturally
occurring embolism?

01:22:06.189 --> 01:22:07.409
It could be.

01:22:07.989 --> 01:22:08.989
Yes, it could be.

01:22:09.079 --> 01:22:11.979
But what are the chances of
three patients in the same hospital

01:22:11.999 --> 01:22:16.369
developing air embolism
at the same time?

01:22:17.279 --> 01:22:18.329
It could.

01:22:19.459 --> 01:22:21.579
But I don't know how to explain it.

01:22:21.779 --> 01:22:26.409
If it happens, it will be like
the rarest of the rare possibility.

01:22:27.669 --> 01:22:29.449
Otherwise, it is not a natural one.

01:22:30.289 --> 01:22:32.159
It's an understatement to call it
the rarest of the rare.

01:22:32.219 --> 01:22:34.449
So, this is not
naturally occurring.

01:22:37.639 --> 01:22:38.659
Look at these reports.

01:22:39.199 --> 01:22:41.239
Reports sent to me
by the mortuary doctor.

01:22:41.419 --> 01:22:44.239
There are injection marks in three
different places on the three bodies.

01:22:44.489 --> 01:22:46.699
The first patient had it
on her right ventricle.

01:22:47.079 --> 01:22:48.029
Cardiac arrest.

01:22:48.199 --> 01:22:50.139
The second patient had it
on her neck.

01:22:50.249 --> 01:22:52.579
Brain stroke. The third patient
had it on her lung.

01:22:52.679 --> 01:22:54.779
Pulmonary oedema.
All three patients

01:22:54.999 --> 01:22:59.739
were injected air through
absolutely empty syringes.

01:23:00.119 --> 01:23:01.449
That's what caused their death.

01:23:02.199 --> 01:23:03.199
Sir.

01:23:03.599 --> 01:23:05.489
There's no proof that I did it.

01:23:05.609 --> 01:23:07.159
That's right.
This is not a proof.

01:23:07.789 --> 01:23:10.529
Reena, can you bring Nurse Aruna?
- Sir.

01:23:10.639 --> 01:23:12.989
I've given her a file,
ask her to bring it. - Okay, sir.

01:23:14.029 --> 01:23:17.279
Someone had entered
your hospital and done this.

01:23:17.769 --> 01:23:18.949
What were you doing?

01:23:20.069 --> 01:23:21.389
We won't let you off.

01:23:21.539 --> 01:23:22.699
I'll file a case
against all of you.

01:23:22.999 --> 01:23:24.369
This is medical negligence.

01:23:25.009 --> 01:23:25.869
I'll file a case.

01:23:26.019 --> 01:23:27.869
All their parents will file a case.

01:23:42.739 --> 01:23:45.619
What now? Are you saying
that I did all this?

01:23:46.159 --> 01:23:47.449
Are you blaming me?
- Sir.

01:23:52.169 --> 01:23:53.659
He's the last one
who visited those girls.

01:23:54.229 --> 01:23:55.279
It's in the logs.

01:23:55.699 --> 01:23:56.619
This?

01:23:57.669 --> 01:23:58.659
Is this a proof?

01:23:59.229 --> 01:24:01.149
Sir, anyone can write
anything in the logs.

01:24:01.749 --> 01:24:03.839
Please don't show this
to me as a proof.

01:24:03.929 --> 01:24:04.779
Correct.

01:24:05.079 --> 01:24:06.079
We can change the logs.

01:24:06.669 --> 01:24:08.569
But how can we change
the CCTV footage?

01:24:15.069 --> 01:24:15.969
Hello.

01:24:16.979 --> 01:24:18.119
What are you saying?

01:24:19.039 --> 01:24:21.279
No hospitals have CCTV cameras
in their emergency rooms.

01:24:21.749 --> 01:24:25.029
Why does it matter to a visitor
whether there are cameras or not?

01:24:28.909 --> 01:24:30.079
I'll show you something.

01:24:30.619 --> 01:24:34.399
Look here, this is the footage
of the doctor and the nurse.

01:24:38.739 --> 01:24:40.449
I have the footage of what you did.

01:24:42.489 --> 01:24:43.449
Shall I show it to you?

01:24:44.699 --> 01:24:45.739
If I show it now

01:24:46.029 --> 01:24:48.239
the girls' parents
will beat you to death.

01:24:50.459 --> 01:24:51.779
Oh..
- I'll tell you, sir.

01:24:54.239 --> 01:24:55.199
I'll tell you.

01:25:00.329 --> 01:25:01.279
I did it, sir.

01:25:07.529 --> 01:25:08.909
It happened at the institute, sir.

01:25:12.279 --> 01:25:13.199
Harassment.

01:25:13.649 --> 01:25:14.649
Yes.

01:25:17.029 --> 01:25:19.119
Those three girls threatened
to expose me, sir.

01:25:21.189 --> 01:25:22.449
They didn't listen to me.

01:25:24.489 --> 01:25:26.409
I didn't know what
to do, that's why..

01:25:26.769 --> 01:25:28.159
I mixed cocaine in their food.

01:25:28.939 --> 01:25:30.699
Even after getting them
admitted to the hospital

01:25:31.679 --> 01:25:33.149
I tried to reason with them.

01:25:33.609 --> 01:25:35.069
I warned them
but they didn't listen to me.

01:25:39.879 --> 01:25:41.449
I didn't know what to do, sir.

01:25:43.379 --> 01:25:44.949
I don't know why I did it, sir.

01:25:45.349 --> 01:25:46.579
I don't know..

01:25:48.809 --> 01:25:49.809
That's it.

01:25:52.219 --> 01:25:53.329
That's it.

01:26:03.969 --> 01:26:04.949
Sir.

01:26:05.309 --> 01:26:07.989
There is no CCTV camera
in our emergency room.

01:26:08.659 --> 01:26:09.569
No, right?

01:26:10.229 --> 01:26:11.189
I know.

01:26:11.819 --> 01:26:13.079
I set it up yesterday.

01:26:13.449 --> 01:26:14.339
Oh.

01:26:14.819 --> 01:26:16.909
What about the footage
of the murder?

01:26:17.489 --> 01:26:18.369
No footage.

01:26:19.079 --> 01:26:20.579
I bluffed confidently
and he bought it.

01:26:21.909 --> 01:26:23.909
Nice.
- Thank you.

01:26:28.779 --> 01:26:30.829
The only thing that hadn't happened
in this hospital was a murder.

01:26:31.509 --> 01:26:32.699
And that has happened too.

01:26:33.489 --> 01:26:35.409
Anyway, thank you, sir.

01:26:35.809 --> 01:26:36.829
Thank you so much.

01:26:37.199 --> 01:26:39.689
If you hadn’t been here, I don't
know what would have happened.

01:26:40.869 --> 01:26:42.049
No need to thank me, Arjun.

01:26:43.489 --> 01:26:45.579
I've mailed you the final
details of the case.

01:26:45.989 --> 01:26:47.489
Everything that happened
is logged in it.

01:26:48.069 --> 01:26:49.779
You can forward it
to the Medical Council.

01:26:49.889 --> 01:26:50.869
Okay, sir.

01:26:51.469 --> 01:26:55.909
I didn't document anything
about the Abhi-Amaya issue.

01:26:56.649 --> 01:26:58.409
You have to take
a decision about it.

01:26:58.479 --> 01:27:00.279
I trust you to do the right thing.

01:27:00.729 --> 01:27:01.699
Definitely.

01:27:03.539 --> 01:27:05.779
Then, Arjun, I need a help.

01:27:06.849 --> 01:27:07.829
Anything, sir.

01:27:09.119 --> 01:27:10.879
I really liked your hospital.

01:27:11.109 --> 01:27:13.149
The ambience and the people here.

01:27:13.599 --> 01:27:16.699
I was thinking of staying back
and working here for a few months.

01:27:17.099 --> 01:27:18.199
What do you think?

01:27:24.409 --> 01:27:25.829
What do you think, Arjun?

01:27:26.169 --> 01:27:27.079
No.

01:27:27.499 --> 01:27:28.449
It's not like that, sir.

01:27:29.519 --> 01:27:31.909
I didn't expect you
to ask me this question.

01:27:32.839 --> 01:27:35.199
Sir, if you work in this hospital

01:27:35.409 --> 01:27:36.409
I'll be very happy.

01:27:36.989 --> 01:27:39.279
But currently, there
are no vacancies here.

01:27:39.519 --> 01:27:41.449
And also, I can't take
this decision alone, sir.

01:27:41.529 --> 01:27:43.159
I have to consult
the chief doctor also.

01:27:44.239 --> 01:27:46.359
Why don't you make
this decision as a CEO?

01:27:47.339 --> 01:27:48.409
You don't know, sir.

01:27:49.029 --> 01:27:50.739
I have a lot of problems
hanging over me.

01:27:51.409 --> 01:27:52.989
So I can't take this
decision now, sir.

01:27:53.749 --> 01:27:54.829
I hope you understand.

01:27:56.499 --> 01:27:59.489
But I'll definitely see
what I can do, sir.

01:28:00.789 --> 01:28:02.949
Okay, right, thank you.

01:28:03.459 --> 01:28:05.029
Thank you, Arjun.
- Thank you, sir.

01:29:05.256 --> 01:29:08.256
'Teju, you handle
the athletes' case from now on.'

01:29:08.556 --> 01:29:11.036
'Reena, you are relieved
from that case from now on.'

01:29:11.136 --> 01:29:12.006
'Vijay.'

01:29:13.926 --> 01:29:15.836
'Even now, there is
an important case at the hospital.'

01:29:15.936 --> 01:29:19.126
'The medical counsellor, Dr. Vijay,
asked for Dr. Radhi for that case.'

01:29:19.276 --> 01:29:21.506
'We don't trust this
hospital at all, sir.'

01:29:21.556 --> 01:29:23.466
'They are the ones who
killed our children, sir.'

01:29:23.726 --> 01:29:26.766
'If they had listened to me,
they would have won.'

01:29:26.846 --> 01:29:27.876
'What to do now?'

01:29:27.976 --> 01:29:29.976
'What is this stain?
It looks unusual, right?'

01:29:30.016 --> 01:29:31.126
'What are you saying, Vijay?'

01:29:31.256 --> 01:29:33.956
'This pillow could have
been used to kill them.'

01:29:34.246 --> 01:29:35.166
'I did it, sir.'

01:29:36.666 --> 01:29:38.426
'I like your hospital a lot.'

01:29:38.586 --> 01:29:41.216
'I was thinking of staying back
and working here for a few months.'

01:29:41.356 --> 01:29:42.966
'I have a lot of problems
hanging over me.'

01:29:43.106 --> 01:29:44.626
'So I can't take this decision
right now, sir.'

01:29:44.676 --> 01:29:45.716
'I hope you understand.'

01:30:06.536 --> 01:30:09.576
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:30:11.656 --> 01:30:14.086
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:30:16.666 --> 01:30:19.656
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:30:21.376 --> 01:30:23.696
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:30:23.806 --> 01:30:26.286
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:30:26.376 --> 01:30:28.986
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:30:29.126 --> 01:30:31.686
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:30:34.006 --> 01:30:36.836
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:30:39.086 --> 01:30:41.836
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:30:43.746 --> 01:30:48.296
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:30:59.626 --> 01:31:03.756
At last, the athlete's case
investigation has come to an end.

01:31:04.006 --> 01:31:05.496
Tell me about it.

01:31:05.626 --> 01:31:08.426
Everyone in this
hospital is going crazy.

01:31:09.626 --> 01:31:10.886
That's not a problem, Rocky.

01:31:11.856 --> 01:31:14.586
Someone here had a very close call.

01:31:18.416 --> 01:31:22.856
W-What? Why are all
the satellites turning towards me?

01:31:23.006 --> 01:31:24.226
It's nothing, Kamal.

01:31:24.376 --> 01:31:27.126
If it's wrong to impersonate, it's
wrong to provoke them too, right?

01:31:27.246 --> 01:31:28.666
Who provoked whom?

01:31:29.126 --> 01:31:31.566
Poor Amaya was struggling so much.

01:31:31.626 --> 01:31:34.086
So I just agreed to help
for a few days, that's all.

01:31:34.216 --> 01:31:36.256
They said Amaya will take
two months to recover.

01:31:36.546 --> 01:31:37.466
Did you see that?

01:31:37.666 --> 01:31:40.716
You are also with them.
Don't laugh.

01:31:40.856 --> 01:31:41.696
Hey, Reena.

01:31:42.026 --> 01:31:43.166
What did Dr. Radhi says?

01:31:43.556 --> 01:31:45.756
How was it working
with the new doctor, Vijay?

01:31:46.246 --> 01:31:47.066
I don't know.

01:31:47.306 --> 01:31:50.326
Arjun told me that Dr. Vijay
wanted to work here.

01:31:51.296 --> 01:31:54.336
Oh.. Is there such a big
demand for our hospital?

01:31:54.776 --> 01:31:56.336
What do you mean?

01:32:00.396 --> 01:32:03.586
Naveen, I need
to talk to you alone.

01:32:13.056 --> 01:32:13.886
What?

01:32:14.546 --> 01:32:16.886
Why is the lover boy
so quiet today?

01:32:18.956 --> 01:32:19.916
Keep quiet, Rocky.

01:32:21.156 --> 01:32:22.076
No.

01:32:22.566 --> 01:32:23.416
It's not right.

01:32:23.706 --> 01:32:26.046
Hey, what's the problem?
Tell me.

01:32:26.676 --> 01:32:28.546
Why you..
- It's nothing, Rocky.

01:32:29.106 --> 01:32:31.166
If you remind someone
of their place

01:32:31.456 --> 01:32:32.876
this is what they'd look like.

01:32:33.746 --> 01:32:34.626
You are right, Reena.

01:32:36.066 --> 01:32:38.006
Everyone should know their place.

01:32:38.606 --> 01:32:40.466
Hey, didn't I apologise to you?

01:32:41.786 --> 01:32:42.626
I get it.

01:32:42.786 --> 01:32:45.506
You are silent because you got
beaten up by both of them.

01:32:45.616 --> 01:32:46.506
You deserve it.

01:32:46.936 --> 01:32:47.766
They are right.

01:32:47.836 --> 01:32:49.506
You should know your place.

01:32:52.796 --> 01:32:53.636
What is it?

01:32:54.086 --> 01:32:55.256
He got angry.

01:33:01.586 --> 01:33:02.456
Oh, no..

01:33:02.506 --> 01:33:04.736
Why are you all sitting here
during your work hours?

01:33:05.036 --> 01:33:06.126
Get back to work.

01:33:06.906 --> 01:33:09.796
Aruna, don't you know
any other dialogue?

01:33:10.006 --> 01:33:12.216
Hey, this is my job.
- Okay, fine.

01:33:15.466 --> 01:33:16.356
Why, Rocky?

01:33:19.006 --> 01:33:19.956
Hey, Guna.

01:33:24.666 --> 01:33:25.506
Guna.

01:33:26.556 --> 01:33:28.546
Since everyone has found out
about you.

01:33:29.406 --> 01:33:32.956
I understand that you want
to ask Naveen about Madhan.

01:33:33.686 --> 01:33:34.546
But..

01:33:35.626 --> 01:33:36.456
What is it now?

01:33:36.686 --> 01:33:38.006
You don't want me telling Naveen.

01:33:38.186 --> 01:33:40.796
So, have you decided
to blackmail me?

01:33:41.556 --> 01:33:42.456
Guna.

01:33:43.766 --> 01:33:46.086
Ask Naveen about this
or don't ask him.

01:33:47.036 --> 01:33:48.506
I don't have any
worries about that.

01:33:49.456 --> 01:33:52.546
But don't accuse Naveen
like you accused me.

01:33:54.056 --> 01:33:55.166
I trust you.

01:33:55.926 --> 01:33:59.256
Last time, it felt like
you threatened me.

01:34:00.486 --> 01:34:01.376
What happened now?

01:34:01.826 --> 01:34:02.876
You sound meek.

01:34:05.776 --> 01:34:06.706
Because..

01:34:07.206 --> 01:34:08.506
Naveen is a good friend of mine.

01:34:09.666 --> 01:34:10.706
Not just for me.

01:34:11.706 --> 01:34:12.526
For you too.

01:34:12.606 --> 01:34:15.666
If anyone here has a problem,
he is the first person to help.

01:34:17.206 --> 01:34:21.586
If there is a problem in this
hospital because of his family

01:34:22.276 --> 01:34:24.626
he will definitely
stand by this hospital.

01:34:25.706 --> 01:34:27.126
He won't take his family's side.

01:34:28.506 --> 01:34:31.336
I am saying this because I
have seen him from up close.

01:34:31.706 --> 01:34:33.456
Whether I trust anyone here or not,

01:34:34.336 --> 01:34:35.666
I trust Naveen completely.

01:34:37.976 --> 01:34:40.836
I feel that it is better
to leave it at this.

01:34:44.196 --> 01:34:45.666
It is up to you now.

01:34:50.246 --> 01:34:51.556
Why didn't you tell me
when you arrived?

01:34:51.626 --> 01:34:53.626
You didn't even tell me
that you've joined the hospital.

01:34:54.796 --> 01:34:56.746
I am here regarding
an investigation, right?

01:34:57.556 --> 01:34:59.456
Sensitive information,
confidential trip.

01:35:00.126 --> 01:35:02.166
Assume that I was
maintaining a low profile.

01:35:02.476 --> 01:35:03.336
I understand.

01:35:05.896 --> 01:35:08.686
Dev, don't mistake me
for asking you this.

01:35:08.916 --> 01:35:11.516
You don't have to answer me either.

01:35:13.126 --> 01:35:17.496
But what is the problem
between you and Radhi?

01:35:18.506 --> 01:35:20.376
You married her
for love, didn't you?

01:35:20.676 --> 01:35:21.546
So..

01:35:23.586 --> 01:35:26.036
Is it not working out
even after all these years?

01:35:27.156 --> 01:35:28.206
Are you bored?

01:35:28.576 --> 01:35:29.446
No. No.

01:35:29.876 --> 01:35:30.916
It is not like that, Vijay.

01:35:32.626 --> 01:35:33.836
I always admire Radhi.

01:35:34.886 --> 01:35:36.506
Be it her decision-making skills

01:35:37.246 --> 01:35:39.126
be it her command over work..

01:35:40.046 --> 01:35:42.436
Even if it is a small issue,
she'd take care of it.

01:35:42.836 --> 01:35:43.876
She is a lioness.

01:35:45.456 --> 01:35:46.456
Also, she is childlike.

01:35:47.006 --> 01:35:49.956
When she plays with children,
she becomes a child herself.

01:35:50.876 --> 01:35:52.786
And she easily gels with everyone.

01:35:53.736 --> 01:35:58.396
Everyone tells me that I'm grumpy
and that I should smile like Radhi.

01:35:59.166 --> 01:36:01.546
But it's actually me
who laughs more than Radhi.

01:36:02.236 --> 01:36:03.416
Nobody knows that.

01:36:05.456 --> 01:36:08.376
When I am with her,
I don't get bored.

01:36:09.276 --> 01:36:11.166
Even if it is just for an hour

01:36:11.996 --> 01:36:13.626
or for an entire lifetime.

01:36:14.836 --> 01:36:16.626
She is something.

01:36:18.376 --> 01:36:19.916
Then, tell me that
there is no problem.

01:36:20.056 --> 01:36:21.536
You are still
in love with her, man.

01:36:24.986 --> 01:36:26.166
Or is this a..

01:36:27.546 --> 01:36:29.956
Does Radhi have any affairs?
- Stop it, Vijay.

01:36:30.506 --> 01:36:31.796
Don't talk ill of her.

01:36:34.336 --> 01:36:36.746
I understand. I am sorry, I was
just asking. I just wanted to know.

01:36:36.826 --> 01:36:37.756
I am sorry.

01:36:41.746 --> 01:36:43.166
Anyway, forget all that.

01:36:44.456 --> 01:36:45.546
Tell me about yourself.

01:36:48.086 --> 01:36:49.916
Have you decided to divorce Radhi?

01:36:52.756 --> 01:36:55.626
In fact, I have sent her
a divorce notice already.

01:36:55.926 --> 01:36:58.126
But she has not responded yet.

01:37:03.626 --> 01:37:04.876
Shall I order something to eat?

01:37:05.956 --> 01:37:06.826
Excuse me.

01:37:10.376 --> 01:37:12.126
So, Amaya..

01:37:13.206 --> 01:37:16.876
I didn't expect this from you.
How could you do such a thing?

01:37:17.416 --> 01:37:19.336
If Dr. Vijay had not
found out about this

01:37:19.546 --> 01:37:21.586
you would have continued it, right?

01:37:22.336 --> 01:37:24.086
Arjun, what is your decision?

01:37:28.216 --> 01:37:29.836
I have decided to suspend Amaya.

01:37:31.046 --> 01:37:31.936
What?

01:37:32.466 --> 01:37:33.626
Are you going to suspend her?

01:37:34.426 --> 01:37:35.836
What is the basis
for your decision?

01:37:35.906 --> 01:37:37.126
What kind of management is this?

01:37:38.576 --> 01:37:40.276
I have thought about it, sir.

01:37:40.536 --> 01:37:42.176
What she did is a crime, Arjun.

01:37:42.246 --> 01:37:44.286
You should fire her for this.

01:37:45.166 --> 01:37:46.026
Sir.

01:37:46.166 --> 01:37:48.546
You were there when we
questioned Abhinaya, right?

01:37:48.686 --> 01:37:51.216
She had come to the hospital
disguised as Amaya

01:37:51.296 --> 01:37:53.006
but she did not attend
to any of the patients.

01:37:53.396 --> 01:37:55.756
And she was aware the whole time.
- So?

01:37:56.046 --> 01:37:57.716
Are you saying that
we should forgive her?

01:37:57.906 --> 01:38:00.716
Luckily.. No one was affected.

01:38:00.976 --> 01:38:02.376
But in the future

01:38:02.666 --> 01:38:04.166
if Amaya faces another problem

01:38:04.556 --> 01:38:07.006
what is the guarantee that Abhinaya
will not come in her place?

01:38:08.106 --> 01:38:10.376
Sir, I am sorry.

01:38:10.826 --> 01:38:13.176
I did not have any
other option, sir.

01:38:13.376 --> 01:38:14.786
Please consider it, sir.

01:38:14.926 --> 01:38:16.876
This will not happen again, sir.

01:38:17.516 --> 01:38:19.916
Sir, my family is depending on me.

01:38:21.266 --> 01:38:24.296
Continue, Amaya.
Tell us your problems one by one.

01:38:24.716 --> 01:38:29.166
Our CEO will listen to it
and take an emotional decision.

01:38:29.506 --> 01:38:32.086
Because he is so soft-hearted.

01:38:33.676 --> 01:38:36.216
Sir, what Arjun did now
should have been your decision.

01:38:36.496 --> 01:38:38.256
You are saying that
we should fire her.

01:38:38.416 --> 01:38:40.806
You could have thought
of an alternative option, right?

01:38:40.856 --> 01:38:42.006
Ma'am, one minute.

01:38:47.416 --> 01:38:48.336
Amaya.

01:38:48.956 --> 01:38:50.616
I am suspending you for one month.

01:38:50.946 --> 01:38:52.866
Come back and join us
after your leg heals.

01:38:55.456 --> 01:38:56.416
Now, you may leave.

01:38:59.666 --> 01:39:00.796
What? Arjun..

01:39:14.876 --> 01:39:16.916
I don't think it was a suspension.

01:39:17.666 --> 01:39:19.606
It feels like she is taking time off
owing to her leg injury.

01:39:20.876 --> 01:39:21.746
Go ahead.

01:39:22.336 --> 01:39:25.866
Arjun, use your power
to your advantage.

01:39:27.506 --> 01:39:29.196
This will go on
only for a few days, right?

01:39:30.546 --> 01:39:32.316
I will take care of it
when it happens, sir.

01:39:33.196 --> 01:39:34.506
It will definitely happen, Arjun.

01:39:34.996 --> 01:39:36.336
What kind of decisions
are you taking?

01:39:36.686 --> 01:39:38.666
You are suspending the person
who should be fired.

01:39:39.116 --> 01:39:40.576
You are giving
permission to Dr. Vijay

01:39:40.626 --> 01:39:42.086
to work for extended
periods of time.

01:39:42.656 --> 01:39:43.516
What?

01:39:45.786 --> 01:39:47.336
Dr. Vijay is going to work here?

01:39:47.596 --> 01:39:50.006
Ma'am, I haven't decided yet.

01:39:50.916 --> 01:39:52.666
I thought it would be better
if he worked here.

01:39:53.796 --> 01:39:56.336
There are already many
doctors in our hospital, Arjun.

01:39:56.546 --> 01:39:59.126
Ma'am, Dr. Vijay requested me.

01:40:00.366 --> 01:40:02.836
And that too, if a doctor
like him works in our hospital

01:40:03.336 --> 01:40:04.956
isn't it good for our hospital?

01:40:05.836 --> 01:40:07.256
I am so sorry, Arjun.

01:40:07.706 --> 01:40:09.466
I second Dr. Preetham on this.

01:40:10.516 --> 01:40:12.006
I don't understand anything.

01:40:13.546 --> 01:40:15.256
I am trying to help you.

01:40:16.446 --> 01:40:18.796
I am trying to reduce your burden.

01:40:20.366 --> 01:40:22.836
Without understanding that,
you both are saying something else.

01:40:24.026 --> 01:40:26.236
Arjun, I was supporting
you all this time.

01:40:26.376 --> 01:40:27.276
Right, ma'am.

01:40:28.576 --> 01:40:29.916
But as senior doctors

01:40:30.566 --> 01:40:32.506
you guys are supposed
to be on the same page.

01:40:34.936 --> 01:40:37.126
If there is any case, he
doesn't agree to what you say.

01:40:37.196 --> 01:40:38.586
And you don't agree
to what he says.

01:40:38.906 --> 01:40:40.626
There is always an argument.

01:40:41.416 --> 01:40:45.466
Is it wrong to think of helping the
doctors like we helped the nurses?

01:40:48.236 --> 01:40:49.166
And sir..

01:40:49.476 --> 01:40:52.966
You are blaming the management
in the Amaya issue, right?

01:40:55.266 --> 01:40:56.756
There are so many
people working here.

01:40:57.896 --> 01:40:59.756
Didn't anyone get
a doubt on Amaya?

01:41:03.106 --> 01:41:05.126
Didn't a single doctor go and check

01:41:06.306 --> 01:41:08.296
if she was working properly or not?

01:41:13.296 --> 01:41:16.506
Who works on the ground,
with the staff and the patients?

01:41:17.616 --> 01:41:19.586
Is it you or me?

01:41:21.596 --> 01:41:23.966
I can only serve by
supervising and supporting you.

01:41:25.626 --> 01:41:26.506
But..

01:41:28.796 --> 01:41:30.706
I will take the full
responsibility for this.

01:41:31.526 --> 01:41:32.466
And now..

01:41:34.026 --> 01:41:36.296
I think I should appoint
a doctor here.

01:41:37.356 --> 01:41:38.796
Anybody have a problem with that?

01:41:39.046 --> 01:41:39.916
So..

01:41:40.716 --> 01:41:43.006
I shouldn't ask you
any questions, right?

01:41:43.316 --> 01:41:44.296
You can ask me, sir.

01:41:44.376 --> 01:41:45.876
You can ask me as many
questions as you want.

01:41:46.386 --> 01:41:47.586
I will answer them.

01:41:49.936 --> 01:41:54.396
But the decision,
will ultimately be mine.

01:41:56.106 --> 01:41:57.086
I hope I am clear.

01:42:05.546 --> 01:42:07.236
Nothing, it will be alright.

01:42:07.316 --> 01:42:09.836
Call the doctor.
- It's nothing.

01:42:09.886 --> 01:42:12.166
It's nothing.
- Don't worry.

01:42:12.296 --> 01:42:13.756
It will be alright.
- You'll be fine.

01:42:14.666 --> 01:42:16.126
Hey, what are you doing?

01:42:16.296 --> 01:42:17.546
Ask the senior doctor to come here.

01:42:22.846 --> 01:42:24.366
It's hurting.
- Ma'am.

01:42:24.776 --> 01:42:27.716
You are not listening
to what we are saying.

01:42:27.956 --> 01:42:28.846
What happened to him?

01:42:28.976 --> 01:42:30.516
It's nothing, there was a fight.

01:42:30.626 --> 01:42:32.196
They hit him.

01:42:32.246 --> 01:42:34.726
One of them kicked
him in the chest.

01:42:34.846 --> 01:42:36.416
He fell down.

01:42:37.916 --> 01:42:40.666
Doctor, why are you checking him?

01:42:40.826 --> 01:42:41.906
Do you know whose son he is?

01:42:42.076 --> 01:42:44.416
It doesn't matter.
This is an emergency.

01:42:44.496 --> 01:42:46.716
We don't have time to wait
for the senior doctors.

01:42:46.876 --> 01:42:48.686
We won't let you touch him
until a senior doctor arrives.

01:42:48.946 --> 01:42:51.596
Sir, if someone has
hit him in the chest

01:42:51.746 --> 01:42:53.546
I have to perform a thoracostomy.

01:42:53.866 --> 01:42:56.716
If we wait for the senior doctors,
you won't see him alive.

01:42:57.126 --> 01:42:58.296
Look here.

01:42:58.796 --> 01:43:00.256
If anything happens to him

01:43:00.336 --> 01:43:02.546
I will make sure that this
hospital gets destroyed.

01:43:03.916 --> 01:43:05.346
If my diagnosis is correct

01:43:05.626 --> 01:43:07.586
he will start suffocating
in some time.

01:43:20.636 --> 01:43:23.716
In a few seconds,
he will become unconscious.

01:43:31.866 --> 01:43:34.216
His condition is called
cardiac tamponade.

01:43:34.666 --> 01:43:37.046
If we don't perform a thoracostomy,
his heart will get affected.

01:43:37.166 --> 01:43:38.816
When the body tries to compensate

01:43:39.006 --> 01:43:40.396
due to low cardiac output

01:43:40.446 --> 01:43:42.546
his kidneys, liver
and lungs will get affected.

01:43:42.666 --> 01:43:44.876
He will become unconscious
before all this happens.

01:43:45.626 --> 01:43:48.586
Then, he will die.
What will you tell your boss?

01:43:48.836 --> 01:43:50.726
"Boss, a doctor would
have saved him."

01:43:50.886 --> 01:43:53.006
"But we stopped her and
let him die." Will you say that?

01:43:55.846 --> 01:43:57.906
Nurse, ready the OT.
- Okay, Doctor.

01:44:03.836 --> 01:44:05.156
Very good job, you did great.

01:44:05.746 --> 01:44:06.576
Sir.

01:44:06.646 --> 01:44:08.176
I heard what you
were saying in the ER.

01:44:08.546 --> 01:44:10.466
You handled the situation
very well, good job.

01:44:11.266 --> 01:44:12.166
Thank you, sir.

01:44:12.636 --> 01:44:13.626
After Dr. Radhi

01:44:13.796 --> 01:44:15.796
I have learnt from
the senior doctors here.

01:44:16.336 --> 01:44:17.836
Good, keep it up.

01:44:18.416 --> 01:44:19.716
Thank you, sir.
- Sir.

01:44:19.866 --> 01:44:21.216
Arun, right?
- Yes, sir.

01:44:22.156 --> 01:44:24.086
Why are you so late?
- Sorry, sir.

01:44:24.206 --> 01:44:25.196
I was stuck in traffic.

01:44:25.746 --> 01:44:27.206
You were stuck in traffic?

01:44:28.986 --> 01:44:30.296
Is this an excuse?

01:44:31.286 --> 01:44:32.946
Sir, I have never been late before.

01:44:33.126 --> 01:44:33.986
This is my first time.

01:44:34.226 --> 01:44:36.376
Please excuse me.

01:44:36.536 --> 01:44:38.046
No, I don't like it
when someone's late.

01:44:38.586 --> 01:44:39.706
What should we do with him?

01:44:43.736 --> 01:44:46.166
Sir, is it a crime to be late?

01:44:46.766 --> 01:44:49.046
A lot of people here
come late to work.

01:44:49.606 --> 01:44:51.696
He was late for the first time.

01:44:51.876 --> 01:44:52.796
Let's forgive him.

01:44:53.416 --> 01:44:54.506
This won't work.

01:44:55.876 --> 01:44:56.896
Give me 50 squats.

01:44:58.636 --> 01:45:00.416
Sir.
- Give me 50 squats, you know?

01:45:04.586 --> 01:45:05.546
Why, sir?

01:45:05.976 --> 01:45:06.836
What do you mean?

01:45:07.156 --> 01:45:10.466
Before coming to this hospital

01:45:10.676 --> 01:45:12.126
did you do any research?

01:45:12.376 --> 01:45:13.366
Why do you ask?

01:45:13.456 --> 01:45:16.206
If we are late

01:45:16.296 --> 01:45:19.046
Dr. Radhi gives the same
punishment. 50 squats.

01:45:19.476 --> 01:45:20.326
Really?

01:45:20.666 --> 01:45:22.576
Yes, sir, didn't you know?

01:45:22.746 --> 01:45:24.126
No, I knew it.

01:45:24.836 --> 01:45:27.166
I heard about it.
I wanted to follow the same format.

01:45:27.716 --> 01:45:29.696
You continue.
- Oh.

01:45:38.836 --> 01:45:40.716
Check these files
and update the log.

01:45:40.776 --> 01:45:42.256
I have to submit it tomorrow.
- Nilofer.

01:45:42.876 --> 01:45:44.086
I've apologised to you, right?

01:45:44.676 --> 01:45:46.006
Why are you still angry with me?

01:45:46.696 --> 01:45:48.296
Who told you that
I am angry with you?

01:45:49.696 --> 01:45:52.386
When Reena said that I have
to know my place earlier

01:45:52.446 --> 01:45:53.506
why did you agree?

01:45:54.516 --> 01:45:55.586
That's not anger.

01:45:55.916 --> 01:45:56.756
It's a fact.

01:45:58.256 --> 01:46:00.656
You are damaging me a lot.

01:46:05.256 --> 01:46:06.086
Okay.

01:46:06.826 --> 01:46:08.336
Tell me more about that guy.

01:46:08.996 --> 01:46:09.836
Which guy?

01:46:10.216 --> 01:46:11.586
Your ex-boyfriend.

01:46:15.046 --> 01:46:17.256
I can't forget him. That's why
I am not talking about him.

01:46:17.526 --> 01:46:20.336
Don't remind me of him.
Do you understand?

01:46:20.826 --> 01:46:22.796
Hey, just tell me, Nilofer.

01:46:23.026 --> 01:46:26.046
How did you fall in love? Where
did you meet? Something like that.

01:46:26.956 --> 01:46:27.856
Why do you care?

01:46:28.106 --> 01:46:29.796
Why are you so eager
to know about him?

01:46:29.876 --> 01:46:33.146
If there is a back story
like in the movies

01:46:33.246 --> 01:46:34.196
it will be entertaining.

01:46:34.476 --> 01:46:36.376
The back story is better
than the movies.

01:46:37.666 --> 01:46:39.936
I will decide after hearing
that story, tell me now.

01:46:40.406 --> 01:46:41.476
Is this important now?

01:46:41.636 --> 01:46:43.416
I have a lot of work.

01:46:43.576 --> 01:46:44.546
Get lost.

01:46:45.586 --> 01:46:46.506
You are right.

01:46:49.126 --> 01:46:51.266
Are you free on weekends?

01:46:51.346 --> 01:46:52.256
No, I am busy.

01:46:52.656 --> 01:46:53.626
Why are you busy?

01:46:54.326 --> 01:46:55.416
I am going shopping.

01:46:55.846 --> 01:46:58.916
Super, I will come along.
We can go shopping together.

01:47:00.106 --> 01:47:03.926
Are you trying to do the same thing
with me like what you did with Reena?

01:47:03.996 --> 01:47:05.756
Don't talk like a fool.

01:47:06.046 --> 01:47:06.966
It's nothing like that.

01:47:07.506 --> 01:47:09.046
I just wanted to know about him.

01:47:09.406 --> 01:47:11.626
Also, I thought I knew
everything about you.

01:47:11.836 --> 01:47:14.296
But I didn't know that
you had this side to you.

01:47:15.846 --> 01:47:17.006
Look, Nilofer.

01:47:17.386 --> 01:47:18.416
I didn't invite you.

01:47:18.686 --> 01:47:21.376
You are going shopping.
So I invited myself.

01:47:22.706 --> 01:47:23.756
You are making it up.

01:47:24.986 --> 01:47:26.006
We are going shopping, right?

01:47:26.636 --> 01:47:27.876
Are you going to let it go
if I say no?

01:47:29.216 --> 01:47:30.416
Shopping, right?

01:47:31.186 --> 01:47:32.296
Come.

01:47:46.436 --> 01:47:47.466
Done for the day?

01:47:48.676 --> 01:47:51.326
Arjun told me that you wanted
to work in this hospital?

01:47:52.256 --> 01:47:53.416
Yes.
- Why?

01:47:55.586 --> 01:47:57.046
I wanted to work
here for a few days.

01:47:57.136 --> 01:47:58.326
It's my hometown.

01:47:58.776 --> 01:48:00.626
You already have a job in Mumbai.

01:48:01.216 --> 01:48:02.716
I've spoken to them.

01:48:02.876 --> 01:48:05.376
It will be a good experience
if I work here for two months.

01:48:06.296 --> 01:48:10.336
I like working here and
the people who work here.

01:48:10.416 --> 01:48:11.296
Look, Vijay.

01:48:12.746 --> 01:48:16.416
I don't know why you came here
and why you want to work here.

01:48:17.036 --> 01:48:18.126
What don't you know?

01:48:18.596 --> 01:48:20.666
Is this rocket science?

01:48:21.476 --> 01:48:24.876
Obviously, I am
here because of you.

01:48:26.616 --> 01:48:28.006
What are you blabbering?

01:48:29.016 --> 01:48:31.546
You are in a difficult
situation in your life.

01:48:32.006 --> 01:48:34.216
I don't have any
commitments or baggage.

01:48:35.126 --> 01:48:38.876
I am still carrying our breakup
as a burden.

01:48:39.376 --> 01:48:40.286
S-So?

01:48:42.516 --> 01:48:45.336
I think I might get another chance.

01:48:46.826 --> 01:48:48.296
This is not a game, Vijay.

01:48:49.896 --> 01:48:51.126
I am not playing, Radhi.

01:48:51.836 --> 01:48:52.836
I am quite serious.

01:49:11.286 --> 01:49:13.626
Reena, I think you are right.

01:49:14.246 --> 01:49:17.336
The new doctor is going
to create some confusion.

01:49:17.476 --> 01:49:19.756
When did I tell you that he
is going to create confusion?

01:49:20.166 --> 01:49:23.886
You told me that his way of talking
to Dr. Radhi is different.

01:49:23.966 --> 01:49:24.876
Yes.

01:49:25.456 --> 01:49:28.856
I think he is in the process
of impressing Dr. Radhi now.

01:49:29.126 --> 01:49:29.966
How do you know?

01:49:30.356 --> 01:49:32.126
I saw them talking.

01:49:32.336 --> 01:49:33.216
You saw them?

01:49:33.416 --> 01:49:34.546
Did you hear what they said?

01:49:35.276 --> 01:49:37.336
I saw it, but I didn't
hear what they said.

01:49:38.716 --> 01:49:40.956
You might have misunderstood.

01:49:41.156 --> 01:49:44.626
I can judge people
by their facial expressions.

01:49:45.966 --> 01:49:46.796
No, it won't be.

01:49:47.036 --> 01:49:48.256
Don't make things up.

01:49:50.206 --> 01:49:52.836
I don't know what more confusion you
are going to create in that family.

01:49:52.896 --> 01:49:54.966
Why are you blaming me
for everything?

01:49:56.216 --> 01:49:58.716
I don't know how this is
going to end, Ramakrishna.

01:49:59.476 --> 01:50:02.546
God, please save me.

01:51:05.766 --> 01:51:08.776
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:51:10.846 --> 01:51:13.506
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:51:15.846 --> 01:51:19.136
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:51:20.626 --> 01:51:22.886
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:51:23.086 --> 01:51:25.636
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:51:25.706 --> 01:51:28.306
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:51:28.506 --> 01:51:30.936
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:51:33.306 --> 01:51:35.966
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:51:38.376 --> 01:51:40.846
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:51:43.076 --> 01:51:47.436
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:52:01.516 --> 01:52:03.476
Ma'am, is Amaya home?
- Welcome, Doctor.

01:52:03.736 --> 01:52:04.576
Come in.

01:52:05.676 --> 01:52:07.266
Amaya, your colleague is here.

01:52:08.016 --> 01:52:09.266
Why did you come here?

01:52:10.496 --> 01:52:12.636
Amaya, why are you
behaving like this?

01:52:12.956 --> 01:52:15.126
You sit here.
I will get some coffee for you.

01:52:15.226 --> 01:52:16.266
It's okay.

01:52:19.226 --> 01:52:22.316
Amaya, why are you angry with me?

01:52:22.486 --> 01:52:24.556
Did I say that I am angry with you?

01:52:25.266 --> 01:52:27.096
If you are not angry,
you can talk kindly.

01:52:27.516 --> 01:52:29.596
You could have tried
talking to Mr. Arjun.

01:52:29.846 --> 01:52:31.356
He is reasonable.

01:52:31.516 --> 01:52:32.726
Did you come here to say this?

01:52:33.206 --> 01:52:36.096
You said that you are not angry.

01:52:37.076 --> 01:52:39.306
I am not in a good mood, Kamal.

01:52:39.956 --> 01:52:42.116
Why did you come here?
Tell me.

01:52:43.176 --> 01:52:44.136
Don't mistake me.

01:52:44.236 --> 01:52:45.656
I know you don't like this.

01:52:45.776 --> 01:52:49.676
But take this money
for your expenses.

01:52:49.956 --> 01:52:51.516
Please keep it inside.

01:52:52.456 --> 01:52:54.896
If I had to borrow money from
anyone to support my family

01:52:54.956 --> 01:52:56.386
I would have done it long ago.

01:52:56.726 --> 01:52:58.386
I wouldn't have sent
Abhi to the hospital.

01:52:58.806 --> 01:52:59.996
Why are you talking like this?

01:53:00.096 --> 01:53:02.016
How can you work with a broken leg?

01:53:02.316 --> 01:53:04.096
You need money for your expenses.

01:53:04.536 --> 01:53:06.266
Please take it.
- Hey!

01:53:06.306 --> 01:53:07.766
I am telling you
that I don't want it.

01:53:08.056 --> 01:53:09.726
Take it and leave.

01:53:10.836 --> 01:53:11.846
Why, Amaya?

01:53:12.006 --> 01:53:13.346
Shouldn't I do something for you?

01:53:13.716 --> 01:53:15.016
Why should you do something for me?

01:53:16.996 --> 01:53:18.516
Why are you talking like this?

01:53:19.096 --> 01:53:21.726
I told you that I like you.

01:53:21.786 --> 01:53:23.956
I told you that it won't work out.

01:53:27.356 --> 01:53:28.686
Don't get angry.

01:53:29.906 --> 01:53:30.806
I am leaving.

01:53:31.676 --> 01:53:32.926
I don't want coffee, ma'am.

01:53:41.056 --> 01:53:41.976
Hi, Kamal.

01:53:42.806 --> 01:53:46.096
You.. Don't talk.
It's all because of you.

01:53:47.016 --> 01:53:47.896
Anyway..

01:53:48.056 --> 01:53:49.626
There's no point in blaming you.

01:53:49.986 --> 01:53:52.676
Will you tell me the truth?
- What?

01:53:53.006 --> 01:53:54.306
When you came
to the hospital for the first time

01:53:54.346 --> 01:53:55.726
you addressed me
disrespectfully, right?

01:53:56.126 --> 01:53:57.106
No.

01:53:57.266 --> 01:53:58.386
I addressed you as "hey".

01:53:59.226 --> 01:54:02.306
When I asked you
if you knew Bharatanatyam

01:54:02.426 --> 01:54:04.306
you're the one who said
you can dance freestyle.

01:54:04.546 --> 01:54:05.516
Am I right?

01:54:05.656 --> 01:54:06.806
Don't act smart.

01:54:07.066 --> 01:54:09.436
You both are handling it well.

01:54:10.016 --> 01:54:11.016
I am leaving.

01:54:11.266 --> 01:54:12.706
Hey, wait.

01:54:12.926 --> 01:54:14.346
Give me the money.

01:54:14.826 --> 01:54:15.886
That's right.

01:54:16.006 --> 01:54:18.716
You wanted to help Amaya.

01:54:19.106 --> 01:54:21.056
I asked for it,
so as not to disappoint you.

01:54:23.516 --> 01:54:26.726
Your elder sister doesn't want
my money, but you want it.

01:54:27.016 --> 01:54:29.386
It's good
- She is not my elder sister.

01:54:29.486 --> 01:54:30.416
I am older.

01:54:30.486 --> 01:54:32.346
I was born two seconds before her.

01:54:32.606 --> 01:54:33.806
That's very important.

01:54:34.096 --> 01:54:37.176
What will you tell
Amaya about the money?

01:54:37.516 --> 01:54:39.676
I know how to handle Amaya.

01:54:39.816 --> 01:54:41.266
There are many problems at home.

01:54:42.436 --> 01:54:43.846
Amaya will return it.

01:54:43.906 --> 01:54:44.766
One more thing.

01:54:44.816 --> 01:54:46.366
Tell me, madam.
- From next month onward

01:54:46.436 --> 01:54:48.476
come here before the 5th.

01:54:49.136 --> 01:54:50.766
It's not like I am helping you.

01:54:50.946 --> 01:54:53.866
It's like I am repaying you.
- Give me.

01:54:54.556 --> 01:54:56.166
It's good if it helps Amaya.

01:54:56.886 --> 01:55:00.306
Okay, take care. I am leaving.
- Okay, bye.

01:55:05.586 --> 01:55:07.556
To remove Arjun from that position

01:55:08.286 --> 01:55:10.226
I've done what I had to do.

01:55:11.266 --> 01:55:13.266
I think the board members
are also convinced.

01:55:14.806 --> 01:55:17.156
But they will decide
only after an inquiry.

01:55:17.346 --> 01:55:19.976
Yes, they would have
started the inquiry by now.

01:55:20.716 --> 01:55:23.926
Also.. They will take
a survey from the hospital staff

01:55:24.176 --> 01:55:25.426
about Arjun's work.

01:55:25.966 --> 01:55:26.816
Oh.

01:55:26.906 --> 01:55:30.936
Just for how long should this
hospital suffer because of Arjun?

01:55:32.176 --> 01:55:33.536
You tell me.

01:55:34.416 --> 01:55:36.556
Instead of taking
decisions as a CEO,

01:55:36.846 --> 01:55:41.176
he takes a decision
that's comfortable for everyone.

01:55:42.226 --> 01:55:43.846
That's not good for the hospital.

01:55:46.556 --> 01:55:47.796
I know, Dr. Radhi.

01:55:48.756 --> 01:55:51.306
In the CEO race,
he didn't play a fair game.

01:55:52.696 --> 01:55:55.426
Which also proves
that he can blame his own people.

01:55:56.096 --> 01:55:58.136
A CEO's job is to support the staff

01:55:58.186 --> 01:56:01.266
not to blame them, right?

01:56:02.846 --> 01:56:04.176
Arjun became a CEO

01:56:04.676 --> 01:56:07.426
only because he revealed
Dr. Radhi's personal issues.

01:56:07.676 --> 01:56:08.926
You all know that.

01:56:10.726 --> 01:56:16.116
Also, don't think Abhinaya's crime
ended with Amaya's suspension.

01:56:16.606 --> 01:56:18.506
If any of you were involved in it

01:56:18.886 --> 01:56:20.516
it will affect you too.

01:56:21.056 --> 01:56:22.766
Without thinking about any of this

01:56:23.346 --> 01:56:25.846
Arjun forgave Amaya.

01:56:26.396 --> 01:56:27.446
Now you tell me.

01:56:28.256 --> 01:56:31.136
Do you think Arjun is
using his position correctly?

01:56:34.586 --> 01:56:38.096
Is he using his power
and position correctly?

01:56:39.346 --> 01:56:40.386
Think about it

01:56:40.906 --> 01:56:42.016
and then tell me.

01:56:43.056 --> 01:56:44.676
If I become the CEO

01:56:45.486 --> 01:56:46.806
we can be one team.

01:56:47.686 --> 01:56:49.476
If you support me now..

01:56:50.016 --> 01:56:53.476
After I become the CEO,
I will obviously support you.

01:56:55.976 --> 01:56:58.666
But Dr. Radhi is also here,
don't forget that.

01:57:00.076 --> 01:57:01.426
I can confidently tell you.

01:57:01.626 --> 01:57:04.136
She won't accept this position even
if it was handed to her on a platter.

01:57:05.596 --> 01:57:07.476
You stand by my side, Manasa.

01:57:08.466 --> 01:57:09.846
I will take care of the rest.

01:57:11.636 --> 01:57:14.056
Forget what happened between us.

01:57:14.766 --> 01:57:16.676
You should be with me at this time.

01:57:17.326 --> 01:57:18.306
Please.

01:57:18.956 --> 01:57:20.016
It's a request.

01:57:21.406 --> 01:57:23.106
Whenever you face any problem

01:57:23.346 --> 01:57:24.596
I always stand by your side.

01:57:26.266 --> 01:57:27.696
I will stand by your side
in the future also.

01:57:28.426 --> 01:57:29.476
So..

01:57:30.286 --> 01:57:35.426
Think carefully about whom you should
support and whom you shouldn't.

01:57:37.766 --> 01:57:38.676
Okay.

01:58:50.926 --> 01:58:52.016
What is she doing?

01:58:52.346 --> 01:58:53.726
Is she trying to play a game?

01:58:58.426 --> 01:59:00.806
Hey, Teju.
What are you doing?

01:59:04.526 --> 01:59:05.556
It is..

01:59:06.256 --> 01:59:08.766
Manasa, Radhi and the nurses.

01:59:09.606 --> 01:59:11.056
What was Dr. Preetham
talking to them about?

01:59:11.836 --> 01:59:12.886
He is the chief doctor.

01:59:13.496 --> 01:59:16.266
So he should talk to all the staff
and find out what is happening.

01:59:19.856 --> 01:59:20.886
No, Rocky.

01:59:22.226 --> 01:59:23.136
Okay.

01:59:23.486 --> 01:59:24.636
Let's say that's true.

01:59:26.026 --> 01:59:29.226
He spoke to Manasa and the nurses.
So there is no doubt.

01:59:30.266 --> 01:59:31.096
But..

01:59:31.706 --> 01:59:34.976
But when Dr. Radhi talks to him
on normal days

01:59:35.136 --> 01:59:36.346
he usually avoids her.

01:59:40.136 --> 01:59:41.766
He even called her to the cabin.

01:59:42.666 --> 01:59:43.956
That smile..

01:59:44.386 --> 01:59:45.926
It was unusual.

01:59:46.926 --> 01:59:48.346
Something's fishy.

01:59:48.946 --> 01:59:51.016
Is it unusual for a man to smile?

01:59:51.596 --> 01:59:52.896
Will she hit me if I ask?

01:59:53.636 --> 01:59:55.766
What?
- N-No, Teju.

01:59:56.436 --> 01:59:57.726
After a problem is solved

01:59:57.846 --> 01:59:59.636
he should meet all the staff

01:59:59.766 --> 02:00:01.576
and remind them to be careful,
as the chief doctor, right?

02:00:03.376 --> 02:00:05.806
She is not even listening.

02:00:11.606 --> 02:00:15.556
What if Dr. Preetham is
trying to become the CEO?

02:00:21.486 --> 02:00:23.186
According to the current situation,

02:00:23.996 --> 02:00:26.846
Arjun not firing Amaya

02:00:27.056 --> 02:00:28.706
did not sit well with Dr. Preetham.
- Oh.

02:00:29.026 --> 02:00:29.846
Okay.

02:00:30.116 --> 02:00:31.096
On the other side..

02:00:31.646 --> 02:00:34.476
Dr. Vijay coming to this hospital

02:00:34.596 --> 02:00:36.136
did not sit well with Dr. Radhi.

02:00:36.286 --> 02:00:38.696
1 plus 1 is A square.
A square is B square.

02:00:38.766 --> 02:00:39.596
Or else..

02:00:39.966 --> 02:00:41.486
The nurses here might be scared

02:00:42.226 --> 02:00:46.336
that they'd face consequences
because of Amaya.

02:00:46.846 --> 02:00:48.886
So?
- So..

02:00:49.816 --> 02:00:53.056
To get all these people on his side

02:00:53.656 --> 02:00:57.556
Dr. Preetham will not get
a better situation than this.

02:00:58.786 --> 02:01:00.476
Oh.

02:01:01.816 --> 02:01:04.596
The situation is against Arjun.

02:01:07.726 --> 02:01:10.976
Teju, why are you
telling me all this?

02:01:11.986 --> 02:01:14.886
What to do? You were sitting
in the room when I came in.

02:01:15.366 --> 02:01:18.226
I would have done the same
if it were a monkey instead of you.

02:01:18.956 --> 02:01:20.436
If it were a monkey,
it would have run away.

02:01:20.526 --> 02:01:21.726
But I am still standing here.

02:01:25.846 --> 02:01:28.436
No, Teju. Are you going
to plan something with this?

02:01:30.736 --> 02:01:31.636
Why are you asking?

02:01:31.876 --> 02:01:35.096
No, you won't get me
into trouble, right?

02:01:36.296 --> 02:01:39.896
You are standing with Reena
when she has a problem, right?

02:01:40.956 --> 02:01:42.936
You are listening
to her stories, right?

02:01:44.276 --> 02:01:45.806
Why can't you listen
to what I am saying now?

02:01:45.926 --> 02:01:48.306
It's not like she is going
to commit a murder.

02:01:48.786 --> 02:01:50.846
Poor girl.
She just vents it out to me.

02:01:51.816 --> 02:01:53.136
Am I going to commit a murder?

02:01:53.706 --> 02:01:54.636
I don't know.

02:01:57.226 --> 02:02:00.096
Teju, but you are
capable of doing it.

02:02:01.136 --> 02:02:01.976
Shut up.

02:02:13.386 --> 02:02:14.806
I am feeling peaceful only now.

02:02:15.296 --> 02:02:17.266
Tell all your problems to God.

02:02:18.246 --> 02:02:19.726
He will help you solve them.

02:02:20.076 --> 02:02:22.596
Will it be all right if I tell him?

02:02:23.296 --> 02:02:25.516
It is a process.
It won't happen immediately.

02:02:25.716 --> 02:02:28.476
It will take time.
But it will definitely happen.

02:02:37.016 --> 02:02:38.316
Whose name should I pray for?

02:02:39.236 --> 02:02:40.266
His Almighty.

02:02:52.696 --> 02:02:54.596
Hi.
- Oh, hi.

02:02:55.686 --> 02:02:58.886
What are you doing here?
- Forget what we are doing here.

02:02:59.376 --> 02:03:01.236
What are you both doing here?

02:03:01.306 --> 02:03:03.056
Good question. I like it.

02:03:04.226 --> 02:03:05.686
Are you here to get married?

02:03:05.696 --> 02:03:07.516
Hey!
- It looks like it.

02:03:07.736 --> 02:03:09.726
Stop it, Uncle.
- Okay.

02:03:11.806 --> 02:03:14.016
This is..
- I know. I have met him.

02:03:14.076 --> 02:03:17.476
We had dinner, Arjun, right?
- Correct.. You are right.

02:03:18.576 --> 02:03:20.596
You are RK's son, right?

02:03:21.596 --> 02:03:23.636
Yes, sir.
- Oh..

02:03:31.726 --> 02:03:34.196
Okay, we will go around the temple.
- Reena.

02:03:35.176 --> 02:03:38.886
I need to talk to you alone.
- Just with you.

02:03:40.096 --> 02:03:41.846
Okay, you go ahead.

02:03:42.456 --> 02:03:43.346
Okay.

02:03:49.226 --> 02:03:52.686
Reena, I heard that
he is a heavy drinker.

02:03:53.636 --> 02:03:54.636
Who told you?

02:03:56.876 --> 02:04:00.476
I heard that he came to your
house and created a ruckus.

02:04:01.716 --> 02:04:02.726
Who told you this?

02:04:04.506 --> 02:04:07.556
Just you wait, I will switch
your pills and kill you.

02:04:08.156 --> 02:04:09.056
Dear.

02:04:09.456 --> 02:04:10.306
Reena.

02:04:10.846 --> 02:04:13.666
I think it is better for you
to stay away from him.

02:04:13.766 --> 02:04:14.596
I think so too.

02:04:14.676 --> 02:04:16.306
Why are you suddenly
worried about me?

02:04:17.056 --> 02:04:19.386
Isn't it my duty to protect you?

02:04:20.046 --> 02:04:22.556
You should have taken
care of my mom first.

02:04:23.226 --> 02:04:24.256
I should have.

02:04:25.386 --> 02:04:26.506
I made a mistake back then.

02:04:27.846 --> 02:04:29.386
I can't make
the same mistake again.

02:04:29.996 --> 02:04:33.216
Grandpa, I know what I am
doing and what is right for me.

02:04:33.426 --> 02:04:34.446
I am not a kid anymore.

02:04:34.626 --> 02:04:36.526
It's not that..
- Grandpa, please.

02:04:36.716 --> 02:04:38.346
Don't talk to me about this.

02:04:42.136 --> 02:04:43.846
I think she is angry.

02:04:43.906 --> 02:04:45.976
She will calm down.

02:04:50.136 --> 02:04:51.476
Where did he go?

02:04:51.926 --> 02:04:52.816
Hey.

02:04:54.886 --> 02:04:55.936
What are you doing here?

02:04:56.936 --> 02:04:58.976
You were discussing
with your grandpa.

02:04:59.636 --> 02:05:01.396
I didn't want to disturb you,
so I came here.

02:05:03.676 --> 02:05:05.066
We should leave this place soon.

02:05:05.756 --> 02:05:07.386
They will torture us.

02:05:11.856 --> 02:05:13.056
Why are you
looking at me like that?

02:05:14.136 --> 02:05:15.586
Why did your grandpa ask you that?

02:05:17.516 --> 02:05:18.516
Did you hear it?

02:05:21.056 --> 02:05:21.916
Yes.

02:05:24.306 --> 02:05:26.316
The society will always
have many things to say.

02:05:26.956 --> 02:05:28.196
Don't worry about that.

02:05:29.556 --> 02:05:30.806
Let that be.

02:05:31.956 --> 02:05:33.016
What do you think?

02:05:36.176 --> 02:05:37.186
I don't know, Arjun.

02:05:38.346 --> 02:05:39.766
It's not the right answer, Reena.

02:05:42.266 --> 02:05:45.226
I can't decide about us, Arjun.

02:05:48.506 --> 02:05:49.346
Okay.

02:05:49.826 --> 02:05:53.326
Shall we start from the beginning?

02:05:53.856 --> 02:05:54.766
I don't understand.

02:05:55.086 --> 02:05:56.726
We can go on a lot of drives.

02:05:58.026 --> 02:06:00.016
We can spend
a lot of time together.

02:06:00.546 --> 02:06:01.846
Arjun.
- Don't worry.

02:06:02.766 --> 02:06:04.836
I won't disturb you

02:06:05.346 --> 02:06:08.056
by asking you to love me again
or to get back together.

02:06:09.136 --> 02:06:10.926
Then why should we
start from the beginning?

02:06:12.516 --> 02:06:13.386
Just like that.

02:06:14.726 --> 02:06:17.236
We don't spend
a lot of time together.

02:06:18.396 --> 02:06:19.636
Even if we don't talk often

02:06:20.356 --> 02:06:21.806
I don't feel like
how it used to be.

02:06:23.296 --> 02:06:24.766
Because you are working now.

02:06:25.526 --> 02:06:26.596
I am also promoted.

02:06:27.356 --> 02:06:29.646
We don't have enough time
to manage our professional life.

02:06:29.846 --> 02:06:31.386
Maybe that's why you felt that way.

02:06:34.586 --> 02:06:35.466
Arjun.

02:06:36.026 --> 02:06:39.226
Since we're spending time together,
don't have any expectations.

02:06:39.556 --> 02:06:40.456
No. No.

02:06:40.826 --> 02:06:41.886
I didn't think that.

02:06:42.826 --> 02:06:45.016
I asked you this as a friend.

02:06:46.226 --> 02:06:47.056
Friend.

02:06:48.536 --> 02:06:49.846
Okay, friend.

02:06:54.106 --> 02:06:55.516
Are you following me?

02:06:55.906 --> 02:06:57.576
No, I just came with Thyagu.

02:06:58.966 --> 02:07:00.386
A-Arjun.

02:07:00.576 --> 02:07:02.936
How long have you known Reena?

02:07:03.266 --> 02:07:05.176
Arjun has known her
before she started working.

02:07:05.806 --> 02:07:06.976
Yes, it's true.
- I am sorry.

02:07:08.176 --> 02:07:10.676
Have you come to the temple before?

02:07:10.726 --> 02:07:12.176
No, I haven't seen them
here before.

02:07:12.336 --> 02:07:14.956
Did I ask you?
- No, sorry..

02:07:15.056 --> 02:07:15.886
Grandpa.

02:07:16.046 --> 02:07:17.596
Why are you asking Arjun all this?

02:07:17.646 --> 02:07:21.216
I won't interfere
in your decisions.

02:07:21.586 --> 02:07:24.386
But I think I have
the right to ask Arjun.

02:07:24.876 --> 02:07:25.806
So, please.

02:07:27.486 --> 02:07:29.846
Ask me, sir.
- I want to talk to you alone.

02:07:30.686 --> 02:07:31.556
Please.

02:07:35.266 --> 02:07:36.436
Where are you going?

02:07:36.636 --> 02:07:38.806
I can tell you only if I hear
what they're talking about.

02:07:39.656 --> 02:07:40.476
Good point.

02:07:40.636 --> 02:07:41.976
Go listen.
- There you are.

02:07:46.886 --> 02:07:47.816
Tell me, sir.

02:07:49.986 --> 02:07:50.826
Arjun.

02:07:51.136 --> 02:07:53.596
I know that you are
the CEO of a big hospital.

02:07:54.226 --> 02:07:57.826
But you haven't even
completed your graduation.

02:07:58.016 --> 02:08:01.026
How will you take good
care of Reena? - Good point.

02:08:02.156 --> 02:08:02.986
Sir.

02:08:03.196 --> 02:08:05.516
There is nothing
between Reena and me.

02:08:06.596 --> 02:08:07.466
Sir.

02:08:07.906 --> 02:08:09.586
I know Reena very well.

02:08:10.016 --> 02:08:12.386
She wouldn't put in so much
effort if she didn't like you.

02:08:12.946 --> 02:08:13.806
Arjun.

02:08:13.946 --> 02:08:16.516
Frankly, I don't know
Reena very well.

02:08:16.566 --> 02:08:20.006
But she has gone through a lot
at this young age.

02:08:20.366 --> 02:08:22.766
She shouldn't suffer anymore.

02:08:23.106 --> 02:08:24.766
She is somebody very special.

02:08:27.506 --> 02:08:28.726
You say she is special.

02:08:29.916 --> 02:08:31.516
Then why did you leave her?

02:08:37.976 --> 02:08:39.386
That's why she is special.

02:08:40.096 --> 02:08:44.186
She got separated from her family,
but she found us again.

02:08:44.386 --> 02:08:45.306
That is why.

02:08:47.226 --> 02:08:50.706
He's talking so emotionally,
why are you laughing?

02:08:50.766 --> 02:08:51.716
Why are you laughing?

02:08:54.306 --> 02:08:57.356
Reena used to tell me that
she doesn't have anyone.

02:08:58.066 --> 02:08:58.936
But now..

02:08:59.796 --> 02:09:02.136
When I see that she has
so many people who care about her,

02:09:02.766 --> 02:09:03.886
I feel very happy.

02:09:11.016 --> 02:09:11.846
Hi, Radhi.

02:09:13.536 --> 02:09:14.386
What do you want?

02:09:14.846 --> 02:09:15.906
I think
you are done with your shift.

02:09:16.306 --> 02:09:17.226
Yes.

02:09:17.806 --> 02:09:20.636
I was going out for dinner.
I came to ask if you would join me.

02:09:21.706 --> 02:09:23.016
What are you trying to do, Vijay?

02:09:24.186 --> 02:09:25.776
I asked if you would
join me for dinner.

02:09:26.726 --> 02:09:29.806
I have been observing how you
talk to me since you came here.

02:09:30.556 --> 02:09:33.846
Don't think that you can take
advantage of my patience.

02:09:35.466 --> 02:09:37.686
You are talking
with our past in your mind.

02:09:38.826 --> 02:09:41.726
But I am not that Radhi
you left back then.

02:09:43.096 --> 02:09:44.506
You are talking
with a lot of authority.

02:09:44.806 --> 02:09:47.036
I am sorry, I was just
casually asking this.

02:09:47.346 --> 02:09:48.426
Why is that?

02:09:49.226 --> 02:09:52.156
You might know my working
style because you work with me.

02:09:52.686 --> 02:09:55.476
But you don't know how
I handle my life, Vijay.

02:09:57.096 --> 02:09:58.466
You don't know what I have become.

02:09:58.846 --> 02:10:01.136
Only I know how many
hardships I have faced

02:10:01.626 --> 02:10:03.346
how many hard
decisions I have taken

02:10:03.646 --> 02:10:06.226
and how much I have cried.

02:10:08.776 --> 02:10:12.686
And..
I don't trust you, Vijay.

02:10:15.526 --> 02:10:18.846
Whatever you do,
you will never earn my trust again.

02:10:20.546 --> 02:10:22.676
It is better for you
to stay within your limits.

02:10:23.186 --> 02:10:26.726
Hereafter, if you talk
to me like this again,

02:10:28.896 --> 02:10:30.436
you will see the Radhi
that I have become.

02:10:51.186 --> 02:10:52.686
Good start.

02:12:06.196 --> 02:12:09.206
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

02:12:11.286 --> 02:12:13.726
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

02:12:16.386 --> 02:12:19.226
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

02:12:21.046 --> 02:12:23.386
♪ Our patience wins ♪

02:12:23.516 --> 02:12:25.956
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

02:12:26.076 --> 02:12:28.766
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

02:12:28.846 --> 02:12:31.436
♪ I am a doctor ♪

02:12:33.716 --> 02:12:36.516
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

02:12:38.876 --> 02:12:41.436
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

02:12:43.526 --> 02:12:48.346
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

02:12:59.256 --> 02:13:00.586
Do you have tonic water?

02:13:00.756 --> 02:13:02.336
It is inside, sir.
- Inside..

02:13:07.426 --> 02:13:08.596
Thank you.
I will take care.

02:13:10.566 --> 02:13:11.476
Hi, sir.

02:13:13.176 --> 02:13:15.166
Do you remember me?

02:13:16.816 --> 02:13:18.016
No, son.

02:13:18.926 --> 02:13:20.226
I don't know you.
Who are you?

02:13:20.356 --> 02:13:21.236
I am Vijay.

02:13:21.686 --> 02:13:22.956
I went to the same school as Radhi.

02:13:24.346 --> 02:13:25.676
You might not know me.

02:13:25.866 --> 02:13:28.476
But you'd definitely know
my name and who I am.

02:13:29.616 --> 02:13:30.726
What are you doing here?

02:13:31.346 --> 02:13:32.676
I am a doctor now.

02:13:33.466 --> 02:13:35.306
I am working in Radhi's hospital.

02:13:37.056 --> 02:13:38.096
Did Radhi see you?

02:13:38.616 --> 02:13:40.136
I am telling you
that we work together.

02:13:40.766 --> 02:13:41.766
How can she not see me?

02:13:42.346 --> 02:13:44.676
Not only that,
your son-in-law, Dev.

02:13:45.396 --> 02:13:47.136
Your granddaughter..
- Granddaughter?

02:13:47.626 --> 02:13:49.676
I met Divi also.
- Oh, Divi.

02:13:52.096 --> 02:13:54.726
Finish your work
and leave this place.

02:13:54.976 --> 02:13:57.466
Stay away from Radhi.

02:13:58.106 --> 02:13:59.016
That's difficult, sir.

02:13:59.476 --> 02:14:01.686
I was away because
everything was over.

02:14:02.936 --> 02:14:03.806
Now, I am back.

02:14:04.876 --> 02:14:06.096
I didn't plan this.

02:14:06.356 --> 02:14:08.016
The universe has brought me back.

02:14:08.846 --> 02:14:09.936
Did you see that, sir?

02:14:10.656 --> 02:14:12.816
The universe knows that
I didn't do anything wrong.

02:14:15.856 --> 02:14:16.846
See you around, old man.

02:14:17.886 --> 02:14:19.016
We will definitely meet.
- Hey!

02:14:26.086 --> 02:14:26.976
Arjun.

02:14:27.276 --> 02:14:30.846
It's a new experience for me
to take every session in a car.

02:14:31.346 --> 02:14:34.486
I told you, Manasa,
that no one should know.

02:14:35.296 --> 02:14:36.136
Arjun.

02:14:36.566 --> 02:14:38.476
Even if you are in a high position

02:14:38.546 --> 02:14:40.846
you are just an ordinary
man like everyone else.

02:14:42.006 --> 02:14:44.416
So what if someone finds out?

02:14:44.476 --> 02:14:45.806
What's the problem in that, Arjun?

02:14:46.866 --> 02:14:49.636
But I want to be on
the safer side, Manasa.

02:14:50.856 --> 02:14:51.806
As you wish.

02:14:52.646 --> 02:14:55.516
By the way, have you
completed all the tasks I gave you?

02:14:55.746 --> 02:14:56.806
Did it help?

02:14:57.656 --> 02:14:58.556
Yes.

02:14:58.886 --> 02:15:01.806
Whenever I felt like drinking,
I did the tasks you gave me.

02:15:02.726 --> 02:15:03.686
Did it help?

02:15:05.636 --> 02:15:06.686
To be honest..

02:15:08.106 --> 02:15:09.516
After completing those tasks..

02:15:11.466 --> 02:15:12.306
I drank.

02:15:15.516 --> 02:15:18.976
By the way, what do you think
is your trigger point, Arjun?

02:15:21.306 --> 02:15:23.646
The moment when I told
everyone about Dr. Radhi.

02:15:25.976 --> 02:15:27.346
When Reena hit me.

02:15:28.736 --> 02:15:31.056
The moment when I lost her trust.

02:15:32.886 --> 02:15:34.186
That's when this fear started.

02:15:35.976 --> 02:15:37.766
So, that fear is
your trigger point.

02:15:38.816 --> 02:15:41.856
By the way,
why is Reena so important to you?

02:15:44.386 --> 02:15:47.766
In my tough times,
she has always been with me.

02:15:49.626 --> 02:15:52.596
Even around the time I met her,
I used to drink.

02:15:53.636 --> 02:15:55.476
In fact, I was very short-tempered.

02:15:57.066 --> 02:16:00.306
Even after knowing all my flaws,
she accepted me.

02:16:03.366 --> 02:16:06.056
Whenever I am with her,
I feel very peaceful.

02:16:09.366 --> 02:16:10.386
She doesn't even know

02:16:12.486 --> 02:16:14.696
how much impact
she has created in my life.

02:16:17.246 --> 02:16:20.266
Arjun, can I ask you a question?
Just an imaginary question.

02:16:20.546 --> 02:16:22.686
If something happens to Reena,
what will you do?

02:16:22.786 --> 02:16:23.796
Stop it, Manasa.

02:16:24.996 --> 02:16:25.886
Arjun,

02:16:26.166 --> 02:16:27.016
Relax.

02:16:27.416 --> 02:16:29.056
I didn't mean anything by it.

02:16:31.936 --> 02:16:32.806
Sorry.

02:16:33.846 --> 02:16:36.516
So far, I have understood
one thing from analysing you.

02:16:39.476 --> 02:16:42.726
The first time you drank,
it wasn't because your mother died.

02:16:43.696 --> 02:16:45.596
You couldn't accept that.

02:16:47.056 --> 02:16:50.016
Because you were
very attached to her.

02:16:52.296 --> 02:16:54.506
Now, you are doing
the same with Reena.

02:16:54.566 --> 02:16:56.846
Manasa, we are attached
to everyone we like.

02:17:00.226 --> 02:17:01.826
Even if we like someone

02:17:01.876 --> 02:17:04.426
there should be a healthy
space between you two, Arjun.

02:17:04.476 --> 02:17:05.306
So?

02:17:05.956 --> 02:17:07.656
Do you want me
to stay away from Reena?

02:17:09.046 --> 02:17:09.936
No.

02:17:10.866 --> 02:17:13.566
And I know that it is
not that easy for you.

02:17:14.206 --> 02:17:15.486
But beyond Reena

02:17:15.626 --> 02:17:17.316
there are many
things outside, Arjun.

02:17:17.826 --> 02:17:19.026
Try to see that.

02:17:19.946 --> 02:17:20.946
I don't understand.

02:17:22.146 --> 02:17:24.356
Shift your thoughts
away from Reena, Arjun.

02:17:25.026 --> 02:17:27.896
Find something else
to take care of.

02:17:29.276 --> 02:17:31.236
Try to focus on something else.

02:17:31.816 --> 02:17:34.736
Or, meet someone and talk to them.
Like a date or something.

02:17:36.706 --> 02:17:37.606
Date?

02:17:38.696 --> 02:17:39.606
Who knows?

02:17:39.856 --> 02:17:42.526
There are chances for you
to meet someone interesting.

02:17:44.986 --> 02:17:45.896
It's okay, Arjun.

02:17:46.156 --> 02:17:47.526
Only two sessions are over.

02:17:47.856 --> 02:17:49.526
Let's figure it out gradually.

02:17:49.916 --> 02:17:50.786
Okay?

02:17:51.276 --> 02:17:53.166
My job as a therapist is over.

02:17:59.886 --> 02:18:01.946
This is also my job, as a friend.

02:18:02.966 --> 02:18:04.516
A therapist inside the car.

02:18:10.056 --> 02:18:10.926
Reena.

02:18:21.586 --> 02:18:22.446
Reena.

02:18:24.276 --> 02:18:26.246
What is going on between
you and Arjun recently?

02:18:28.226 --> 02:18:29.196
Why?

02:18:29.726 --> 02:18:32.196
Why do people around me
care so much about this?

02:18:32.536 --> 02:18:34.416
Why are you comparing me to others?

02:18:34.586 --> 02:18:35.416
Yes.

02:18:38.946 --> 02:18:40.806
If you want anything,
you will come to me, right?

02:18:40.856 --> 02:18:42.446
I'll see you then.
- Hey..

02:18:42.976 --> 02:18:44.946
Sit down.
What do you want to know?

02:18:45.696 --> 02:18:47.146
Go away, I won't tell you.

02:18:47.976 --> 02:18:48.816
Tell me.

02:18:49.026 --> 02:18:51.066
You will ask me the same
thing after 10 minutes.

02:18:51.696 --> 02:18:52.526
Tell me now.

02:18:53.696 --> 02:18:54.696
That's also right.

02:18:56.566 --> 02:18:58.606
How many boyfriends
did you have before Arjun?

02:19:01.076 --> 02:19:01.946
Why?

02:19:02.446 --> 02:19:03.986
I am asking you
for a reason, tell me.

02:19:06.336 --> 02:19:07.446
Arjun was the first one.

02:19:07.726 --> 02:19:08.776
Oh.

02:19:09.286 --> 02:19:10.106
Okay.

02:19:10.736 --> 02:19:15.146
But Arjun had two exes
before you that we know of.

02:19:15.566 --> 02:19:17.486
How many exes would he
have that are unaware of?

02:19:18.736 --> 02:19:20.236
Why do you talk like this?

02:19:21.336 --> 02:19:22.276
No, Reena.

02:19:22.466 --> 02:19:25.736
Handle Arjun
as smoothly as possible.

02:19:26.276 --> 02:19:27.696
I can't listen to you, get lost.

02:19:28.646 --> 02:19:29.606
Don't listen to me.

02:19:30.476 --> 02:19:35.876
I saw Arjun and Manasa
hugging in the parking lot.

02:19:35.946 --> 02:19:36.776
Hug?

02:19:39.946 --> 02:19:41.156
It's just a hug.

02:19:41.476 --> 02:19:42.526
What is wrong with a hug?

02:19:42.786 --> 02:19:43.896
Even you hug me.

02:19:44.196 --> 02:19:45.556
I also hug you.

02:19:45.676 --> 02:19:48.566
Don't talk like an old school guy.
- There is nothing wrong in hugging.

02:19:49.016 --> 02:19:52.486
But they were hugging
secretly inside a car.

02:19:53.196 --> 02:19:54.316
Isn't that wrong?

02:19:56.696 --> 02:19:58.776
Was it really them?
- Confirmed. I saw it.

02:19:59.926 --> 02:20:00.896
Not like this.

02:20:01.026 --> 02:20:02.136
Like this.

02:20:02.196 --> 02:20:04.776
So what?
Why are you telling me all this?

02:20:05.196 --> 02:20:06.126
Oh.

02:20:06.376 --> 02:20:08.396
So, you don't care about this.

02:20:08.876 --> 02:20:10.816
Why do I care what he does?

02:20:10.886 --> 02:20:12.646
Get lost, I have to work.

02:20:13.926 --> 02:20:16.986
Let me see
for how long this will continue.

02:20:31.446 --> 02:20:32.316
Manasa.

02:20:33.836 --> 02:20:35.776
Hi, Manasa.
- Hi.

02:20:35.916 --> 02:20:37.146
I've heard about you.

02:20:37.566 --> 02:20:39.396
But I didn't get
a chance to talk to you.

02:20:40.456 --> 02:20:42.276
I haven't given
counselling to everyone.

02:20:43.396 --> 02:20:45.796
Even if I give an appointment,
only a few people come to me.

02:20:46.126 --> 02:20:47.776
Oh, sorry, I am Reena.

02:20:48.866 --> 02:20:49.686
I know.

02:20:49.736 --> 02:20:53.026
After Harry Potter, you are
the most famous child I know.

02:20:56.136 --> 02:20:57.296
Okay.

02:20:58.026 --> 02:20:59.736
Do you want
an appointment for counselling?

02:20:59.786 --> 02:21:01.526
Or, do you need my help?

02:21:03.926 --> 02:21:05.236
I need your help.

02:21:06.296 --> 02:21:07.276
What help?

02:21:07.816 --> 02:21:08.946
It is..

02:21:09.796 --> 02:21:12.146
I can't take decisions.

02:21:12.836 --> 02:21:14.146
What kind of decisions?

02:21:15.146 --> 02:21:16.566
Like..

02:21:18.606 --> 02:21:20.446
I want something.

02:21:20.646 --> 02:21:21.776
Then, I don't want it.

02:21:21.856 --> 02:21:24.566
I'd feel that is right.
Then, I'd feel that it's wrong.

02:21:24.706 --> 02:21:28.126
I'd feel I should keep it.

02:21:28.696 --> 02:21:29.946
Then I'd feel that
it is unnecessary.

02:21:30.456 --> 02:21:33.776
If someone else talks about it,
I feel like I should get it back.

02:21:35.406 --> 02:21:38.946
I feel very confused
like this, Manasa.

02:21:41.866 --> 02:21:43.646
This is common at this age.

02:21:44.396 --> 02:21:46.276
You have a lot of workload.

02:21:46.656 --> 02:21:48.696
Take rest, it will be alright.

02:21:49.276 --> 02:21:50.356
Manasa.

02:21:52.476 --> 02:21:54.146
Are you giving
counselling to Arjun?

02:21:56.316 --> 02:21:57.446
No, why?

02:21:58.456 --> 02:22:02.396
I saw you both coming in together.
That's why I asked.

02:22:02.526 --> 02:22:06.306
Arjun drops me off at the hospital.
- Drop?

02:22:06.876 --> 02:22:07.776
Yes.

02:22:08.186 --> 02:22:09.896
My car is under repair
for the past few days.

02:22:10.116 --> 02:22:12.096
It's difficult for me to get a cab.

02:22:12.146 --> 02:22:14.396
That's why Arjun is dropping
me and picking me up.

02:22:16.066 --> 02:22:17.896
Okay, Reena, I have to leave.

02:22:18.096 --> 02:22:20.096
If you want to talk about
anything, come for counselling.

02:22:20.256 --> 02:22:21.486
Sure.
- Bye.

02:22:33.436 --> 02:22:34.606
Why are you coming so late?

02:22:35.236 --> 02:22:36.606
Sir, this is my timing.

02:22:36.786 --> 02:22:38.816
If I have many appointments,
I'd come early.

02:22:39.286 --> 02:22:41.526
Okay, I'll come to the point.
- Tell me.

02:22:42.266 --> 02:22:44.196
Everything is going
smooth as per my plan.

02:22:44.956 --> 02:22:46.446
I have spoken to all the staff.

02:22:47.316 --> 02:22:48.606
Everyone is on my side.

02:22:49.356 --> 02:22:53.356
So, Arjun doesn't have
any other option but to step down.

02:22:55.446 --> 02:22:57.776
Good for you.
- Yes, and as I was telling you

02:22:58.026 --> 02:22:59.146
after the inquiry..

02:22:59.946 --> 02:23:02.276
Some doctors will be
asked for an opinion.

02:23:02.766 --> 02:23:07.106
If they ask you, please
recommend me for the CEO position.

02:23:09.816 --> 02:23:10.706
Not bad.

02:23:11.466 --> 02:23:13.066
You know the process.

02:23:13.856 --> 02:23:15.396
You have been
planning for a long time.

02:23:16.136 --> 02:23:17.396
I am serious, Manasa.

02:23:21.026 --> 02:23:24.636
After you spoke to me,
I thought about it.

02:23:25.356 --> 02:23:28.396
If I recommend you,
it will be beneficial for me.

02:23:28.796 --> 02:23:29.736
So, I'll do it.

02:23:30.196 --> 02:23:31.026
Great.

02:23:31.586 --> 02:23:32.946
We are one team then.

02:23:33.736 --> 02:23:34.696
I can't say.

02:23:35.066 --> 02:23:36.776
Today might be Arjun's last day.

02:23:37.166 --> 02:23:39.526
Oh.
- We'll celebrate this evening.

02:23:49.646 --> 02:23:50.606
Sir.

02:24:13.636 --> 02:24:16.026
Arjun, regarding the issue
I mentioned earlier

02:24:17.946 --> 02:24:21.346
everyone is on my
side as my support.

02:24:24.946 --> 02:24:28.986
We have discussed
and decided on one thing.

02:24:30.086 --> 02:24:30.986
What is it, sir?

02:24:32.706 --> 02:24:34.816
I think you are not
fit to be the CEO.

02:24:42.106 --> 02:24:43.526
What is there to laugh about?

02:24:46.156 --> 02:24:51.356
I was waiting for you
to do something like this.

02:24:52.136 --> 02:24:53.146
What?

02:24:53.386 --> 02:24:56.796
Do you think you can
dismiss me so easily?

02:24:56.886 --> 02:24:59.446
Hey, there is no
personal vengeance here.

02:25:00.196 --> 02:25:02.816
I saw how you handled
the hospital crises.

02:25:03.726 --> 02:25:06.856
It was clear that you
can't handle this post.

02:25:08.586 --> 02:25:09.486
Sir.

02:25:10.576 --> 02:25:11.816
Every time

02:25:12.246 --> 02:25:15.486
there is a problem
at the hospital or for the patients

02:25:16.306 --> 02:25:21.646
I've tried my best to give a proper
solution till the last minute.

02:25:22.356 --> 02:25:23.886
I grew up watching

02:25:24.476 --> 02:25:27.096
how my father managed
the hospital from this position.

02:25:27.316 --> 02:25:28.566
Even though it's not as good as his

02:25:30.306 --> 02:25:32.106
I am trying my best
to keep up his legacy.

02:25:34.066 --> 02:25:34.906
And..

02:25:37.046 --> 02:25:39.986
I believe that I have
made the right decision.

02:25:41.016 --> 02:25:41.946
And..

02:25:43.506 --> 02:25:45.486
I believe that my
decision now is also right.

02:25:45.976 --> 02:25:46.896
That's good.

02:25:47.236 --> 02:25:51.776
You have decided without
discussing with anyone, right?

02:25:53.396 --> 02:25:54.486
Tell me.

02:25:55.276 --> 02:25:56.396
It's your last time.

02:26:02.306 --> 02:26:07.356
I am dismissing
Dr. Preetham from this hospital.

02:26:21.146 --> 02:26:22.526
He is going to dismiss me.

02:26:23.836 --> 02:26:24.896
It's a good one.

02:26:26.246 --> 02:26:27.396
You are going to dismiss me?

02:26:28.866 --> 02:26:29.816
Yes, sir.

02:26:31.676 --> 02:26:33.146
What is the reason
for dismissing me?

02:26:34.236 --> 02:26:35.356
There are many reasons.

02:26:35.766 --> 02:26:40.716
For instance, take Arun
from the administration team.

02:26:41.096 --> 02:26:44.566
Did you think that he had
been working for you for so long?

02:26:47.066 --> 02:26:47.916
No, sir.

02:26:48.996 --> 02:26:52.446
He too worked
for the hospital, like you.

02:26:53.096 --> 02:26:55.396
But there is a small difference.

02:26:56.706 --> 02:26:58.196
He honestly told me

02:26:58.596 --> 02:27:00.856
that you asked him to change

02:27:02.016 --> 02:27:03.466
the revenue numbers
of the administration.

02:27:05.696 --> 02:27:06.736
The proof for that

02:27:09.946 --> 02:27:10.856
is in these files.

02:27:12.786 --> 02:27:13.776
Not only that.

02:27:14.056 --> 02:27:17.476
If a new doctor has
joined the hospital

02:27:17.646 --> 02:27:21.146
you should've supported him as the
chief doctor and encouraged them.

02:27:21.706 --> 02:27:24.566
But you couldn't even accept that.

02:27:25.526 --> 02:27:29.196
When the same doctor tried
to help you in your cases

02:27:30.396 --> 02:27:32.026
you didn't listen to them at all.

02:27:33.286 --> 02:27:35.856
You gave the wrong medication
and proceeded with it. Wait.

02:27:37.816 --> 02:27:40.486
And, even when the nurses
went on a strike

02:27:40.746 --> 02:27:43.526
you should have talked
to them and convinced them.

02:27:43.886 --> 02:27:44.946
But you didn't do that.

02:27:45.286 --> 02:27:46.446
You stepped back.

02:27:47.866 --> 02:27:48.696
Sir.

02:27:49.226 --> 02:27:52.536
Did you think I don't know
that you are trying

02:27:52.976 --> 02:27:54.646
to kick Dr. Radhi
out of the hospital?

02:28:00.186 --> 02:28:03.856
I don't think you are
a team player, Mr. Preetham.

02:28:06.356 --> 02:28:07.276
Okay.

02:28:08.336 --> 02:28:12.106
No one here will accept
your decision.

02:28:12.696 --> 02:28:13.896
Who should accept it?

02:28:14.976 --> 02:28:16.146
Okay.

02:28:17.206 --> 02:28:20.526
Since you are asking me,
I will ask everyone here.

02:28:21.216 --> 02:28:22.106
Okay?

02:28:27.946 --> 02:28:30.726
Who all think that Dr. Preetham

02:28:31.366 --> 02:28:35.236
should not work in this hospital?

02:29:54.276 --> 02:29:55.316
What is this, sir?

02:29:56.446 --> 02:30:01.486
You said confidently that
no one would accept my decision.

02:30:02.606 --> 02:30:04.856
Now, everyone has
raised their hands.

02:30:09.586 --> 02:30:11.886
I don't have to go
to everyone and tell them

02:30:11.986 --> 02:30:14.816
that I am doing good
for the hospital.

02:30:15.456 --> 02:30:16.646
If your work was good

02:30:17.606 --> 02:30:20.196
everyone would've taken
your side automatically.

02:30:22.196 --> 02:30:25.486
And I didn't dismiss you
with this evidence alone.

02:30:28.836 --> 02:30:30.736
If there is someone
like you in this hospital

02:30:33.576 --> 02:30:36.736
it is very dangerous for my staff.

02:30:38.576 --> 02:30:44.776
After this meeting,
you are relieved from RK Hospital.

02:31:01.086 --> 02:31:03.696
I trusted you, and you just
did what you wanted, right?

02:31:04.486 --> 02:31:05.526
Not bad.

02:31:05.686 --> 02:31:08.556
You pretended to be my friend
and stabbed me in the back.

02:31:08.726 --> 02:31:09.566
Sir.

02:31:09.926 --> 02:31:13.896
If I had supported you, they
would have dismissed me too.

02:31:13.966 --> 02:31:14.816
Hello!

02:31:15.396 --> 02:31:17.946
You were the first one
to raise your hand. Okay?

02:31:18.806 --> 02:31:21.946
He had already decided to fire you
before entering the conference room.

02:31:21.946 --> 02:31:24.356
So, did you get me fired
so that you don't get caught?

02:31:24.776 --> 02:31:27.486
Sir, if I hadn't raised my hand

02:31:27.556 --> 02:31:30.786
they would have fired me
along with you, for supporting you.

02:31:30.906 --> 02:31:31.786
Then,

02:31:32.026 --> 02:31:35.856
there would be no one on the inside
to help us or support us.

02:31:38.366 --> 02:31:43.566
Also, you told me so confidently
that you had convinced everyone.

02:31:44.346 --> 02:31:47.396
So, I didn't think
of any alternative plans.

02:31:52.006 --> 02:31:54.526
Be happy that
I raised my hand, sir.

02:31:56.326 --> 02:31:58.356
Even if you go out, I will be here.

02:31:58.736 --> 02:32:02.066
So, I will inform you
about what is happening here.

02:32:02.236 --> 02:32:04.986
Seriously,
we shouldn't let them go easily.

02:32:05.566 --> 02:32:06.486
Don't let them go.

02:32:06.956 --> 02:32:09.026
I will help you from here.

02:32:09.746 --> 02:32:11.816
Sir, we are on the same team.

02:32:13.216 --> 02:32:14.106
Trust me.

02:32:14.646 --> 02:32:16.666
You helped me the other day.

02:32:16.796 --> 02:32:17.976
Now, it's my turn.

02:32:18.106 --> 02:32:19.896
Don't worry about anything.

02:32:21.406 --> 02:32:22.606
I will tell you the right time.

02:32:22.696 --> 02:32:24.986
You can come back
to the hospital at that time.

02:32:29.276 --> 02:32:30.196
Right.

02:32:31.896 --> 02:32:33.816
I will go take care
of the formalities.

02:33:48.786 --> 02:33:51.796
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

02:33:53.826 --> 02:33:56.346
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

02:33:58.886 --> 02:34:01.636
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

02:34:03.616 --> 02:34:05.896
♪ Our patience wins ♪

02:34:06.016 --> 02:34:08.466
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

02:34:08.576 --> 02:34:11.216
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

02:34:11.366 --> 02:34:13.976
♪ I am a doctor ♪

02:34:16.316 --> 02:34:19.146
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

02:34:21.386 --> 02:34:24.066
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

02:34:26.036 --> 02:34:30.296
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

02:34:43.316 --> 02:34:44.256
Hi.

02:34:46.376 --> 02:34:49.256
I thought you won't come here
after Amaya scolded you.

02:34:49.326 --> 02:34:50.226
But how?

02:34:50.466 --> 02:34:52.106
You are here, shamelessly.

02:34:52.686 --> 02:34:54.866
Of course, it is shameful..

02:34:55.236 --> 02:34:57.766
But how can I not help our Amaya?

02:34:57.876 --> 02:34:59.146
May I come in?

02:34:59.686 --> 02:35:00.516
Come.

02:35:03.946 --> 02:35:06.266
Is it okay now?
Amaya, are you fine?

02:35:07.556 --> 02:35:08.686
What are you saying?

02:35:08.846 --> 02:35:10.976
How can I not help our Amaya?

02:35:11.616 --> 02:35:13.386
Abhi.
- Sit down.

02:35:13.646 --> 02:35:16.516
You're teasing me way too much.
I'll deal with you later.

02:35:17.956 --> 02:35:19.146
Why did you come here, Kamal?

02:35:19.626 --> 02:35:22.066
I came to help Amaya as a doctor.

02:35:23.196 --> 02:35:24.606
Are you an orthopedic doctor?

02:35:24.656 --> 02:35:27.976
Even an MBBS doctor
can treat fractures.

02:35:28.046 --> 02:35:29.266
Show me your leg.

02:35:30.236 --> 02:35:31.186
Okay.

02:35:32.026 --> 02:35:33.896
Does it hurt?
- No.

02:35:34.026 --> 02:35:35.766
That means you are healing well.

02:35:35.976 --> 02:35:37.186
You will get well soon.

02:35:38.486 --> 02:35:42.066
Did anyone tell you what happened
at the hospital recently? - Why?

02:35:42.406 --> 02:35:44.726
Did they fire you
for helping Amaya?

02:35:45.396 --> 02:35:47.276
Looks like you want it
to happen, Abhi.

02:35:47.386 --> 02:35:48.316
Why you little..

02:35:48.846 --> 02:35:50.226
Abhi, keep quiet.

02:35:53.286 --> 02:35:57.026
Mr. Arjun fired Dr. Preetham
who wanted to fire you.

02:35:59.306 --> 02:36:01.146
Don't get excited.

02:36:01.336 --> 02:36:04.326
He had already manipulated
the hospital records.

02:36:04.426 --> 02:36:07.526
Not only that, he tried to remove
Mr. Arjun from his post.

02:36:07.596 --> 02:36:09.516
Mr. Arjun had been
watching everything.

02:36:09.776 --> 02:36:12.106
He brought forward
all the evidence at the last minute

02:36:12.266 --> 02:36:14.436
and shut his mouth.

02:36:14.746 --> 02:36:17.686
I have created a big problem.

02:36:18.816 --> 02:36:19.686
Leave it.

02:36:19.826 --> 02:36:20.896
It's okay.

02:36:21.076 --> 02:36:23.566
I saw the prescription
when I came last time.

02:36:24.006 --> 02:36:26.416
The medicines would be over by now.

02:36:26.756 --> 02:36:28.606
So, I bought it from the pharmacy.

02:36:29.236 --> 02:36:30.396
I came to give it to you.

02:36:30.816 --> 02:36:33.936
I have told you many
times not to help me.

02:36:35.386 --> 02:36:36.606
I don't want these medicines.

02:36:37.646 --> 02:36:38.646
What do you mean?

02:36:38.796 --> 02:36:41.996
You don't want it
but Abhi is taking it.

02:36:43.186 --> 02:36:44.436
Anyway, forget that.

02:36:44.976 --> 02:36:46.746
I will keep the medicines here.

02:36:47.156 --> 02:36:48.776
Please take them on time.

02:36:49.566 --> 02:36:50.976
Have it till you feel better.

02:36:52.086 --> 02:36:53.226
I will leave now.

02:36:54.366 --> 02:36:57.066
Abhi, I wanted
to ask you something.

02:36:57.246 --> 02:36:58.936
Can I get your number?
- What?

02:36:59.066 --> 02:37:02.456
I know someone who
might be able to employ you.

02:37:02.536 --> 02:37:05.146
So, I wanted to tell you.
- Why are you doing all this?

02:37:06.606 --> 02:37:08.246
I happen to help Amaya.

02:37:08.826 --> 02:37:10.686
What's wrong in helping her family?

02:37:10.936 --> 02:37:12.496
Oh, is it?

02:37:12.586 --> 02:37:14.746
My family has a debt
of Rs. 5 lakhs.

02:37:14.806 --> 02:37:16.976
Abhi, keep quiet.

02:37:18.356 --> 02:37:19.396
Give it to me.

02:37:21.176 --> 02:37:22.416
Okay.
- Thanks.

02:37:22.776 --> 02:37:25.146
I will send you the contact, don't
forget to send them your resume.

02:37:26.726 --> 02:37:27.726
Okay.

02:37:28.896 --> 02:37:29.726
Take care.

02:37:31.976 --> 02:37:32.896
Bye.

02:37:33.566 --> 02:37:34.936
Take care, bye.

02:37:39.256 --> 02:37:42.476
Amaya, tell me if you
not willing to marry Kamal.

02:37:43.146 --> 02:37:44.606
Why?
- I will marry him.

02:37:52.746 --> 02:37:53.566
Reena.

02:37:53.756 --> 02:37:54.666
Reena.

02:37:58.106 --> 02:37:58.976
Sorry.

02:37:59.516 --> 02:38:01.446
You don't have to say sorry.

02:38:01.566 --> 02:38:03.336
If I accept, you will
ask me out again.

02:38:03.576 --> 02:38:05.896
No, I won't ask you out.

02:38:07.106 --> 02:38:11.056
When I came to know that you spoke
well about me, I got emotional.

02:38:12.066 --> 02:38:13.956
But now I know
what's on your mind.

02:38:14.106 --> 02:38:15.606
Henceforth, I won't disturb you.

02:38:16.946 --> 02:38:18.016
You can trust me, Reena.

02:38:19.896 --> 02:38:20.726
Can I trust you?

02:38:21.476 --> 02:38:22.726
You won't trouble me again, right?

02:38:23.356 --> 02:38:25.226
Sure?
- Sure.

02:38:26.786 --> 02:38:27.606
Okay, then.

02:38:28.086 --> 02:38:29.106
I forgive you.

02:38:29.416 --> 02:38:30.476
Reena.

02:38:31.886 --> 02:38:34.016
Why don't we end this
on a good note?

02:38:35.536 --> 02:38:36.356
How?

02:38:36.436 --> 02:38:37.626
Don't look at me like that.

02:38:37.836 --> 02:38:38.976
I won't ask you out.

02:38:39.986 --> 02:38:40.816
Then?

02:38:40.956 --> 02:38:45.146
Why don't we end this with a hug?

02:38:49.016 --> 02:38:50.356
Hey, it's just a friendly hug.

02:38:50.736 --> 02:38:51.646
I can't do that.

02:38:51.736 --> 02:38:52.976
Why did I even forgive you!

02:38:53.066 --> 02:38:54.186
Get lost.
- Reena.

02:38:54.566 --> 02:38:56.856
Reena!
- Idiot. He wants to hug.

02:38:59.076 --> 02:38:59.976
Hey, Nilofer.

02:39:02.356 --> 02:39:03.186
Hey.

02:39:06.736 --> 02:39:07.856
Sir, one tea.

02:39:08.066 --> 02:39:09.266
Tea? I'll get it.

02:39:09.766 --> 02:39:10.726
Hey, Nilofer.

02:39:12.446 --> 02:39:14.516
Why are you ignoring me?

02:39:16.936 --> 02:39:20.356
I just asked to end it
on a good note with Reena.

02:39:21.196 --> 02:39:22.266
Nothing else.

02:39:26.546 --> 02:39:27.476
Take it.

02:39:32.606 --> 02:39:35.786
Nilofer, I think you
misunderstood me.

02:39:36.426 --> 02:39:37.566
I didn't misunderstand you.

02:39:38.946 --> 02:39:39.856
I can see that.

02:39:40.406 --> 02:39:43.316
I was just telling her
that I won't disturb her.

02:39:44.036 --> 02:39:45.146
Trust me, Nilofer.

02:39:47.046 --> 02:39:48.976
Hey, please, Nilofer.

02:39:49.106 --> 02:39:51.566
Don't be cross with me.
It doesn't look good.

02:39:53.956 --> 02:39:55.066
I'm begging you.

02:39:55.316 --> 02:39:56.626
Won't you consider me?

02:40:00.526 --> 02:40:01.476
Your ex-boyfriend.

02:40:01.776 --> 02:40:02.976
Is this how he begs?

02:40:04.536 --> 02:40:07.146
We'd call him an ex if it was
a breakup when he was alive.

02:40:08.376 --> 02:40:09.476
I didn't break up with him.

02:40:09.856 --> 02:40:10.766
He's dead.

02:40:11.106 --> 02:40:12.186
So, don't call him my ex.

02:40:12.836 --> 02:40:14.266
Okay, sorry.

02:40:14.356 --> 02:40:15.356
I won't say it.

02:40:16.566 --> 02:40:17.936
Let's get back to our topic.

02:40:18.656 --> 02:40:20.266
See, I didn't do anything wrong.

02:40:20.556 --> 02:40:21.976
Even then, I'm sorry.

02:40:22.416 --> 02:40:23.236
Okay?

02:40:23.576 --> 02:40:24.516
Is it okay now?

02:40:25.006 --> 02:40:27.496
You can talk to anyone you want.

02:40:27.726 --> 02:40:29.226
Why are you apologising to me?

02:40:29.606 --> 02:40:31.066
I made it clear to you
the other day.

02:40:31.386 --> 02:40:32.646
I don't care about you.

02:40:33.816 --> 02:40:35.146
How could you say that?

02:40:35.346 --> 02:40:36.856
Nilofer..

02:40:40.546 --> 02:40:42.766
The senior doctor
is inside, ask her.

02:40:42.816 --> 02:40:44.146
Okay, Doctor.
- Doctor.

02:40:47.686 --> 02:40:48.506
Tell me.

02:40:48.616 --> 02:40:51.066
Do you know where Dr. Rocky is?

02:40:51.566 --> 02:40:52.476
Rocky?

02:40:53.146 --> 02:40:54.956
He must be in the interns' room,
I'll take you there.

02:40:56.316 --> 02:40:57.976
You're going to meet Dr. Rocky.

02:40:58.186 --> 02:40:59.266
Be careful.

02:40:59.596 --> 02:41:01.646
Why?
- His patients are all girls.

02:41:01.766 --> 02:41:03.356
They're fair-skinned.
- Fair-skinned girls?

02:41:03.476 --> 02:41:05.726
What?
- Let me finish, don't interrupt.

02:41:06.266 --> 02:41:08.386
He generally treat female patients.

02:41:08.476 --> 02:41:10.536
He won't leave until he gets your
number if it's a pretty girl like you.

02:41:10.646 --> 02:41:12.146
That's why
I'm telling you, be careful.

02:41:13.016 --> 02:41:15.266
Why? Doesn't he
treat male patients?

02:41:15.756 --> 02:41:18.226
He doesn't even look at them.
He wants only girls.

02:41:18.456 --> 02:41:20.226
Got it? Be careful.
- Oh.

02:41:20.826 --> 02:41:21.646
Let's go.

02:41:21.896 --> 02:41:24.566
Does he really ask
for girls' numbers?

02:41:25.016 --> 02:41:26.266
I don't know who you are.

02:41:26.516 --> 02:41:29.126
And yet I'm asking you
to be careful.

02:41:29.316 --> 02:41:30.476
Why would I lie?

02:41:30.636 --> 02:41:32.646
Come on, but be careful.

02:41:32.876 --> 02:41:33.796
Come on.

02:41:35.876 --> 02:41:38.516
It's so nice to sit
in a wheel chair. - Hey.

02:41:38.606 --> 02:41:41.056
What's up? Who?
- There's a girl waiting for you.

02:41:45.816 --> 02:41:46.646
Charu.

02:41:47.136 --> 02:41:48.106
What a surprise!

02:41:48.226 --> 02:41:49.726
Is it a dream?

02:41:52.336 --> 02:41:55.836
Hey, I just asked
if it was a dream.

02:41:55.996 --> 02:41:57.396
Why did you slap me?

02:41:57.756 --> 02:41:58.896
It hurts.

02:41:59.016 --> 02:42:00.476
Why did you slap him?

02:42:01.816 --> 02:42:03.436
This is the reflection
of what you said.

02:42:04.396 --> 02:42:06.666
Hey! What did you tell her?

02:42:06.916 --> 02:42:09.226
Charu, what he said is a lie.

02:42:09.626 --> 02:42:10.526
Charu.

02:42:10.746 --> 02:42:11.606
Your girlfriend.

02:42:11.906 --> 02:42:13.896
I told her the truth.

02:42:13.936 --> 02:42:15.526
Did you just find out?

02:42:15.576 --> 02:42:17.146
Get lost.
- Rocky..

02:42:17.976 --> 02:42:18.816
Charu.
- Hey..

02:42:18.866 --> 02:42:20.276
He is a fool.
- I'm sorry..

02:42:22.046 --> 02:42:24.636
If possible, ask them
to pay for the medicines.

02:42:24.716 --> 02:42:25.816
Okay, sir.
- If not, it's okay

02:42:26.076 --> 02:42:27.606
Okay?
I'll inform them.

02:42:28.276 --> 02:42:29.076
Thank you.
- Thank you, sir.

02:42:29.596 --> 02:42:30.566
Yeah.

02:42:34.856 --> 02:42:36.226
Hey, nerd.

02:42:37.186 --> 02:42:41.726
I don't think Manasa has done
anything to take over the hospital.

02:42:42.466 --> 02:42:43.856
It's good if she doesn't.

02:42:45.386 --> 02:42:46.976
That is very unlike her.

02:42:47.826 --> 02:42:50.426
But the way she acts..

02:42:50.856 --> 02:42:52.286
Looks..

02:42:54.396 --> 02:42:55.476
I think..

02:42:56.186 --> 02:42:58.116
Instead of firing the CEO..

02:42:58.936 --> 02:43:00.316
She has decided to seduce him.

02:43:00.626 --> 02:43:02.646
Why do you think like this?

02:43:03.396 --> 02:43:04.936
Why shouldn't I think so?

02:43:05.866 --> 02:43:07.766
Manasa looks beautiful.

02:43:08.526 --> 02:43:11.476
If she tries,
she might get a chance.

02:43:14.236 --> 02:43:17.026
Manasa is my sister.
Don't talk about Manasa like that.

02:43:20.646 --> 02:43:21.526
Okay.

02:43:21.716 --> 02:43:23.106
Shall I tell you something?

02:43:23.816 --> 02:43:25.356
"Do we need all this, Teju?"

02:43:25.526 --> 02:43:26.446
Am I right?

02:43:27.136 --> 02:43:28.526
I have something else for you.

02:43:29.616 --> 02:43:32.886
Do you figure out
the solutions for the problems

02:43:32.956 --> 02:43:34.976
or do they find you?

02:43:38.656 --> 02:43:39.776
You are right.

02:43:41.356 --> 02:43:42.976
You are correct.
- Okay.

02:43:43.056 --> 02:43:44.526
Shall we do our duty?

02:43:44.896 --> 02:43:45.726
Come, let's go.

02:43:46.166 --> 02:43:48.306
Okay, come.
- Charu..

02:43:48.406 --> 02:43:49.936
Charu..
- Look there!

02:43:52.566 --> 02:43:53.816
Forgive me, Charu.

02:43:55.536 --> 02:43:58.646
Charu, I didn't do anything
to warrant your anger.

02:43:58.866 --> 02:44:01.036
Kamal has lied to you.

02:44:01.186 --> 02:44:02.366
Forgive me, Charu.

02:44:04.376 --> 02:44:06.316
Hi, Rocky.
- Hi, Rocky.

02:44:06.466 --> 02:44:08.226
Didn't you go to the temple?

02:44:08.686 --> 02:44:10.146
Why are they here?

02:44:12.846 --> 02:44:13.976
Hi.
- Hi.

02:44:14.036 --> 02:44:15.036
Hi, Teju.

02:44:17.416 --> 02:44:19.316
Buddy, I need your help.

02:44:19.496 --> 02:44:20.926
Tell me, what do
you want me to do?

02:44:21.406 --> 02:44:23.646
Can you both leave this place?

02:44:24.066 --> 02:44:24.896
Why?

02:44:25.396 --> 02:44:27.936
Kamal had created
a problem just now.

02:44:30.316 --> 02:44:31.276
Okay.

02:44:31.616 --> 02:44:33.606
Why are you falling
at her feet in public?

02:44:33.776 --> 02:44:34.646
Me?

02:44:35.146 --> 02:44:37.606
That is..
Her earrings had fallen down.

02:44:37.726 --> 02:44:39.936
I was searching for it.
- Where did it fall?

02:44:40.106 --> 02:44:41.066
Nothing like that.

02:44:41.696 --> 02:44:44.826
I came to know what he was
doing when I was not around.

02:44:44.946 --> 02:44:45.776
That's all.

02:44:45.856 --> 02:44:46.816
Oh, no.

02:44:46.876 --> 02:44:49.356
What did you do?
- You were in Mangalore, right?

02:44:49.736 --> 02:44:50.736
Why are you here suddenly?

02:44:50.906 --> 02:44:53.316
I came to see him after my studies.

02:44:53.386 --> 02:44:55.346
Oh.
- I came to surprise him.

02:44:55.426 --> 02:44:57.396
I heard what he did
and I got surprised.

02:44:57.466 --> 02:45:00.106
I came to know what he
did because I came suddenly.

02:45:00.226 --> 02:45:01.396
It worked out well.

02:45:01.506 --> 02:45:05.066
If I had told him, he would
have made a plan to hide it.

02:45:05.256 --> 02:45:07.606
Charu, I don't think that much.

02:45:07.986 --> 02:45:09.686
Oh, no.

02:45:10.426 --> 02:45:13.896
Did you get to know
everything that he did?

02:45:15.906 --> 02:45:16.896
With whom?

02:45:18.356 --> 02:45:19.396
Very good.

02:45:20.376 --> 02:45:22.776
Instead of asking what he did,
you are asking with whom.

02:45:23.126 --> 02:45:24.646
I applaud you.
- Teju..

02:45:25.306 --> 02:45:28.606
Charu, don't believe her.
I didn't do anything.

02:45:30.396 --> 02:45:31.936
She left.

02:45:33.156 --> 02:45:34.056
Hey.

02:45:34.286 --> 02:45:36.026
I'm always alone
in the interns' room.

02:45:36.476 --> 02:45:39.996
Yes.
- Why show up now and not before?

02:45:40.606 --> 02:45:42.026
It's fun.

02:45:43.276 --> 02:45:45.376
Okay, Arjun, see you tomorrow, bye.

02:45:45.486 --> 02:45:46.476
Reena.

02:45:49.716 --> 02:45:51.606
I want to share something with you.

02:45:52.006 --> 02:45:52.896
Tell me, Arjun.

02:45:54.166 --> 02:45:58.726
I want to be relieved
from the CEO position.

02:45:58.836 --> 02:45:59.836
Why?

02:46:00.706 --> 02:46:01.596
I don't know.

02:46:02.136 --> 02:46:03.816
I've been thinking
about it for a long time.

02:46:04.006 --> 02:46:05.026
But why?

02:46:05.686 --> 02:46:08.086
Even when you fired
Dr. Preetham, you were confident

02:46:08.166 --> 02:46:10.376
that you can't be
removed from this position.

02:46:10.986 --> 02:46:12.026
I was confident.

02:46:12.496 --> 02:46:14.966
But somewhere deep inside

02:46:15.566 --> 02:46:18.266
I feel that someone
more experienced than me

02:46:19.106 --> 02:46:21.356
would run this hospital better.

02:46:21.566 --> 02:46:24.396
And I said that I would become
the CEO for my father's sake.

02:46:24.766 --> 02:46:27.796
I was very determined
to become the CEO

02:46:28.216 --> 02:46:29.986
due to the anger and
ego during the process.

02:46:30.766 --> 02:46:32.646
Where is that
determination now, Arjun?

02:46:34.376 --> 02:46:35.936
It didn't fade away, Reena.

02:46:36.926 --> 02:46:38.686
But only after I
came to this position

02:46:38.756 --> 02:46:40.316
did I start to understand
many things.

02:46:41.376 --> 02:46:43.066
Everything is
a learning process, Arjun.

02:46:43.776 --> 02:46:44.776
You are right.

02:46:45.526 --> 02:46:51.066
But for me to learn, why
should the hospital face crises?

02:46:51.836 --> 02:46:55.816
Another thing is that, I don't even
know if I like this job, Reena.

02:46:57.236 --> 02:46:59.476
I came to this position
because of my father.

02:47:01.306 --> 02:47:04.106
But I don't know
if I am enjoying it.

02:47:07.356 --> 02:47:08.216
Okay.

02:47:08.816 --> 02:47:13.066
If you are feeling this way,
then who is the next CEO?

02:47:15.776 --> 02:47:16.686
I don't know.

02:47:17.976 --> 02:47:19.106
I haven't decided yet.

02:47:19.816 --> 02:47:20.856
Look here, Arjun.

02:47:21.446 --> 02:47:23.186
You just fired Dr. Preetham.

02:47:23.646 --> 02:47:25.566
Our hospital doesn't
have a chief doctor now.

02:47:25.696 --> 02:47:27.356
Dr. Radhi will definitely
not agree to this.

02:47:28.586 --> 02:47:31.356
Think about what you can do
to solve this issue first.

02:47:33.506 --> 02:47:34.396
Arjun.

02:47:35.616 --> 02:47:39.106
If you want to step down
from your position, that's fine.

02:47:40.136 --> 02:47:43.726
But before that,
go to someone who is experienced

02:47:43.986 --> 02:47:45.056
and ask their opinion.

02:47:45.156 --> 02:47:46.186
Talk to them.

02:47:46.606 --> 02:47:47.526
Take your time.

02:47:49.296 --> 02:47:50.226
You are right, Reena.

02:47:51.146 --> 02:47:52.276
I am also thinking about it.

02:47:54.196 --> 02:47:55.066
Arjun.

02:47:56.206 --> 02:47:57.726
Don't take everything at a time.

02:47:58.566 --> 02:47:59.726
Sort it out one by one.

02:48:00.416 --> 02:48:01.606
Everything will be solved.

02:48:06.506 --> 02:48:09.026
Okay, I am leaving, bye.

02:48:09.816 --> 02:48:10.746
Bye.

02:48:19.646 --> 02:48:20.606
Don't worry.

02:48:21.066 --> 02:48:22.106
Everything will be fine.

02:48:27.076 --> 02:48:27.976
Bye.

02:48:28.356 --> 02:48:29.186
Bye.

02:48:38.606 --> 02:48:39.496
Radhi.

02:48:40.086 --> 02:48:41.776
I saw Vijay in the supermarket.

02:48:42.366 --> 02:48:44.066
I asked him what he was doing here.

02:48:44.206 --> 02:48:46.776
He said something like
the universe brought him here.

02:48:47.026 --> 02:48:47.976
Stupid fellow.

02:48:50.256 --> 02:48:51.146
Yes.

02:48:51.626 --> 02:48:54.396
I don't know why he has
come here after so many years.

02:48:55.066 --> 02:48:57.976
Already, I am going
through a crucial time.

02:48:58.066 --> 02:48:59.986
On one hand,
Dev has asked for a divorce.

02:49:00.096 --> 02:49:01.276
On the other hand, it's Reena.

02:49:02.566 --> 02:49:04.646
After so many years

02:49:04.896 --> 02:49:09.146
Vijay has come to the hospital
where I work, all of a sudden.

02:49:13.296 --> 02:49:15.276
He told me

02:49:16.246 --> 02:49:18.106
that he has met Dev
and the children.

02:49:18.446 --> 02:49:19.276
Yes.

02:49:19.336 --> 02:49:21.186
He and Dev are friends.
- Friends?

02:49:21.636 --> 02:49:25.056
D-Dev doesn't know who Vijay is.
- Oh, God.

02:49:27.766 --> 02:49:31.646
C-Can I ask you something?

02:49:31.896 --> 02:49:33.226
Sure.

02:49:36.126 --> 02:49:40.316
Reena must not find out
who Vijay is.

02:49:41.536 --> 02:49:43.726
I don't trust Vijay.

02:49:43.766 --> 02:49:45.396
Especially regarding Reena.

02:49:45.536 --> 02:49:46.526
No problem.

02:49:51.086 --> 02:49:56.976
But I have had a question on my
mind ever since Vijay came here.

02:49:59.616 --> 02:50:01.816
After so many years, Vijay
and I are seeing each other.

02:50:02.556 --> 02:50:03.816
He asked about me.

02:50:04.096 --> 02:50:05.686
He spoke about my marriage.

02:50:06.746 --> 02:50:12.156
But he hasn't said
a word about our child..

02:50:13.606 --> 02:50:15.896
He hasn't asked about Reena.

02:50:23.526 --> 02:50:26.356
Anyway, I have to leave
early in the morning.

02:50:30.146 --> 02:50:32.476
I am talking to you.
- Yeah.

02:50:32.816 --> 02:50:33.896
Good night.

02:50:34.556 --> 02:50:35.566
Good night.

